oups, scrambled eggs, rice, frying meat, vegetables and more.","Made of BPA-free, food-grade silicone, these kitchen utensils withstand high heat without melting or warping, making them safe for all cookware surfaces, including nonstick.","These silicone spatulas have a large capacity, making serving and cooking more convenient. The beveled edge design of both spatulas makes flipping, stir frying, mixing, stirring, scooping, and serving easy.","Designed with a long wooden handle, these multifunctional kitchen spatula spoons provide a secure grip, making cooking comfortable and efficient.","Purchase now and enjoy the benefits of these versatile spatulas! In case of any issues, our dedicated customer service team is ready to assist you."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FS5PBX45','5Pcs Silicone Cooking Utensils Set, Heat Resistant Kitchen Tools Include Solid&Slotted Spatula, Cooking Spoon and Pasta Server, Silicone Kitchen Utensils set for Nonstick Cookware Flipping, Black','5pcs-silicone-cooking-utensils-set-heat-resistant-kitchen-to-b0fs5pbx45','Hoosook','Kitchen Tools',12.73,'【100% Food-Safe & Durable Design】Our silicone set is crafted from premium food-grade silicone and high-quality 18/8 stainless steel, free of BPA and non-toxic, ensuring healthy cooking. The robust construction guarantees durability for long-lasting use.Which is the perfect addition to any kitchen, its modern, sleek style fits flawlessly into any kitchen style.. 【Heat-Resistant & Cookware-Safe】Crafted from high heat-resistan silicone, this cooking utensil set stands up to high heat up to 446°F (230°C)—so it won’t melt or warp, even when things heat up. The soft, flexible edges are gentle on all non-stick cookware surfaces, effectively preventing scratches and helping to extend the lifespan of your pots and pans.. 【Practical Design】Features an upgraded ergonomic handle design with a thick silicone sleeve over a sturdy stainless steel core. This provides a comfortable, non-slip grip and excellent heat isolation, protecting your hands from scalds. The thoughtful design ensures a secure and comfortable hold for precise control.. 【Easy-Clean Storage】Our silicone cooking utensils feature a seamless, one-piece construction with a smooth silicone surface that prevents food residue buildup. Whether washed by hand or in the dishwasher, cleanup is quick and effortless. Each utensil includes a hanging hole at the end for convenient drying and organized storage, helping you maintain a tidy kitchen.. 【Versatile 5Pcs Cooking Utensils Set】This 5Pcs kitchen utensils set included all the tools you need for cooking: solid turner, slotted turner, solid cooking spoon, slotted cooking spoon and a pasta server. It perfectly covers all basic cooking tasks like flipping, frying, mixing, Turning, stirring, serving and draining. It''s an ideal and practical choice for daily home cooking and makes a wonderful gift for family and friends.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XNYJEcZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bdHdWpAQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k3Mo9kPaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mbW5ibiXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CFMfWkVCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TkY4I9uxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71inIQeAGfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,115,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FS5PBX45',1778267998,1,NULL,'["【100% Food-Safe & Durable Design】Our silicone set is crafted from premium food-grade silicone and high-quality 18/8 stainless steel, free of BPA and non-toxic, ensuring healthy cooking. The robust construction guarantees durability for long-lasting use.Which is the perfect addition to any kitchen, its modern, sleek style fits flawlessly into any kitchen style.","【Heat-Resistant & Cookware-Safe】Crafted from high heat-resistan silicone, this cooking utensil set stands up to high heat up to 446°F (230°C)—so it won’t melt or warp, even when things heat up. The soft, flexible edges are gentle on all non-stick cookware surfaces, effectively preventing scratches and helping to extend the lifespan of your pots and pans.","【Practical Design】Features an upgraded ergonomic handle design with a thick silicone sleeve over a sturdy stainless steel core. This provides a comfortable, non-slip grip and excellent heat isolation, protecting your hands from scalds. The thoughtful design ensures a secure and comfortable hold for precise control.","【Easy-Clean Storage】Our silicone cooking utensils feature a seamless, one-piece construction with a smooth silicone surface that prevents food residue buildup. Whether washed by hand or in the dishwasher, cleanup is quick and effortless. Each utensil includes a hanging hole at the end for convenient drying and organized storage, helping you maintain a tidy kitchen.","【Versatile 5Pcs Cooking Utensils Set】This 5Pcs kitchen utensils set included all the tools you need for cooking: solid turner, slotted turner, solid cooking spoon, slotted cooking spoon and a pasta server. It perfectly covers all basic cooking tasks like flipping, frying, mixing, Turning, stirring, serving and draining. It''s an ideal and practical choice for daily home cooking and makes a wonderful gift for family and friends."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GF9X6CBS','NutriChef 23-Piece Baking Utensil Collection with Measuring Tools, Silicone Mats, Spatulas, Whisk & Oven Mitts - Complete Kitchen Utensils Set and Baking Tool Set Suitable for Home Bakers','nutrichef-23-piece-baking-utensil-collection-with-measuring-b0gf9x6cbs','NutriChef','Kitchen Tools',47.49,'The NutriChef 23-Piece baking solution is designed to make every baking task easier, safer, and more enjoyable. This complete kitchen utensils set brings together essential tools for measuring, mixing, stirring, scraping, and preparing ingredients with confidence. Whether you are baking cookies, cakes, or pastries, this versatile cooking utensils set supports efficient and organized kitchen prep. Made for everyday use, each kitchen utensil set component is gentle on cookware, making it ideal for baking sets for cooking nonstick surfaces. Flexible silicone spatulas, baking mats, and scrapers protect pans while delivering precise control. Accurate stainless steel measuring cups and spoons ensure consistent results, making this a dependable baking utensils set for beginners and experienced bakers alike. Built from durable silicone, stainless steel, and food-grade materials, these kitchen tools and gadgets are lightweight, stain-resistant, and easy to clean. Heat resistance up to 446°F adds peace of mind during high-temperature baking. Included oven mitts enhance safety and comfort while handling hot trays. From daily recipes to special occasions, this kitchen tools set functions as a reliable cooking and baking utensils set, offering flexibility, durability, and convenience for all your baking needs.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812EGCAiQ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812yOsC8j2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f79UDxLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813gJiGFtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MolO0JZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FTkwMzBsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915QKLWDJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uh+xMCWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,30,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GF9X6CBS',1778268005,1,NULL,'["ALL-IN-ONE BAKING ESSENTIALS - This 23-piece kitchen utensils set covers whisking, stirring, measuring, cutting, and scraping. A versatile cooking and baking utensils set designed for efficient prep, smooth workflow, and everyday baking confidence","NONSTICK SAFE PERFORMANCE - Designed as baking sets for cooking nonstick surfaces, this baking utensil set is gentle on pans and bakeware. Flexible silicone tools prevent scratches, making this kitchen utensil set ideal for modern kitchens","ACCURATE MEASURE & PREP - Includes stainless steel measuring cups and spoons for precise results. This baking utensils set ensures accurate ingredient portions, smoother mixing, & reliable outcomes, making it a dependable kitchen tools set for baking","HEAT-RESISTANT & EASY CLEAN - Built from durable silicone, stainless steel, and food-grade materials, this cooking utensils set resists heat up to 446°F. Dishwasher-safe design allows quick cleanup, keeping your kitchen tools & gadgets ready for use","COMFORT & SAFETY INCLUDED - Oven mitts provide heat protection while flexible spatulas, mats, and tools ensure control. This complete kitchen tools set delivers balance, safety, and flexibility, making it a dependable baking utensil set for all"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B09TT5DX8S','SWOMMOLY Spice Rack Organizer with 32 Glass Spice Jars, 396 Spice Labels, Chalk Marker and Funnel Complete Set, for Cabinet, Countertop, Cupboard or Wall Mount, Black','swommoly-spice-rack-organizer-with-32-glass-spice-jars-396-s-b09tt5dx8s','Symeno Select','Spice & Pantry Tools',29.77,'Complete Spice Rack with Jars Set：1 x4-tier spice rack organizer , 32 x empty glass spice jars, 32 x plastic inner lids, 32 x metal caps, 1 x waterproof spice jar labels set, 1 x silicone funnel, 1 x chalk marker. Spice rack measures 14.8"L x 4.7"W x 12.6"H. Each square spice jar measures 1.8"W x 4.1"H with a 1.2” opening, 4 fluid oz capacity.. Sturdy Rack: Our spice rack is made of high-quality alloy steel, strong and stable. The surface of spice racks are treated by powder electrostatic spraying. Ideal sized spice rack organizer for cabinet, countertop,pantry,cupboard,door or wall mount.. Premium Glass Jar: Our square spice jars are made from lead free and BPA free glass. The glass spice jars lids and caps are airtight, which means all spice jars keep all of your organic spices fresh!. Distinguishable & Easy to Read Spices List: Enjoy 396 spice labels and a chalk marker for easy organization. The most comprehensive 350 labels are pre-printed, 46 labels are blank and reusable for you to fill in with a chalkboard pen and wipe clean as needed!. Keep Your Kitchen Tidy: Organize your spices using our spice rack with jars and labels, which is great for saving your cabinets space and making your spices easy to find. Please feel free to contact us if you have any problems, we are always available to provide professional customer service.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lPFDYWAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oaOaJZU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg",