ur unique glass jar design makes for a beautiful look in your kitchen while also saving space vs. a round or square design jars. Each empty airtight small jars measure 2” tall x 1.75” wide and hold a shy 1/4 cup volume. Our airtight screw lid is designed for preventing any pop off, loose lids issue. Our lids always stay on securely.","ALL ACCESSORY INCLUDED IN ONE BOX: SIFT AND POUR SHAKERS for dual purpose. Pouring out granulated spices and herbs on one side and sprinkling powdered spices on the other. You can season your dishes without getting your hand dirty. TOTAL 320 WATERPROOF & OIL RESISTANT PRE-PRINTED SPICE LABELS, TRANSPARENT & BLACK, INCLUDED. It can be placed on lids or glass bottoms. This is the only spice holder set you''ll ever need. *SPICES ARE NOT INCLUDED*","VERSATILE & MULTIPURPOSE USAGE: You can keep spices on your Fridge, Refrigerator, Back-splash, inside of the pantry, on the side of a cupboard or on any other ignored space in your kitchen. You can mount our spice jars in any directions. Make own Magnetic Spice Rack or Hanging Spice Rack in Kitchen, RV travel trailer, Boat, Mobile Home and any places."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B09TXSJK2Q','Chengu 36 Pack Magnetic Spice Jars for Refrigerator 3 oz Magnetic Spice Containers Stainless Steel Seasoning Tins with Clear Lid, with 72 Pcs Labels Marker and 2 Pens for Grill Kitchen Fridge Rack','chengu-36-pack-magnetic-spice-jars-for-refrigerator-3-oz-mag-b09txsjk2q','CHENGU','Spice & Pantry Tools',43.39,'Features: Rotary export design: Our mini magnetic spice jar has 2 types of export outlet, sift and pour, the amount can be adjusted according to the material, the sift hole can be applied to pour pepper noodles, chili noodles, the pour hole can be applied to pour pepper, star anise. Space saving design: These magnetic spice storage canisters have been designed to minimize space, they can stick to any flat metal surfaces, also can stack and will easily fit into your refrigerator, freezer or cupboard, which enable you to get the kitchen organized and save space in the pantry effectively. Specifications: Material: stainless steel Color: as shown in the picture Size: Diameter: 6 cm/ 2.4 inches Height: 4.5 cm/ 1.8 inches Package includes: 36 x Magnetic spice jars 72 x Spice labels 2 x Marker pens Notes: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The color may exist a slight difference due to different screen displays.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O2YCQe55L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q1A7a+BTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wpwU9L7fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MB3KZw3ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-k9zj4IHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sq2iTp3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4,143,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TXSJK2Q',1778268058,1,NULL,'["All in One Set: you will get 36 packs small magnetic spice jars, 72 pack spice labels and 2 pack marker pens, enough stainless steel spice jars to meet your storage needs for a variety of seasonings, marker pens and labels can mark the seasonings for your convenient storage and organization","Visual Design: the fridge magnet spice tins are designed with a plastic transparent lid, which can easily see the contents of the jar, which is convenient for you to quickly find the right seasoning","Powerful Magnetic Back: the powerful magnetic back allows you to stick these magnetic spice containers to any flat metal surface, including most appliances and refrigerator doors, for easy access and storage, and is organized, making it easy to fix your space in the kitchen","Stainless Steel Material: our magnet spice jar is made of stainless steel, not easy to break, reliable, the diameter is 6 cm/ 2.36 inches, the height is 4.5 cm/ 1.77 inches, it can hold 3oz of your favorite condiments, the appearance is small, easy to carry, very suitable for outdoor barbecue","Multipurpose Spice Set: this 3oz magnetic spice tin set can be applied to store spices, herbs or other condiments for outdoor parties, barbecues, picnics, etc., It is also suitable for storing craft supplies like screws, nuts, or rubber bands, paper clips and other everyday office work small supplies"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0D41TY27R','Vetacsion Set of 16 Magnetic Spice Tins with 4 Metal Wall-Plates,100 Preprinted Seasoning Label Stickers,2 Styles for 3 oz Herb Jars','vetacsion-set-of-16-magnetic-spice-tins-with-4-metal-wall-pl-b0d41ty27r','Vetacsion','Spice & Pantry Tools',52.98,'Unique Lid Design A transparent lid is very convenient for finding the right spice quickly and has a rotating design with sift or pour holes. Four small holes let you add spices to foods and a large hole is ideal for mixing and cooking. Strong Magnetic Back These storage jars have magnetic backs which are thickened,comparing with same products from others. They can be firmly attach on your any flat metal surface. Multi-purpose Spice Container The tins are not only for storing herbs, spices and other seasonings but also perfect for store and organize art and craft supplies, screws,rubber bands, paper clips and other small office supplies.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xvL87-QFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+bER4msSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KJWnxqV6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZAfDh082L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qGhkmgfaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rTtwSI9lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HcPVnGtdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLB5Kwo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWf-J6NiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,393,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D41TY27R',1778268066,1,NULL,'["8 x Magnetic Spice Boxes with 2 x Metal Wall Plates, 100 x Pre-Printed Labels","Measures 2.48 inches in diameter x 2 inches tall, 85 g","Strong magnet inserted on the back","Clear Window Cover","2 types of discharge ports"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B07TB3ZHWM','Barista Warrior Gooseneck Kettle with Built-In Thermometer for Pour Over Coffee & Tea - 1L Stainless Steel Kettle Stovetop Safe with Precision Spout - Copper Coated Stainless Steel','barista-warrior-gooseneck-kettle-with-built-in-thermometer-f-b07tb3zhwm','Barista Warrior','Coffee & Tea',56.11,'Precision Pouring - This gooseneck kettle for pour over coffee features a curved spout that gives you complete control over water flow speed and placement, ensuring even saturation of grounds for richer, more flavorful extraction. Temperature Mastery - Built-in thermometer on this pour over coffee kettle lets you hit the ideal 195-205°F brewing range every time, preventing burnt or under-extracted coffee so you get cafe-quality results at home with ease. Universal Compatibility - This stovetop gooseneck kettle works on gas, electric, induction, and all other stove top surfaces, giving you the flexibility to brew exceptional pour over coffee no matter what kitchen setup you have. Rust-Resistant Build - Triple-layer metal base construction on this coffee gooseneck kettle prevents leaks and corrosion over years of daily use, so you can count on consistent performance without the deterioration of inferior pots. Optimal Capacity - Holds 1.0 liters with a recommended 0.7 liters boil capacity in this goose neck pour over kettle, giving you enough water for multiple cups while preventing overflow and ensuring safe, controlled heating every brew','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611yl+qNwIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yUYGTWGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hMFlITruL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+yuZ66TqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GV0FOJ2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810DmX1ZHAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81siTtSZJRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,4228,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TB3ZHWM',1778268090,1,NULL,'["Precision Pouring - This gooseneck kettle for pour over coffee features a curved spout that gives you complete control over water flow speed and placement, ensuring even saturation of grounds for richer, more flavorful extraction","Temperature Mastery - Built-in thermometer on this pour over coffee kettle lets you hit the ideal 195-205°F brewing range every time, preventing burnt or under-extracted coffee so you get cafe-quality results at home with ease","Universal Compatibility - This stovetop gooseneck kettle works on gas, electric, induction, and all other stove top surfaces, giving you the flexibility to brew exceptional pour over coffee no matter what kitchen setup you have","Rust-Resistant Build - Triple-layer metal base construction on this coffee gooseneck kettle prevents leaks and corrosion over years of daily use, so you can count on consistent performance without the deterioration of inferior pots","Optimal Capacity - Holds 1.0 liters with a recommended 0.7 liters boil capacity in this goose neck pour over kettle, giving you enough water for multiple cups while preventing overflow and ensuring safe, controlled heating every brew"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B08LDZ9TR5','Brewista Artisan Electric Gooseneck Kettle, Water Boiler with LCD Panel, Precise Temperature Control, Fast Boiling and Keep Warm Settings for Pour-Over Coffee & Tea, Café, 1 Liter (All Black)','brewista-artisan-electric-gooseneck-kettle-water-boiler-with-b08ldz9tr5','Brewista','Coffee & Tea',159.99,'STYLE MEETS QUALITY: This gooseneck kettle blends sleek design with precise performance. Crafted from durable stainless steel for lasting performance, it’s ideal for coffee enthusiasts who appreciate both aesthetics and quality.. PRECISION IN EVERY POUR: Designed for precision, the gooseneck spout ensures a controlled, even flow of water, while the ergonomic handle offers a secure grip for steady, accurate pouring.. ACCURACY AT YOUR FINGERTIPS: Achieve pinpoint accuracy with 1-degree adjustments. The LCD console helps you unlock the full potential of different roasts, grinds, and steeped teas.. FLASH BOIL SETTING: Reduce wait time with Brewista''s fast-boiling kettle, streamlining your coffee routine. The integrated timer ensures optimal flavor extraction for a richer taste.. WARMTH ON DEMAND: The keep-warm setting preserves the ideal water temperature, so your coffee remains perfectly warm for longer—no need to reheat.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K13opbO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ANbuzg4OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CxgViLULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CBNS8AyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617609RMrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,177,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LDZ9TR5',1778268096,1,NULL,'["STYLE MEETS QUALITY: This gooseneck kettle blends sleek design with precise performance. Crafted from durable stainless steel for lasting performance, it’s ideal for coffee enthusiasts who appreciate both aesthetics and quality.","PRECISION IN EVERY POUR: Designed for precision, the gooseneck spout ensures a controlled, even flow of water, while the ergonomic handle offers a secure grip for steady, accurate pouring.","ACCURACY AT YOUR FINGERTIPS: Achieve pinpoint accuracy with 1-degree adjustments. The LCD console helps you unlock the full potential of different roasts, grinds, and steeped teas.","FLASH BOIL SETTING: Reduce wait time with Brewista''s fast-boiling kettle, streamlining your coffee routine. The integrated timer ensures optimal flavor extraction for a richer taste.","WARMTH ON DEMAND: The keep-warm setting preserves the ideal water temperature, so your coffee remains perfectly warm for longer—no need to reheat."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B005YR0F40','Bonavita 1L Digital Variable Temperature Gooseneck Electric Kettle for Coffee Brew and Tea Precise Pour Control, 6 Preset Temps, Café or Home Use, 1200 Watt, LED Panel, Stainless Steel','bonavita-1l-digital-variable-temperature-gooseneck-electric-b005yr0f40','Bonavita','Coffee & Tea',99.99,'Precision Temperature - Fine-tune your brew with 1-degree accuracy (140˚F–208˚F / 60˚C–98˚C), or simply use the Temp Set Button to choose from 6 preset options for effortless perfection in every cup.. Precision Flow - The gooseneck spout delivers a controlled, steady stream, while the ergonomic handle ensures every pour feels balanced and secure.. Precision Quality - Crafted from 304 stainless steel and BPA-free virgin plastics, this kettle is built for safe use and lasting durability.. Precision Timing - With 1200 watts of power, your water reaches a boil in just 5 minutes. When inspiration strikes, your brew is ready with no waiting required.. Precision Heat Hold - Enjoy up to 60 minutes of temperature hold. Brewing becomes a calm and mindful ritual, never a rushed routine.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X0CfJgo7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wS7jVFq0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ICDYGFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fkO3YlL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nhYSQ-MhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dzc7ubsNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eDtkXp5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,7201,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005YR0F40',1778268104,1,NULL,'["Precision Temperature - Fine-tune your brew with 1-degree accuracy (140˚F–208˚F / 60˚C–98˚C), or simply use the Temp Set Button to choose from 6 preset options for effortless perfection in every cup.","Precision Flow - The gooseneck spout delivers a controlled, steady stream, while the ergonomic handle ensures every pour feels balanced and secure.","Precision Quality - Crafted from 304 stainless steel and BPA-free virgin plastics, this kettle is built for safe use and lasting durability.","Precision Timing - With 1200 watts of power, your water reaches a boil in just 5 minutes. When inspiration strikes, your brew is ready with no waiting required.","Precision Heat Hold - Enjoy up to 60 minutes of temperature hold. Brewing becomes a calm and mindful ritual, never a rushed routine."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GY6D88R6','Personalized Engraved Cutting Board Gift Set with Coasters – Custom Family Name Bamboo Kitchen Board – Wedding, Housewarming, Engagement, Housewarming, Couples Bride Gift, Gift Idea for Couples Bride','personalized-engraved-cutting-board-gift-set-with-coasters-c-b0gy6d88r6','AZSEOM','Dining & Entertaining',15.99,'Make every kitchen feel like home with this beautifully Personalized Engraved Cutting Board Gift Set—a meaningful keepsake designed to celebrate love, family, and new beginnings. Crafted from premium natural bamboo, this custom cutting board is more than just a kitchen essential—it''s a lasting memory engraved with your family name, special date, or meaningful message. Whether you''re celebrating a wedding, anniversary, housewarming, or bridal shower, this elegant set turns everyday moments into something unforgettable. Paired with stylish matching coasters and presented in a luxury gift-ready box, this set is thoughtfully designed to impress from the moment it’s opened. The precision engraving ensures a clean, timeless look that won’t fade, making it a gift that will be cherished for years. Perfect for couples, newlyweds, or anyone who loves personalized home décor, this cutting board adds warmth and character to any kitchen while being functional for serving, prepping, or display. 💖 Why You’ll Love It ✔ Fully customizable with names, dates, or special text ✔ Premium bamboo wood – durable, eco-friendly & food-safe ✔ Deep, permanent engraving that won’t fade ✔ You can Includes elegant matching coasters for a complete gift set ✔ Comes in a luxury gift box – ready to gift, no wrapping needed ✔ Perfect for weddings, anniversaries, housewarmings & holidays 🎁 A Gift That Feels Personal Skip the generic gifts—give something meaningful. This personalized cutting board set is a thoughtful way to celebrate life’s biggest moments and create lasting memories in the heart of every home.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MZEf1CHEL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ga-GafvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hg9fkzriL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811I2cgUQ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wEWBzjlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819P6jkSlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HYK8eYy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912RlWgqooL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816khr1vQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',5,1,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GY6D88R6',1778268121,1,NULL,'["PERFECT PERSONALIZED GIFT SET Gifting ready and comes with a premium gift box included, beautifully packaged to create a memorable unboxing experience and truly wow your giftee from the moment it arrives. A thoughtful custom gift for weddings, housewarmings, anniversaries, and special occasions—beautifully functional and memorable.","HIGH-QUALITY NATURAL MATERIALS Crafted from eco-friendly bamboo and elegant wood/marble coasters—durable, food-safe, and designed to last.","FUNCTIONAL JUICE GROOVE & SIDE HANDLES Designed with a deep juice groove to catch liquids and built-in side handles for easy lifting and serving—perfect for meats, fruits, and charcuterie.","PREMIUM COASTER SET – TWO SHAPES Includes stylish coasters available in round (3.9\" diameter) or hexagon (3.9\" width x 3.3\" height) designs, with a 0.39\" thickness for durability and a premium feel.","LARGE & DURABLE CUTTING BOARD Generously sized at 15.5\" x 11\" x 1\" thick, this sturdy bamboo cutting board provides plenty of space for chopping, serving, and display—built strong for everyday kitchen use","Made with top-quality bamboo and precision laser engraving, this personalized cutting board offers exceptional durability and a design that lasts a lifetime."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GL819L7T','VIVIGU Bamboo Cutting Boards for Kitchen, 3-Piece Wood Cutting Board with Juice Grooves, Durable Wooden Chopping Boards Set for Meal Prep, Meat, Vegetables, Fruits, Serving, Kitchen Essentials','vivigu-bamboo-cutting-boards-for-kitchen-3-piece-wood-cuttin-b0gl819l7t','vivigu','Dining & Entertaining',25.99,'Premium Natural Bamboo & Lasting Strength: Crafted from natural bamboo and treated through a high-temperature carbonization, this cutting board boasts exceptional resistance to moisture, odors, and cracking. The dense, non-porous surface of each wood cutting board, making it more durable than ordinary boards. It protects knife edges and stays smooth through everyday use. 3-Piece Value Set: The VIVIGU Cutting boards set includes three different sizes(15×10, 12×8, and 9×6 in), offering ample versatility to handle a wide range of kitchen tasks. Whether you are chopping vegetables, carving meats, or plating fruit and bread for serving, this set handles it all with ease—making every meal preparation simpler and more efficient. Thoughtful Juice Groove Design: Each wood cutting board for kitchen features a deep juice groove running around the perimeter. When you carve a steak, slice a watermelon, or chop moist vegetables on the wooden cutting board, the liquids naturally flow into the groove instead of spilling onto your counter. Keeps countertops neat and your presentation stylish. Portable Handle & Easy to Clean: This cutting board features a hidden handle design, allowing you to effortlessly transport ingredients for plating. The unique hollowed-out hanging hole design facilitates hanging for storage or drip-drying. Simply rinse and air dry for effortless daily maintenance. Ideal for Home Decor & Gifting: This cutting board set will add a touch of warmth and style to any kitchen style. Our bamboo cutting boards combine durability, eco-friendliness and elegance. A perfect practical and thoughtful gift for weddings, housewarmings, or holidays','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tqlrL4khL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qRnYfm55L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iko-7RhAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710tDKyjD7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SXL6gULnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A1Z5Ng0nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f5R1+LecL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,27,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GL819L7T',1778268128,1,NULL,'["Premium Natural Bamboo & Lasting Strength: Crafted from natural bamboo and treated through a high-temperature carbonization, this cutting board boasts exceptional resistance to moisture, odors, and cracking. The dense, non-porous surface of each wood cutting board, making it more durable than ordinary boards. It protects knife edges and stays smooth through everyday use","3-Piece Value Set: The VIVIGU Cutting boards set includes three different sizes(15×10, 12×8, and 9×6 in), offering ample versatility to handle a wide range of kitchen tasks. Whether you are chopping vegetables, carving meats, or plating fruit and bread for serving, this set handles it all with ease—making every meal preparation simpler and more efficient","Thoughtful Juice Groove Design: Each wood cutting board for kitchen features a deep juice groove running around the perimeter. When you carve a steak, slice a watermelon, or chop moist vegetables on the wooden cutting board, the liquids naturally flow into the groove instead of spilling onto your counter. Keeps countertops neat and your presentation stylish","Portable Handle & Easy to Clean: This cutting board features a hidden handle design, allowing you to effortlessly transport ingredients for plating. The unique hollowed-out hanging hole design facilitates hanging for storage or drip-drying. Simply rinse and air dry for effortless daily maintenance","Ideal for Home Decor & Gifting: This cutting board set will add a touch of warmth and style to any kitchen style. Our bamboo cutting boards combine durability, eco-friendliness and elegance. A perfect practical and thoughtful gift for weddings, housewarmings, or holidays"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0G9RGRSB3','Fibogollo Bamboo Cutting Boards Serving Board Set, Bamboo Chopping Boards with Juice Groove for Kitchen Meal Prep and Serving (set of 3)','fibogollo-bamboo-cutting-boards-serving-board-set-bamboo-cho-b0g9rgrsb3','Fibogollo','Dining & Entertaining',17.99,'【Vertically Laminated bamboo,Stability and Durability】Our bamboo cutting board is crafted from vertically laminated bamboo, which is significantly more durable and resistant to warping compared to boards made with horizontal lamination, ensuring a stronger and longer-lasting kitchen tool.. 【Thermal Carbonization Process, Elevating Quality 】 This cutting board undergoes a high-temperature thermal carbonization process at 500°F. Compared to ordinary boards, this process removes moisture and impurities, making it less prone to warping and cracking. Consequently, it better withstands the various pressures encountered during daily use.The thermal carbonization enhances the board’s performance while creating a unique rich, dark hue that seamlessly complements kitchens of any décor style.. 【Practical Built-in Handles】These cutting boards feature built-in handles that maintain a smooth surface while offering a secure grip. The design ensures effortless handling—whether you''re pulling the board from your cabinet, carrying it to the sink after prep, or transporting ingredients like a serving tray. They strike the perfect balance between functionality and streamlined aesthetics.. 【Thermal Carbonization Process, Elevating Quality 】 This cutting board undergoes a high-temperature thermal carbonization process at 500°F. Compared to ordinary boards, this process removes moisture and impurities, making it less prone to warping and cracking. Consequently, it better withstands the various pressures encountered during daily use.The thermal carbonization enhances the board’s performance while creating a unique rich, dark hue that seamlessly complements kitchens of any décor style.. 【Versatile Three-Piece Set】This set includes large(15.15*10.03*0.59inch), medium(12.00*8.07*0.59inch), and small(9.05*5.90*0.59inch)cutting boards, catering to a wide range of cutting needs. The large board is ideal for meats and large vegetables,or even use as a charcuterie board, the medium fruits and slicing , and the small perfect for delicate ingredients .Three different sizes are available for you to choose according to different use requirements.. 【Convenient to Clean and Maintain】 The smooth surface is less prone to scratching and abrasion, won''t harm your knives.Also,it is effortless to clean. Simply rinse with water and dry after use.The very flat surface causes no damages to the knife like cracks or dullness.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rVBf26hwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fb2kn-y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VzaBRkAlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xPgVqvMSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v+3fKaa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618YV39BcsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVUEo3W0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,37,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0G9RGRSB3',1778268134,1,NULL,'["【Vertically Laminated bamboo,Stability and Durability】Our bamboo cutting board is crafted from vertically laminated bamboo, which is significantly more durable and resistant to warping compared to boards made with horizontal lamination, ensuring a stronger and longer-lasting kitchen tool.","【Thermal Carbonization Process, Elevating Quality 】 This cutting board undergoes a high-temperature thermal carbonization process at 500°F. Compared to ordinary boards, this process removes moisture and impurities, making it less prone to warping and cracking. Consequently, it better withstands the various pressures encountered during daily use.The thermal carbonization enhances the board’s performance while creating a unique rich, dark hue that seamlessly complements kitchens of any décor style.","【Practical Built-in Handles】These cutting boards feature built-in handles that maintain a smooth surface while offering a secure grip. The design ensures effortless handling—whether you''re pulling the board from your cabinet, carrying it to the sink after prep, or transporting ingredients like a serving tray. They strike the perfect balance between functionality and streamlined aesthetics.","【Thermal Carbonization Process, Elevating Quality 】 This cutting board undergoes a high-temperature thermal carbonization process at 500°F. Compared to ordinary boards, this process removes moisture and impurities, making it less prone to warping and cracking. Consequently, it better withstands the various pressures encountered during daily use.The thermal carbonization enhances the board’s performance while creating a unique rich, dark hue that seamlessly complements kitchens of any décor style.","【Versatile Three-Piece Set】This set includes large(15.15*10.03*0.59inch), medium(12.00*8.07*0.59inch), and small(9.05*5.90*0.59inch)cutting boards, catering to a wide range of cutting needs. The large board is ideal for meats and large vegetables,or even use as a charcuterie board, the medium fruits and slicing , and the small perfect for delicate ingredients .Three different sizes are available for you to choose according to different use requirements.","【Convenient to Clean and Maintain】 The smooth surface is less prone to scratching and abrasion, won''t harm your knives.Also,it is effortless to clean. Simply rinse with water and dry after use.The very flat surface causes no damages to the knife like cracks or dullness."]');
