L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814hOPt7Z8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,20291,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FTX7DRQG',1778268167,1,NULL,'["FULL SET - Release your inner mixologist with this bartending kit that includes a shaker tin pair, double jigger (1 and 2 oz), 2 Straws with Brush, 2 Picks, Corkscrew bottle opener, bar spoon, Hawthorne strainer, Ice tongs, muddler, 3 pourers, Wooden Stand, & recipe book","QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL - For a cocktail kit that looks and acts the part, look no further. This bar kit is made of rust-free stainless steel with a brushed finish for a leak-proof, scratch-proof experience.","FOR ALL LEVELS - This drink shaker set is perfect for starting stirrers, master mixers, and everyone in between. With every tool needed to make any drink, you''ll be ready to serve with this bartender set.","EASY CLEANING - These are truly the tools and shakers bartending buffs can''t live without! This cocktail strainer set is completely dishwasher safe - the perfect bar accessories for the home bar set of your dreams!","GREAT GIFT - Know a bartender-to-be who needs that extra cocktail stirrer, margarita kit, cocktail mixers or maybe a whole new set of bar supplies? These bar sets for the home are the perfect present!"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B081JTZNRS','[10-Pack] Glass Meal Prep Containers with Lids, MCIRCO Food Storage Containers with Snap Locking Lids, Airtight Lunch Containers, Microwave, Oven, Freezer and Dishwasher','10-pack-glass-meal-prep-containers-with-lids-mcirco-food-sto-b081jtznrs','M MCIRCO','Meal Prep & Storage',32.99,'10 PACK GLASS MEAL PREP CONTAINERS: With 5 packs 34oz containers and 5 packs 13oz containers, they are great for meal prepping. Save time by cooking and freezing your meals for later. PREMIUM BOROSILICATE GLASS:Our glass storage containers are made from premium borosilicate glass, which is stronger than other glass food storage containers, go straight from the refrigerator to the microwave or oven to the table. AIRTIGHT SMART LOCKING LIDS: MCIRCO Glass food storage containers use snap lock lids that comes with silicone seals to make your meal prep food will last much longer than normal plastic food storage containers. These lids are easy to use and will stop leaking. These lids will not break or slowly stop working. USER FRIENDLY: Easy to use and easy to take care of, as the glass containers can be used in the microwave, freezer, dishwasher, and oven. But the plastic lid can not be placed in the microwave and oven. SPACE-SAVING: The food storage containers have stackable design, can keep refrigerator, home and kitchen organized, and leave more space on your kitchen slabs and cabinets','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VKuXwIKOL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f0YBGVKJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UMhExsVdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sYZ4Zi2aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Azk-mBqAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91g9ZsENnvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,14935,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081JTZNRS',1778268185,1,NULL,'["10 PACK GLASS MEAL PREP CONTAINERS: With 5 packs 34oz containers and 5 packs 13oz containers, they are great for meal prepping. Save time by cooking and freezing your meals for later","PREMIUM BOROSILICATE GLASS:Our glass storage containers are made from premium borosilicate glass, which is stronger than other glass food storage containers, go straight from the refrigerator to the microwave or oven to the table","AIRTIGHT SMART LOCKING LIDS: MCIRCO Glass food storage containers use snap lock lids that comes with silicone seals to make your meal prep food will last much longer than normal plastic food storage containers. These lids are easy to use and will stop leaking. These lids will not break or slowly stop working","USER FRIENDLY: Easy to use and easy to take care of, as the glass containers can be used in the microwave, freezer, dishwasher, and oven. But the plastic lid can not be placed in the microwave and oven","SPACE-SAVING: The food storage containers have stackable design, can keep refrigerator, home and kitchen organized, and leave more space on your kitchen slabs and cabinets"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0C3GZKGRF','VERONES 10 Pack Glass Meal Prep Containers, Airtight Glass Lunch Containers, Stackable Glass Food Storage Containers Set with Lids,Exclusive of BPA,for Microwave, Oven, Freezer & Dishwasher,Grey','verones-10-pack-glass-meal-prep-containers-airtight-glass-lu-b0c3gzkgrf','VERONES','Meal Prep & Storage',32.99,'10 Pack Glass Lunch Containers: This glass storage containers set includes 5 packs 34oz containers and 5 packs 12oz containers for meal prep, office lunches, leftovers, portion control, bringing to the gym, picnics, travel and more. Glass lunch containers with locking lids. They stack together and take up less space. GLASS MATERIAL EXCELLENCE IN QUALITY: Glass meal prep containers are made of superior quality borosilicate glass, for oven, microwave, dishwasher and freezer.Different from ordinary glass food storage containers, food can be stored in glass containers directly after cooking. The containers are versatile to meet your everyday food storage needs, suitable for use in prep meals at home or whatever you need for the occasion. AIRTIGHT LOCKING LIDS: VERONES airtight glass lunch containers use Exclusive of BPA snap-lock lids. Make sure there are no spills and leaks, keeping your food fresh, you will not have to put up with spilled soup or sauce staining your lunch containers again. The lid opens and closes easily and does not break or slowly stop working. Ovens, microwaves and dishwashers are not lid friendly, please remove the lid before heating food or washing. SAFE & PORTABLE: Compared to ordinary plastic meal prep containers, our glass meal prep containers are non-toxic and long-lasting, won’t absorb food flavors, or stains, and make them easy to clean. Different sizes and shapes are great for various occasions and events. ATTENTIVE CUSTOMER SERVICE: VERONES Glass Container Sets offer excellence in service. Customer experience is the main focus, so that customers can buy with peace of mind.Serve our customers and improve customer satisfaction','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VtIVTbzuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7137j+CD8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qncf6OemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dQ9CGiMOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81txlc3jAlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8103D+8zZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814vkSidIpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,3046,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3GZKGRF',1778268200,1,NULL,'["10 Pack Glass Lunch Containers: This glass storage containers set includes 5 packs 34oz containers and 5 packs 12oz containers for meal prep, office lunches, leftovers, portion control, bringing to the gym, picnics, travel and more. Glass lunch containers with locking lids. They stack together and take up less space","GLASS MATERIAL EXCELLENCE IN QUALITY: Glass meal prep containers are made of superior quality borosilicate glass, for oven, microwave, dishwasher and freezer.Different from ordinary glass food storage containers, food can be stored in glass containers directly after cooking. The containers are versatile to meet your everyday food storage needs, suitable for use in prep meals at home or whatever you need for the occasion","AIRTIGHT LOCKING LIDS: VERONES airtight glass lunch containers use Exclusive of BPA snap-lock lids. Make sure there are no spills and leaks, keeping your food fresh, you will not have to put up with spilled soup or sauce staining your lunch containers again. The lid opens and closes easily and does not break or slowly stop working. Ovens, microwaves and dishwashers are not lid friendly, please remove the lid before heating food or washing","SAFE & PORTABLE: Compared to ordinary plastic meal prep containers, our glass meal prep containers are non-toxic and long-lasting, won’t absorb food flavors, or stains, and make them easy to clean. Different sizes and shapes are great for various occasions and events","ATTENTIVE CUSTOMER SERVICE: VERONES Glass Container Sets offer excellence in service. Customer experience is the main focus, so that customers can buy with peace of mind.Serve our customers and improve customer satisfaction"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FCC1NX7F','Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags, 10 Pack 4 Size Leak proof Dishwasher Safe Reusable Freezer Bags for Food Storage Containers, Lunch Bag for Sandwich, Marinate Meat, Fruit','reusable-silicone-food-storage-bags-10-pack-4-size-leak-proo-b0fcc1nx7f','swihorab','Meal Prep & Storage',12.74,'【Airtight and Leak Proof】The silicone reusable bags feature a double-seal zipper closure for a secure, leak-proof seal. The reusable bags are airtight, preventing liquids from leaking. The food bags are moisture-proof, dust-proof, and odor-resistant, ensuring long-lasting storage. Our leakproof reusable storage containers available in various sizes which can accommodate your needs for marinated meats, meal prep, frozen foods, sandwiches, snacks, lunches, vegetables, fruit, pet food, and more. Packs of 10 Reusable freezer bags included 2 Pack Snack Bags (8.7''''x4.7''''), 3 Pack Medium Bags (8.7''''x7.1''''), 3 Pack Large Bags (10.3''''x7.9'''') and 2 Pack Extra Large Bags (11''''x10.6''''). 【Reusable Bags】The BPA Free food grade material frezzer bags are made from a new, environmentally friendly, food-grade silicone material, offering excellent toughness and long-lasting shape retention. These eco-friendly, durable, and reusable food freezer organizer are perfect for keeping food fresh and safe, while also reducing food waste and the use of single-use plastics. Reusable storage bags can be refrigerated and frozen, taking up minimal space and increasing refrigerator utilisation. 【Fridge Organizers, Keeping Food Fresh】The transparent sides of the reusable storage bags allow for easy labelling with a water-based marker, making the clear storage bags easy to categorise and keep your fridge organised. After writing the freezer bags, gently wipe with a damp cloth to remove any marks. These reusable food storage bags are perfect for storing vegetables and fruits, keeping fresh, and for storing raw and marinated meats, locking in their flavor and freshness. 【Easy to Clean】These reusable silicone bag are made of silicone, making them resistant to grease and stains and easy to clean. The reusable freezer bags can be washed inside and out for easy operation and easy drying. After cleaning, store reusable bags in a clean, dry place away from direct sunlight. 【Multi-Purpose Reusable Snack Bags】These reusable sandwich bags can be used in a variety of situations. Silicone bags for food storage are perfect for storing food or household items, not just food, but also small items like clothing and toys on the go. These reusable bags can be used to store liquids like milk, soy milk, and peanut butter. If you''re not satisfied with our reusable gallon freezer bags, please feel free to contact us. I''m confident you''ll love the reusable storage bags','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZqBG5JvxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mBkt5Q5vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150K--KHSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71llfREhLBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G0r+lWmZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dcTiChm9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A8hD9ZWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,83,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FCC1NX7F',1778268217,1,NULL,'["【Airtight and Leak Proof】The silicone reusable bags feature a double-seal zipper closure for a secure, leak-proof seal. The reusable bags are airtight, preventing liquids from leaking. The food bags are moisture-proof, dust-proof, and odor-resistant, ensuring long-lasting storage. Our leakproof reusable storage containers available in various sizes which can accommodate your needs for marinated meats, meal prep, frozen foods, sandwiches, snacks, lunches, vegetables, fruit, pet food, and more. Packs of 10 Reusable freezer bags included 2 Pack Snack Bags (8.7''''x4.7''''), 3 Pack Medium Bags (8.7''''x7.1''''), 3 Pack Large Bags (10.3''''x7.9'''') and 2 Pack Extra Large Bags (11''''x10.6'''')","【Reusable Bags】The BPA Free food grade material frezzer bags are made from a new, environmentally friendly, food-grade silicone material, offering excellent toughness and long-lasting shape retention. These eco-friendly, durable, and reusable food freezer organizer are perfect for keeping food fresh and safe, while also reducing food waste and the use of single-use plastics. Reusable storage bags can be refrigerated and frozen, taking up minimal space and increasing refrigerator utilisation","【Fridge Organizers, Keeping Food Fresh】The transparent sides of the reusable storage bags allow for easy labelling with a water-based marker, making the clear storage bags easy to categorise and keep your fridge organised. After writing the freezer bags, gently wipe with a damp cloth to remove any marks. These reusable food storage bags are perfect for storing vegetables and fruits, keeping fresh, and for storing raw and marinated meats, locking in their flavor and freshness","【Easy to Clean】These reusable silicone bag are made of silicone, making them resistant to grease and stains and easy to clean. The reusable freezer bags can be washed inside and out for easy operation and easy drying. After cleaning, store reusable bags in a clean, dry place away from direct sunlight","【Multi-Purpose Reusable Snack Bags】These reusable sandwich bags can be used in a variety of situations. Silicone bags for food storage are perfect for storing food or household items, not just food, but also small items like clothing and toys on the go. These reusable bags can be used to store liquids like milk, soy milk, and peanut butter. If you''re not satisfied with our reusable gallon freezer bags, please feel free to contact us. I''m confident you''ll love the reusable storage bags"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B08NFR7GZX','Stasher Silicone Reusable Storage Bags, 4-Pack, Reusable Freezer Bags, Microwave, Dishwasher, Oven Safe, Sous Vide, Premium Lunch Containers, Eco Friendly, Food-safe Silicone Snack Bag, Clear | Reusable Food Bags','stasher-silicone-reusable-storage-bags-4-pack-reusable-freez-b08nfr7gzx','Stasher','Meal Prep & Storage',65.99,'Welcome to Stasher - the simple, reusable alternative to single-use plastic bags. Now meet the perfect set of bags for all of your food storage needs! This 4-Pack Stasher Bundle features 1 Half Gallon Bag, 1 Snack Bag, 1 Sandwich Bag & 1 Stand Up Mid Bag that will become the most versatile tool in your kitchen. These durable silicone bags are perfect for everything from on-the-go snacking to organizing the lunches for each member of your family, all while giving you the peace of mind that comes with a leak-free, airtight container. Whether you are packing food for your busy day or storing tonight''s leftovers, Stasher Clear 4-Pack Multiuse Bags make a great addition to your kitchen. This is a great Stasher bundle if you''re new to the reusable world or you just need to grow your collection! Stasher food-safe silicone bags transform how you cook, store, and save while helping you ditch plastic for good. Made with food-grade platinum silicone and featuring a leak-free patented Pinch-Loc seal, every Stasher reusable bag is safe for the dishwasher, freezer, microwave, oven (up to 425°F) and more. They''re the perfect long-lasting do-it-all replacement for single-use plastic bags in your kitchen, home, and on the go. All our products are free of lead, latex, BPA, BPS, or other phthalates. What began in 2016 with one bag to replace single-use sandwich bags has grown into a portfolio designed to make sustainable choices effortless for more people. Together, we’ve saved 5.5 billion single-use plastic bags from entering our waterways and ocean.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QB8d6soPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718aT6iYn6L._AC_SL1101_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610kkhoGL-L._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YRN2OYUCL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bra6-R79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MBYe1V4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810fNr9vQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cu-+U6YTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P0QpuF7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91b7Chnvp2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,697,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NFR7GZX',1778268225,1,NULL,'["CONTAINS: 4 Stasher Reusable Silicone Bags in the color Clear. Includes 1 Stand-Up Mid (56 Fl Oz), 1 Half Gallon (64 Fl Oz), 1 Sandwich (28 Fl Oz), and 1 Snack (12 Fl Oz) Bags.","BETTER SILICONE BAGS & BOWLS: Made with platinum food-grade silicone and a leak-free Pinch-Loc seal, these reusable food containers are free from lead, latex, phthalates, BPA, and BPS. Plus, one bag replaces 260 single-use plastic bags per year.","REUSABLE, REWASHABLE CONTAINERS: Stasher silicone reusable storage bags make it easy to ditch single-use plastic and meet endless household needs. Safe for the dishwasher, microwave, oven (up to 425°F), and more.","EASY TO CARE FOR: Simply toss into the dishwasher or use warm soapy water. Avoid turning the bag inside out as it could cause the bag to rip.","LIFETIME WARRANTY: Designed to be reused forever. And ever. Stasher products are covered for life. If damaged through normal use, we will replace it with the same product or one of equal value."]');
