es meet your needs for marinating meats, meal prep, frozen foods, Sandwiches, snacks, lunch, vegetables, fruit, pet food container. The clear storage bags are easily take out the items you need from the refrigerator or other places without opening the freezer bags, keep the space where you storage food clean. Solve Travel & Home Organization: The reusable bags not only food bags but also big enough to accommodate clothes, toys, etc on a wonderful journey. These bags also perfect to storage knitting materials, cosmetics, etc. Green practical storage bags as christmas gifts for women mom, friends, neighbors and co-workers who have everything. Apartment and Travel Must Have.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YjJyMsIuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oWdn+AqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oFS+LDjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w+5NMjWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715LensUctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+waPRVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,6990,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088K3494K',1778268232,1,NULL,'["Dishwasher Safe & Easy to Clean:IDEATECH reusable bags is easy to clean and dry, Simply turn the reusable bag inside out and put it in the dishwasher for easy cleaning then put it on the top rack of the dishwasher and they’re good as new when they come out. But please skip high-temperature functions such as the dishwasher''s drying to extend the lifespan of these food bags.","Leakproof, Easy to Seal: The leakproof reusable storage containers featured with double zipper closures locks avoid spilling liquid objects, easier to open and close for anyone. Whether it''s a hectic morning rush or a bumpy road trip, your soups, sauces, and smoothies stay perfectly contained, their flavors locked in and your car seats, fridge, countertops dry","Keep Food Freshness, Avoid Freezer Burn: BPA Free food grade material frezzer bags perfect for