st be a must-have storage tool in your home. Cleaning is a breeze: just wipe it with a damp cloth and it will be brand new. Let storage be a more enjoyable experience for us!. Perfect Gift Choice:This bamboo organizer is an ideal gift for friends and family for birthdays, holidays, housewarmings and other occasions. Not only is it beautiful, it also helps to store and organize tableware, desk drawer organizers, jewelry organizers and storage boxes. It is a practical and tasteful gift that is sure to win compliments from others!','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N3O40w5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iyk2vlBLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ko2s4gxpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JhG4RGd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eOPfNa3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gddeD-4KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+vhrcpsJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W5L7LZa4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b82kPbiBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,340,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F2DZDYR3',1778268263,1,NULL,'["Bamboo Drawer Organizer:Do you need the ultimate storage essentials to stay organized? Look no further than this indispensable and versatile bamboo organizer set! This 5-piece bamboo drawer organizer set is perfect for keeping your home clutter-free and organized. Whether you''re storing makeup, jewelry, office supplies, or kitchen essentials, these stylish bamboo organizers are ideal for everyday use.","Versatile Design: This bamboo drawer organizer set has five separate organizers (5.7 x 3.5 inches, 9.2 x 3.2 inches, 9.8 x 4.5 inches, 10.4 x 4.5 inches, and 10.4 x 4.7 inches), which can be used in various spaces, such as kitchen storage and storage, desk organizers, and crafts organization and storage. Designed for small, medium, and large drawers, these bamboo drawer organizers can flexibly meet your storage needs, making organizing items as easy as building blocks~","Durable and low-carbon material: These drawer organizers are made of high-quality natural bamboo, which can remain stable even under frequent daily use, providing you with long-lasting and reliable drawer organizers. The sturdy structure of the bamboo drawer organizer ensures long-term use, and the open design allows you to easily access items, create a tidy environment, and organize and store more comfortably.","Space-Saving And Easy To Clean:These stackable bamboo drawer organizer sets help maximize your storage space and keep everything organized. This storage set shelf must be a must-have storage tool in your home. Cleaning is a breeze: just wipe it with a damp cloth and it will be brand new. Let storage be a more enjoyable experience for us!","Perfect Gift Choice:This bamboo organizer is an ideal gift for friends and family for birthdays, holidays, housewarmings and other occasions. Not only is it beautiful, it also helps to store and organize tableware, desk drawer organizers, jewelry organizers and storage boxes. It is a practical and tasteful gift that is sure to win compliments from others!"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0D9TGXG5C','12 Pack Cleaning Cloth,Ultra Soft Absorbent Quick Drying Microfiber Cleaning rags,No scratches,Reusable,Washable,Lint Free Cleaning Towels for Kitchen,Window,Glass,car,11.8"×11.8",(Multicolor)','12-pack-cleaning-clothultra-soft-absorbent-quick-drying-micr-b0d9tgxg5c','Neessno','Cleaning & Laundry',6.99,'Super Absorbent：With a high quality short-pile microfiber design, these microfiber cleaning cloths are ultra Absorbent, They can easily absorb large amounts of liquid and wring out spills easily, perfect for wiping surfaces without leaving marks, Even after repeated cleaning, they retain water absorption and softness, ensuring lasting durability. Super Soft：Neessno Microfiber cleaning rags made of super absorbent coral velvet microfiber, very soft, will not fuffle, easy to wash, will not produce odor, will not scratch the surface and leave small scratches, very suitable for wiping glass, tablet, car，computer screen and any object surface cleaning needs. Value Pack：Our 11.8x11.8in Microfiber cleaning cloth set contains a 12-pack and is available in a variety of colors. For different cleaning needs, to ensure you have enough to help you with all your daily household cleaning tasks. These durable microfiber towels can save you even more money on paper towels while meeting your daily cleaning needs. Multi-Purpose：These coral velvet microfiber cleaning rags are more absorbent, and because they are so soft, they are ideal for use as kitchen cleaning cloths to dry utensils, wipe down countertops, sinks, wipe hands, dust cloths, clean Windows, car, home appliances, and wash cloths and other cleaning tasks. Easy to Clean：Easy to wash by hand or machine, easy to wring out and care for, After use, just rinse or throw in the washing machine Ready','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MG2C0z4nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8167PxgiTZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GDW2OMD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813dOizZCbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817Q26cD3qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N1Swj-JhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,791,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D9TGXG5C',1778268286,1,NULL,'["Super Absorbent：With a high quality short-pile microfiber design, these microfiber cleaning cloths are ultra Absorbent, They can easily absorb large amounts of liquid and wring out spills easily, perfect for wiping surfaces without leaving marks, Even after repeated cleaning, they retain water absorption and softness, ensuring lasting durability","Super Soft：Neessno Microfiber cleaning rags made of super absorbent coral velvet microfiber, very soft, will not fuffle, easy to wash, will not produce odor, will not scratch the surface and leave small scratches, very suitable for wiping glass, tablet, car，computer screen and any object surface cleaning needs","Value Pack：Our 11.8x11.8in Microfiber cleaning cloth set contains a 12-pack and is available in a variety of colors. For different cleaning needs, to ensure you have enough to help you with all your daily household cleaning tasks. These durable microfiber towels can save you even more money on paper towels while meeting your daily cleaning needs","Multi-Purpose：These coral velvet microfiber cleaning rags are more absorbent, and because they are so soft, they are ideal for use as kitchen cleaning cloths to dry utensils, wipe down countertops, sinks, wipe hands, dust cloths, clean Windows, car, home appliances, and wash cloths and other cleaning tasks","Easy to Clean：Easy to wash by hand or machine, easy to wring out and care for, After use, just rinse or throw in the washing machine Ready"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0DRPKBCYY','10PACK Kitchen Cleaning Cloths, Microfiber Dish Cloths: All-Purpose Washing/Soft/Lint Free/Absorbent/Quick Dry Reusable Washable Towels for Bathroom/Car/Glass, 10''''x10'''' - Pink','10pack-kitchen-cleaning-cloths-microfiber-dish-cloths-all-pu-b0drpkbcyy','NEOWEMING','Cleaning & Laundry',5.97,'10PACK Set Microfiber Washcloth, All-Purpose Soft Towel, Washable Face Towels: Scratch Free Streak Free Lint Free, Super Absorbent, Quick Dry Reusable Cleaning Cloths.. SUPER SOFT, NO-SCRATCH, ULTRA ABSORBANT AND LINT FREE – The super soft microfibre dishcloth are perfect for cleaning kitchen tops, bathrooms, windows, cars and other delicate surfaces. Made using a perfect blend of premium nylon and polyester, these lint free cloths will soak up spills quickly. No lint or streaks, ensuring cleaning is quick and easy.. NO-RESIDUE, WITHOUT ANY ODOURS – Our small dishwahing rags are lint-free allowing you to easily wipe away stains without leaving a residue like steel wool, and they dry quickly without any odours.. MULTI-PURPOSE CLEANING & EASY TO USE – These wash cloths are perfect for a huge range of cleaning jobs. Use them dry to clean dust or wet to clean spills and grime. They make the perfect absorbent dish rag and work magic on grease and grime. Whether you are scrubbing pots & pans, wiping kitchen & bathroom surfaces, cleaning mirrors or table, these cloths made with microfibre are perfect for the task.. REUSABLE, TOUGH & LONG LASTING – Machine washable and reusable, these microfibre cloths are made to last. Manufactured with high precision machines with premium, reinforced stitching, these cloths are tough, multi purpose and perfect for your home or office.. SMALL PERFECT SIZE – Our dish cloths size is about 10 inch by 10 inch. (About 25 cm by 25 cm.). PACKAGE CONTENT – You''ll get 10Pcs microfiber washing cloths.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Xvb6Pb2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712NTCBpWSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+QsUjRgXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xLIIwp2OL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-yx-066EL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71llQXntPsL._AC_SL1300_.jpg"]',4.6,234,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DRPKBCYY',1778268295,1,NULL,'["10PACK Set Microfiber Washcloth, All-Purpose Soft Towel, Washable Face Towels: Scratch Free Streak Free Lint Free, Super Absorbent, Quick Dry Reusable Cleaning Cloths.","SUPER SOFT, NO-SCRATCH, ULTRA ABSORBANT AND LINT FREE – The super soft microfibre dishcloth are perfect for cleaning kitchen tops, bathrooms, windows, cars and other delicate surfaces. Made using a perfect blend of premium nylon and polyester, these lint free cloths will soak up spills quickly. No lint or streaks, ensuring cleaning is quick and easy.","NO-RESIDUE, WITHOUT ANY ODOURS – Our small dishwahing rags are lint-free allowing you to easily wipe away stains without leaving a residue like steel wool, and they dry quickly without any odours.","MULTI-PURPOSE CLEANING & EASY TO USE – These wash cloths are perfect for a huge range of cleaning jobs. Use them dry to clean dust or wet to clean spills and grime. They make the perfect absorbent dish rag and work magic on grease and grime. Whether you are scrubbing pots & pans, wiping kitchen & bathroom surfaces, cleaning mirrors or table, these cloths made with microfibre are perfect for the task.","REUSABLE, TOUGH & LONG LASTING – Machine washable and reusable, these microfibre cloths are made to last. Manufactured with high precision machines with premium, reinforced stitching, these cloths are tough, multi purpose and perfect for your home or office.","SMALL PERFECT SIZE – Our dish cloths size is about 10 inch by 10 inch. (About 25 cm by 25 cm.)","PACKAGE CONTENT – You''ll get 10Pcs microfiber washing cloths."]');
