azon.com/images/I/81CmLxuKvCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZdnE2B5qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fkVSf9ncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8107FWpaRSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,4521,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X17377F',1778268303,1,NULL,'["[Streak Free & Versatile Cleaning] The amazing absorbency to clean any surfaces in few wipes, quickly also non-scratch without streak and on glass, mirrors, dishes & cups, counters, sink or kitchenware","[Ultra Soft Material & Health Safe Use] Made of 85% Polyester and 15% Polyamide fiber. Completely soft touch on the total microfiber fabric blend, safe for hands when used as dish cloths for washing dishes","[Super Absorbent & Lint Free Rags] A kind of super absorbent kitchen towels or dish towels for kitchen drying. Fuzzy microfiber cloth surface provides great absorbency on liquids and stains, but also lint free for long-term durable use. The mircrofiber towels may soak up three times its own weight as dish towels for kitchen drying","[Reusable & Saving] Wash and reuse the dish towels for kitchen through hundreds of times, it will not twist or bleach. Replace disposable paper tissues and reduce waste. Recommend replacing based on use frequency","[Family Size Choice] Cleaning cloths for house. Comes in 1 pack of 18 pcs with 3 assorted colors (pink/green/blue), measuring 10\" x 10\" each. Tackle different housework in colors"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B01LVU7THF','ZIMASILK 100% Pure Mulberry Silk Pillow Cases for Hair and Skin, Soft, Hypoallergenic & Smooth, Both Sides Grade 6A Silk, with Hidden Zipper, Gift for Women Men, 1pc (Queen 20''''x30'''', Taupe)','zimasilk-100-pure-mulberry-silk-pillow-cases-for-hair-and-sk-b01lvu7thf','ZIMASILK','Bedroom & Sleep',24.99,'Both Sides 100% 19 Momme Grade (6a) Mulberry Silk. ✅100% 19 Momme Mulberry Silk Pillowcase - Crafted with premium 6A-grade mulberry silk, ZIMASILK''s pillowcase offers ideal thickness, lasting durability, and exceptional softness. Fully double-sided and made of pure silk, it ensures breathable, smooth, and comfortable sleep all night long.. ✅Gentle on Skin & Hair - Naturally Hypoallergenic. Unlike satin or synthetic imitations that may cause friction, irritation, and breakage, our mulberry silk pillowcase is clinically recognized for its skin-friendly properties. It’s perfect for sensitive skin, reducing sleep wrinkles, acne, and hair tangles.. ✅Enhance Your Beauty Sleep - Infused with natural amino acids, ZIMASILK''s silk pillowcase helps promote skin cell renewal and retains moisture. The low-friction, anti-static surface helps prevent frizz, split ends, and bed head—ideal for curly, frizz-prone, or color-treated hair.. ✅Vibrant & Fade-Resistant Colors. Expertly constructed with color-lock technology to maintain vibrancy wash after wash and showcase exquisite craftsmanship with precise stitching. With over 35 stylish shades—from classic black, white, and pink to seasonal favorites—it’s a perfect gift for Thanksgiving, Christmas and New Year celebrations.. ✅180-Day Support: Experience the luxury of ZIMASILK pure silk pillowcase. We''re confident you''ll love this silk cover as much as we do. If you encounter any quality issues, our 180-day support has you covered. Simply contact us, and we''ll resolve your concern within 24 hours. Shop with confidence from ZIMASILK.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h02IUI3OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v2+HIJJQL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Hv5mNjuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LqrLLEH-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d4YoGg6RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P2XA26azL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XkAZNUGNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nIzQL0NqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,51525,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LVU7THF',1778268327,1,NULL,'["Both Sides 100% 19 Momme Grade (6a) Mulberry Silk","✅100% 19 Momme Mulberry Silk Pillowcase - Crafted with premium 6A-grade mulberry silk, ZIMASILK''s pillowcase offers ideal thickness, lasting durability, and exceptional softness. Fully double-sided and made of pure silk, it ensures breathable, smooth, and comfortable sleep all night long.","✅Gentle on Skin & Hair - Naturally Hypoallergenic. Unlike satin or synthetic imitations that may cause friction, irritation, and breakage, our mulberry silk pillowcase is clinically recognized for its skin-friendly properties. It’s perfect for sensitive skin, reducing sleep wrinkles, acne, and hair tangles.","✅Enhance Your Beauty Sleep - Infused with natural amino acids, ZIMASILK''s silk pillowcase helps promote skin cell renewal and retains moisture. The low-friction, anti-static surface helps prevent frizz, split ends, and bed head—ideal for curly, frizz-prone, or color-treated hair.","✅Vibrant & Fade-Resistant Colors. Expertly constructed with color-lock technology to maintain vibrancy wash after wash and showcase exquisite craftsmanship with precise stitching. With over 35 stylish shades—from classic black, white, and pink to seasonal favorites—it’s a perfect gift for Thanksgiving, Christmas and New Year celebrations.","✅180-Day Support: Experience the luxury of ZIMASILK pure silk pillowcase. We''re confident you''ll love this silk cover as much as we do. If you encounter any quality issues, our 180-day support has you covered. Simply contact us, and we''ll resolve your concern within 24 hours. Shop with confidence from ZIMASILK."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0BBSSRNHM','Blissy Silk Pillowcase - 100% Pure Mulberry Silk - 22 Momme 6A High-Grade Fibers - Silk Pillow Cover for Hair & Skin - Regular, Queen & King (Blissy White, Standard)','blissy-silk-pillowcase-100-pure-mulberry-silk-22-momme-6a-hi-b0bbssrnhm','BLISSY','Bedroom & Sleep',39.47,'100% 22-momme 6a Grade Mulberry Silk. 22-MOMME 6A GRADE MULBERRY FIBERS: Blissy Silk Pillowcases are handmade and crafted from high quality 22 Momme 100% Pure Mulberry Silk. We have spent countless hours prototyping, testing and using our products to ensure the highest quality and durability.. TAKE YOUR HAIR FROM DRAB TO FAB: No more bedhead or tired hair! Kiss dryness and tangles goodbye! Blissy prevents the tugging and pulling provided by ordinary pillowcases. Plus the non-absorbent surface helps to maintain your hair’s naturally producing oils.. SKIN SAVING: Why waste time and money on a pillowcase that will only absorb vital skin nutrients? With Blissy 100% Mulberry Silk, your skin will maintain the balanced moisture it needs to form a protective layer. Fight against dryness and acne, two sides of the same coin!. BETTER & COOLER SLEEP: The temperature regulating properties of the Blissy silk pillowcase allow you to keep cool at all times during the night without the discomfort associated with fluctuating temperature and the constant tossing and turning for a restful night sleep.. ENJOY A FRESHER MORNING: Say farewell to discomfort and hello to a more soothing sleep with our silk pillowcase. Its smooth surface is less prone to irritating sensitive skin, helping you wake up feeling refreshed, with a clearer complexion and a more comfortable start to your day.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tn3ZSyhlL._AC_SL1056_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vP8aGLp6L.