UBxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KgeRMu4cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7133sNB6frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,15626,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H7FZ5JM',1778268387,1,NULL,'["No light Leakage: With the heightened 22 mm adaptive hollow nose bridge, LitBear sleep mask fully fits all nose shapes, helps improve sleep, and gets longer deep sleep","Completely Block Light for Side Sleeper: New design of 15° tilt angle ultra-thin sides of the eye mask for sleeping which can reduce 90% pressure on your temples. Sleep more comfortably when is on your side, a perfect light-blocking sleeping mask for back and stomach sleepers","Blinking Freely: Deep 12 mm 3D contoured cup eye sockets leave larger space for blinking, maintaining your beautiful eye makeup without pressure on your eyes. This sleep mask for women and men will be a good choice for you","Comfortable and Soft: Made of smooth cooling fabric lining and premium 6-layer low rebound soft memory foam make the sleep eye mask breathable and lightweight, comfortable for travel, nap, flight, camping, and Yoga","Adjustable: Easy to adjust the elastic buckle strap from 20.5 to 26.5 inches and fits snuggly, is suitable for any sleeping position and stays in place","Note: Hand washes with water below 40℃ /104℉, please wash the eye cover for sleeping and let it dry naturally before use"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0D3GXYMTL','Scented Candles for Home Scented Aromatherapy Candles, 4 Pack 28 Oz Soy Wax Candle Gift Set Valentine''s Day Gift for Women Men (Lavender/Vanilla//Sandalwood Rose/Moroccan Amber)','scented-candles-for-home-scented-aromatherapy-candles-4-pack-b0d3gxymtl','FF FRAGRFLOWING','Candles & Aromatherapy',25.19,'Candle Set: We have carefully blended 4 different fragrance types, from soft rose flavor to warm amber flavor, from fresh lemo flavor to rich vanilla flavor. Whether you like the natural atmosphere or the personalized flavour, this candle pack can meet your needs. Each candles is a unique fragrance combination that brings you a comprehensive enjoyment of body and mind.. Soy Wax Candles: Scented candle is made with high quality soy wax, free of harmful ingredients, with cotton wick to minimize ash and clumping. Meanwhile, our aromatherapy candles burn for approximately 200 hours, allowing you to enjoy a more long lasting aroma and comfortable experience. Create a Comfortable Atmosphere: When the aromatherapy candle is lit, the fresh aroma will quickly fill the space, let your tired body relax. Imagine when you finish a day of studying and working, and return home surrounded by tempting scents, both your body and mind will be greatly relaxed. At the same time, the amber jar candles can match any decoration style, adding elegance to your space. Aromatherapy Experience: In a busy life, we always crave a sense of tranquility and relaxation. Aromatherapy candles are your unique choice, bringing you endless comfort and pleasure. Each scent can make you feel calm and comfortable, making it a good companion for studying, working, bathing, reading, meditation, and sleeping. Candle Gift for Men & Women:Whether for personal use or as a christmas gift for family and friends, scented candles are an ideal gift choice. Whether it''s relaxing the body and mind, creating a comfortable atmosphere, or enhancing the warmth of the home, the soy candle can meet your expectations','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ACjlQuQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81geRAc4H1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81huZv2jPeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716E83RzOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WIQRtMKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IjNDJySWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,347,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D3GXYMTL',1778268404,1,NULL,'["Candle Set: We have carefully blended 4 different fragrance types, from soft rose flavor to warm amber flavor, from fresh lemo flavor to rich vanilla flavor. Whether you like the natural atmosphere or the personalized flavour, this candle pack can meet your needs. Each candles is a unique fragrance combination that brings you a comprehensive enjoyment of body and mind.","Soy Wax Candles: Scented candle is made with high quality soy wax, free of harmful ingredients, with cotton wick to minimize ash and clumping. Meanwhile, our aromatherapy candles burn for approximately 200 hours, allowing you to enjoy a more long lasting aroma and comfortable experience","Create a Comfortable Atmosphere: When the aromatherapy candle is lit, the fresh aroma will quickly fill the space, let your tired body relax. Imagine when you finish a day of studying and working, and return home surrounded by tempting scents, both your body and mind will be greatly relaxed. At the same time, the amber jar candles can match any decoration style, adding elegance to your space","Aromatherapy Experience: In a busy life, we always crave a sense of tranquility and relaxation. Aromatherapy candles are your unique choice, bringing you endless comfort and pleasure. Each scent can make you feel calm and comfortable, making it a good companion for studying, working, bathing, reading, meditation, and sleeping","Candle Gift for Men & Women:Whether for personal use or as a christmas gift for family and friends, scented candles are an ideal gift choice. Whether it''s relaxing the body and mind, creating a comfortable atmosphere, or enhancing the warmth of the home, the soy candle can meet your expectations"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GD7BZ8JC','4 Pack Scented Candles Gifts for Women: 28oz Natural Soy Candles for Home Scented, Up to 200H Burning, Aromatherapy Candle Set, Jar Candle Gift Set for Spa Bath Meditation Birthday Valentine''s Gifts','4-pack-scented-candles-gifts-for-women-28oz-natural-soy-cand-b0gd7bz8jc','Yinuo Candle','Candles & Aromatherapy',22.09,'🎁 PERFECT GIFT-READY CANDLES FOR WOMEN - This beautiful scented candle comes with a pretty package, creating a creating a warm, refreshing, and romantic ambiance. It’s the ideal ready-to-gift treasure for the special woman in your life—whether for her birthday, anniversary, Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, or just because.. 🌿 4 SOOTHING FRAGRANCES - Immerse yourself in a curated collection of captivating aromas, designed to evoke the renewal of spring and the serenity of summer. Fresh Linen & Rain – Crisp sun-dried linen meets the dewy freshness of spring rain. White Blossom & Pear – a delicate harmony of blooming florals and sweet, juicy pear, evoking a sunlit garden. Lemon Verbena Zest – an energizing citrus spark lifted with herbal verbena, like a burst of summer sunshine. Sage Sea Breeze – an oceanic breeze blended with earthy sage, reminiscent of a serene coastal morning.. 🌱 100% SOY WAX & COTTON WICK - Our premium aromatherapy candles are crafted from all-natural, vegan-friendly soy wax that burns cleaner and longer than paraffin. Infused with high-quality plant essential oils, they release a pure, consistent fragrance. The lead-free, braided cotton wicks ensure a even, soot-free flame for a safer and more enjoyable ambiance creation experience.. 🕘 LONG-LASTING BURN TIME - Each 7oz non toxic candles provides up to 50 hours of clean, consistent burn (200 hours total for the set), making it perfect for sustaining the vibrant yet serene ambiance of spring and summer throughout the season. Whether you''re bringing a spring-fresh vibe to your living room, turning a bath into a coastal spa retreat, or unwinding in your bedroom with soft floral notes, these long-lasting candles maintain their perfectly balanced scent from the very first light to the final glow.. ✨ VERSATILE FOR ANY MOMENT: From morning refreshment to evening unwind, from home office focus to cozy living moments, this soy candle meets your needs. Each scent is designed for a specific scene, adding a unique fragrance and a touch of personal ritual to your everyday life.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcRAbur2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XmKNx2qKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FpCTmcdvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8lG2FbnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LdDMgGVlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715f5NVL8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qfVxgKO4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,2973,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GD7BZ8JC',1778268411,1,NULL,'["🎁 PERFECT GIFT-READY CANDLES FOR WOMEN - This beautiful scented candle comes with a pretty package, creating a creating a warm, refreshing, and romantic ambiance. It’s the ideal ready-to-gift treasure for the special woman in your life—whether for her birthday, anniversary, Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, or just because.","🌿 4 SOOTHING FRAGRANCES - Immerse yourself in a curated collection of captivating aromas, designed to evoke the renewal of spring and the serenity of summer. Fresh Linen & Rain – Crisp sun-dried linen meets the dewy freshness of spring rain. White Blossom & Pear – a delicate harmony of blooming florals and sweet, juicy pear, evoking a sunlit garden. Lemon Verbena Zest – an energizing citrus spark lifted with herbal verbena, like a burst of summer sunshine. Sage Sea Breeze – an oceanic breeze blended with earthy sage, reminiscent of a serene coastal morning.","🌱 100% SOY WAX & COTTON WICK - Our premium aromatherapy candles are crafted from all-natural, vegan-friendly soy wax that burns cleaner and longer than paraffin. Infused with high-quality plant essential oils, they release a pure, consistent fragrance. The lead-free, braided cotton wicks ensure a even, soot-free flame for a safer and more enjoyable ambiance creation experience.","🕘 LONG-LASTING BURN TIME - Each 7oz non toxic candles provides up to 50 hours of clean, consistent burn (200 hours total for the set), making it perfect for sustaining the vibrant yet serene ambiance of spring and summer throughout the season. Whether you''re bringing a spring-fresh vibe to your living room, turning a bath into a coastal spa retreat, or unwinding in your bedroom with soft floral notes, these long-lasting candles maintain their perfectly balanced scent from the very first light to the final glow.","✨ VERSATILE FOR ANY MOMENT: From morning refreshment to evening unwind, from home office focus to cozy living moments, this soy candle meets your needs. Each scent is designed for a specific scene, adding a unique fragrance and a touch of personal ritual to your everyday life."]');
