17',1778268435,1,NULL,'["Fresh scent Clean Linen : Keep it clean with air. Crafted with notes of Crisp Air, Fresh Laundry and Lily of the Valley, this fragrance is masterfully designed to give you all the fresh feels.","Includes: One fragrance diffuser glass bottle, 6.7 fl oz mixture of essential oils combined with fragrance, one pc. of real preserved baby''s breath flowers, and 8 pure cotton sticks. Adjust the amount of aroma released by adding or removing the sticks.","Long-lasting Scent: Enjoy up to 90 days of fragrant aroma. Once the reeds absorb the fragrance and release it in the air, it will subtly diffuse the scent across the room for weeks.","Enhance in Any Room: Enjoy pleasant aroma and decorate your indoor or outdoor space, including your home, office, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom.","Ideal Gift: Perfect for yourself, family, and friends for any occasion, including holidays, birthdays, housewarming parties, dinner parties, and thank you gifts."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0CC3W5KCW','Sweet Water Decor Non-Toxic Cashmere and Vanilla Reed Diffuser Set, Cashmere, Sandalwood, Milky Coconut, Bourbon Vanilla Scented Diffuser for Home, Light Fragrance, Made in the USA, 3.5 FL OZ','sweet-water-decor-non-toxic-cashmere-and-vanilla-reed-diffus-b0cc3w5kcw','Sweet Water Decor','Candles & Aromatherapy',21.99,'SMELLS LIKE - Create a serene, spa-like escape with notes of milky coconut, frangipani, soft cashmere, bourbon vanilla, creamy sandalwood, tonka bean, and exotic musk — a light, comforting fragrance perfect for everyday elegance.. HOW TO USE – Set it and forget it! Simply place the reed sticks into the fragrance oil and let them work their magic. For a scent boost, flip the reeds whenever the fragrance starts to fade. Want a stronger scent? Add more reed sticks for more scent based on your desired fragrance level. Enjoy an effortless, flame-free fragrance that fills your space with warmth and charm.. REED DIFFUSER SET INCLUDES - Our scented reed diffusers for home includes a 3.5 fl oz bottle with 8 rattan reed diffuser sticks. This reed diffuser set is beautifully packaged in a ready-to-gift box. It measures 10” high when assembled. Diffuser oil color may vary. Our reed diffusers are proudly made in Pittsburgh, PA.. FOR ANY SPACE - Designed to blend seamlessly with any aesthetic, our chic glass bottle and natural reeds add a touch of sophistication to any room. This bathroom reed diffuser can be enjoyed in a living room, bedroom, entryway, kitchen, office space, or wherever you need an air freshener.. PERFECT GIFT - Perfect for housewarmings, gift baskets, birthdays, new house gifts for women, or just because—because everyone deserves a little everyday luxury.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hur2RVijL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https