 No complicated installation process required, saving you worry and effort. Three-sided handles make it easy to transport and carry.","Make An Impression: These desk organizers and accessories offer spacious storage space for office, home and classroom organization. It complements any style, helping you keep your desk tidy, solving the problem of desk clutter while taking up less space. Great gift for children, students, family and friends."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0G6YYXHHZ','Bamboo Corner Shower Caddy Stand 3-Tier, Standing Shower Organizer with Anti-Slip Feet, Waterproof & Durable Bathroom Shower Shelf, Space-Saving Design Storage for Kitchen or Living Room','bamboo-corner-shower-caddy-stand-3-tier-standing-shower-orga-b0g6yyxhhz','JEDULAR','Bath & Shower',43.99,'【Solve Your Storage Challenges】 Tired of cluttered bathroom counters, messy shower corners, or limited storage space? This 3-tier corner shower shelves stand is your perfect organizational solution—designed to fit seamlessly in bathrooms, kitchens, or living rooms, keeping your daily essentials within easy reach while eliminating the frustration of crowded, disorganized countertops.. 【Space-Saving L-Shaped Design】With dimensions of 13''''D x 13''''W x 29.5''''H , this bathroom corner shelf is designed to fit perfectly in tight spaces. Its 90° right-angle tiers sit flush against walls, maximizing vertical storage while transforming unused corners into functional and efficient storage areas.. 【 Spacious storage space】Designed with three generously sized tiers, this corner shower shelves provides ample storage space for organizing toiletries, towels, plants, or kitchen essentials. Its vertical design maximizes storage while keeping everything neat and easily accessible.. 【Sturdy & Water-Resistant】 Crafted from solid bamboo treated with waterproof technology, this bathroom shelf features a smooth, attractive surface. It easily supports the weight of various bath essentials and potted plants, making it a reliable storage solution for long-term use in your bathroom.. 【3-Minute Easy Installation】: Skip the complicated assembly! This shower shelf for inside shower features a simple Installation design, so you can put it together in just 3 minutes—no tools, no drilling. Perfect for anyone seeking a hassle-free storage solution.. 【Versatile Multi-Functional Use】 Perfect as a bathroom corner shelf, a kitchen organizer, or a decorative plant stand, this corner shelf adapts to various storage needs. Its stylish design complements any decor, adding practical storage and a touch of rustic charm to any room.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Er0sERObL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g00QiGrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zuPiwDmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WGD2yrZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obfXCsmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71drYuKHlVL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tU1tZnBmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CpxOkwGML._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Er0sERObL._AC_SL1024_.jpg"]',4.5,28,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0G6YYXHHZ',1778268545,1,NULL,'["【Solve Your Storage Challenges】 Tired of cluttered bathroom counters, messy shower corners, or limited storage space? This 3-tier corner shower shelves stand is your perfect organizational solution—designed to fit seamlessly in bathrooms, kitchens, or living rooms, keeping your daily essentials within easy reach while eliminating the frustration of crowded, disorganized countertops.","【Space-Saving L-Shaped Design】With dimensions of 13''''D x 13''''W x 29.5''''H , this bathroom corner shelf is designed to fit perfectly in tight spaces. Its 90° right-angle tiers sit flush against walls, maximizing vertical storage while transforming unused corners into functional and efficient storage areas.","【 Spacious storage space】Designed with three generously sized tiers, this corner shower shelves provides ample storage space for organizing toiletries, towels, plants, or kitchen essentials. Its vertical design maximizes storage while keeping everything neat and easily accessible.","【Sturdy & Water-Resistant】 Crafted from solid bamboo treated with waterproof technology, this bathroom shelf features a smooth, attractive surface. It easily supports the weight of various bath essentials and potted plants, making it a reliable storage solution for long-term use in your bathroom.","【3-Minute Easy Installation】: Skip the complicated assembly! This shower shelf for inside shower features a simple Installation design, so you can put it together in just 3 minutes—no tools, no drilling. Perfect for anyone seeking a hassle-free storage solution.","【Versatile Multi-Functional Use】 Perfect as a bathroom corner shelf, a kitchen organizer, or a decorative plant stand, this corner shelf adapts to various storage needs. Its stylish design complements any decor, adding practical storage and a touch of rustic charm to any room."]');
