al choice for every room in the home','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n8idZPB5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EewYyGMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNrSE4eFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712YTGkzkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdI9CalRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716CYcXS0bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BHY3D28qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bTDJs6Z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,185,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F4XKFKSX',1778268555,1,NULL,'["【Versatile Multi-Functional Use】Our shower foot stool is made of natural bamboo ,well-made, protect you from scratches,overall size: 17.12\" L x 12.32\" W x 28.34\" H.Perfect as a bathroom corner shelf, a kitchen organizer, or a decorative plant stand, this corner shelf adapts to various storage needs. Its stylish design complements any decor, adding practical storage and a touch of rustic charm to any room.","【Easy To Assemble】This corner shower stool comes with all tools and instructions necessary for assembly, It has the advantage of novel structure, firmness, stability, simple assembly as well as convenient disassembly which takes less than 5 minutes.","【Spacious 3-Tier Storage】GUGIGIP Corner Shower Shelves Designed with three generously sized tiers, this corner shelf provides ample storage space for organizing toiletries, towels, plants, or kitchen essentials. Its vertical design maximizes storage while keeping everything neat and easily accessible.","【Water Resistant And Non-slip】Our bamboo shower stool adopts three waterproof processes, which greatly improves the durability of the product.At the same time,the bottom of shower bench has 3 Non-slip rubber feet prevent the shower stool sliding and protect the tile, floor.","【Sturdy and Stable Design】 Built with a strong, durable structure, this corner shelf stand can securely hold up to 300 lbs, providing reliable support for toiletries, plants, or decorative items. This stability makes it a safe and practical choice for every room in the home"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0DFYKWCV6','Premium Foldable Teak Bathtub Tray, Expandable Bath Tray for Tub, Luxury Bathtub & Bathroom Accessories','premium-foldable-teak-bathtub-tray-expandable-bath-tray-for-b0dfykwcv6','Kiasthome','Bath & Shower',49.99,'[Premium Quality Teak Wood] Crafted from natural grade A plantation teak, this bath tray boasts a stunning texture with a beautiful patina that only gets better with age. The teak wood is water-resistant and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting use. [Ultimate Convenience] Enjoy the ultimate relaxation experience with our spacious bath tray, providing ample room to hold all your bath essentials such as towels, wine glasses, candles, iPads, books, and more. Everything you need within reach while soaking in the tub. [Adjust Foldable Bath Caddy] Expertly forged & hand-crafted with your needs in mind, our bathtub tray table expands from 28 inches to 41⅓ inches, ensuring the perfect fit to even the widest tubs. Easy to use, simply pull from each end to your desired width. [Compact and Easy to Store] Our sleek design includes a foldable feature, allowing you to easily store the tray after each use and save valuable bathroom space. Installation is quick and simple, requiring no tools. [The Perfect Present] Surprise your friends and family with an elegant and luxurious gift that they will absolutely love. This bath tub tray is perfect for any occasion, including Christmas, Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, Father''s Day, weddings, or housewarming gifts for new homeowne','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SoZeFha8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IY+3fA1FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NvJ5Y9pNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UfsGLDyyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ONBdvZuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810yCdCQPgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126hYHa6HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,48,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DFYKWCV6',1778268579,1,NULL,'["[Premium Quality Teak Wood] Crafted from natural grade A plantation teak, this bath tray boasts a stunning texture with a beautiful patina that only gets better with age. The teak wood is water-resistant and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting use","[Ultimate Convenience] Enjoy the ultimate relaxation experience with our spacious bath tray, providing ample room to hold all your bath essentials such as towels, wine glasses, candles, iPads, books, and more. Everything you need within reach while soaking in the tub","[Adjust Foldable Bath Caddy] Expertly forged & hand-crafted with your needs in mind, our bathtub tray table expands from 28 inches to 41⅓ inches, ensuring the perfect fit to even the widest tubs. Easy to use, simply pull from each end to your desired width","[Compact and Easy to Store] Our sleek design includes a foldable feature, allowing you to easily store the tray after each use and save valuable bathroom space. Installation is quick and simple, requiring no tools","[The Perfect Present] Surprise your friends and family with an elegant and luxurious gift that they will absolutely love. This bath tub tray is perfect for any occasion, including Christmas, Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, Father''s Day, weddings, or housewarming gifts for new homeowne"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0D3D917W9','Teak Bathtub Tray - Luxury Bath Tray with Expandable Handles, Wine Glass and Phone Holders, Book Stand - Perfect for Home Spa Relaxation and Reading - Natural Bath Accessories - Light Walnut Color','teak-bathtub-tray-luxury-bath-tray-with-expandable-handles-w-b0d3d917w9','Fun Memories','Bath & Shower',59.88,'【Premium Quality Teak Wood】Crafted from natural grade A plantation teak, made of FSC-Certified wood, this bath tray is rich in natural oils with a gorgeous texture that becomes more beautiful over time. The teak wood is naturally resistant to water and easy to clean, so it lasts a lifetime!. 【Fully Adjustable】This versatile caddy can be expanded from 28½” to any length up to 40”, fitting snugly on single or double tubs and includes silicone grips for added stability. The 3 angled slots for tablets and books offer a comfortable viewing experience at any height.. 【Ultimate Convenience】Enjoy the ultimate relaxation experience with our spacious bath tray, providing ample room to hold all your bath essentials such as towels, wine glasses, candles, iPads, books, and more. Everything you need within reach while soaking in the tub.. 【Compact and Easy to Store】Our sleek design includes a foldable feature, allowing you to easily store the tray after each use and save valuable bathroom space. Installation is quick and simple, requiring no tools!. 【Perfect Gift】Our luxurious bath tray is an ideal gift for any occasion and makes a statement piece for any home décor style. Impressive as a housewarming, wedding, anniversary, Valentine''s Day, Christmas, or birthday present. Perfect for anyone who loves a good soak in the bathtub.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GqVWbB3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pDYNpmYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91D-Ou5wLHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819n6s4V2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yZrcyDgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnAqA8RUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YqsmymalL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,215,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D3D917W9',1778268586,1,NULL,'["【Premium Quality Teak Wood】Crafted from natural grade A plantation teak, made of FSC-Certified wood, this bath tray is rich in natural oils with a gorgeous texture that becomes more beautiful over time. The teak wood is naturally resistant to water and easy to clean, so it lasts a lifetime!","【Fully Adjustable】This versatile caddy can be expanded from 28½” to any length up to 40”, fitting snugly on single or double tubs and includes silicone grips for added stability. The 3 angled slots for tablets and books offer a comfortable viewing experience at any height.","【Ultimate Convenience】Enjoy the ultimate relaxation experience with our spacious bath tray, providing ample room to hold all your bath essentials such as towels, wine glasses, candles, iPads, books, and more. Everything you need within reach while soaking in the tub.","【Compact and Easy to Store】Our sleek design includes a foldable feature, allowing you to easily store the tray after each use and save valuable bathroom space. Installation is quick and simple, requiring no tools!","【Perfect Gift】Our luxurious bath tray is an ideal gift for any occasion and makes a statement piece for any home décor style. Impressive as a housewarming, wedding, anniversary, Valentine''s Day, Christmas, or birthday present. Perfect for anyone who loves a good soak in the bathtub."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FD4BG2P5','Command 15 lb Large Picture Hanging Strips 28 Pairs (56 Strips), Damage-Free Hanging Picture Hangers, No Tools Wall Hanger for Home Decor, White Adhesive','command-15-lb-large-picture-hanging-strips-28-pairs-56-strip-b0fd4bg2p5','Command','Wall & Décor',22.41,'Command White Large Picture Hanging Strips let you decorate how you want, when you want, without damaging surfaces. A great home improvement item, these picture hangers stick on a variety of smooth surfaces without leaving holes, marks or sticky residue. Use these wall hanging strips to hang picture frames, college dorm decor, wooden letters, nursery decor, calendars or to create a gallery wall. Simply mount these picture strips on painted walls, finished wood, painted concrete cinder blocks, laminate, glass, metal and tiles and enjoy the damage free hanging of your favorite decorations. Perfect for home renovators and college students, use these Command Picture Hanging Strips in your home, oﬃce, apartment or dorm room to elevate the appearance of your living or working space without tools. Directions are included, follow the directions closely to use the 3M Wall Hanging Strips as intended. A clever decorating solution that doesn’t damage surfaces, these wall hanger strips will help you fearlessly change your space. One package contains 28 pairs (56 Total) of large white picture hanging strips. Four adhesive strip pairs hold up to 16 pounds with a maximum frame size of 24 x 36 inches. Decorate, organize and celebrate damage free with Command.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Me7ZmdcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rdfp1bTpL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fM60HI2iL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815ids5ABaL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-VXTopM1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DEhZaeVyL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9VpMN+tL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711aE57p64L._SL1280_.jpg"]',4.6,110206,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FD4BG2P5',1778330758,1,NULL,'["MAXIMUM FRAME SIZE 24 X 36 INCHES: One package includes 28 pairs (56 strips total) of the Command Large Picture Hanging Strips, four wall adhesive strip pairs hold 16 pounds, maximum frame of 24 x 36 inches","WORKS ON A VARIETY OF SMOOTH SURFACES: Wall hanging strips work on a variety of smooth surfaces, including painted walls, finished wood, painted concrete cinder blocks, laminate, glass, metal and tiles","SURFACE PREP: Clean the desired surface with rubbing alcohol to remove grime and dust to allow the no damage wall hangers to bond to the surface, the indoor temperature must be between 5 degrees Fahrenheit and 15 degrees Fahrenheit","USAGE TIPS: Wait seven days after painting before using the Command Picture Hangers to allow paint to cure, do not hang over beds or on wallpaper, do not use the wall hanging strips to hang valuable items"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0BNL5MBMY','pickpiff Wall Hooks for Coat and Towel: 13LB Strong Adhesive Door Hanger Stick on, Black 4 Pack','pickpiff-wall-hooks-for-coat-and-towel-13lb-strong-adhesive-b0bnl5mbmy','pickpiff','Wall & Décor',9.99,'【Double Hook Design】4 pcs = 8 hook ends, Double the storage, half the spend!. 【Holds up to 13LB】Upgraded Wider base & extra-strong adhesive backing for heavy-duty use. 【Stainless】Never rust! Made of premium aluminum,they can be use in wet environment or outdoor. 【Peel and Stick】 Takes only seconds to install, No drilling/screws/nails/glue.. 【Versatile for Any Spacee】 adhesive hooks for bathrooms, RV, living room, kitchen, hangers for cooking tools, umbrellas, towels, coats, robes, keys, clothes, hats, wreath hanger for front door etc...','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FDBaTAd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r22YQvXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T3fXihI+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617vkDZZakL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610Deouk0AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612IlRy0aZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zArdhz4jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,5615,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNL5MBMY',1778330766,1,NULL,'["【Double Hook Design】4 pcs = 8 hook ends, Double the storage, half the spend!","【Holds up to 13LB】Upgraded Wider base & extra-strong adhesive backing for heavy-duty use","【Stainless】Never rust! Made of premium aluminum,they can be use in wet environment or outdoor","【Peel and Stick】 Takes only seconds to install, No drilling/screws/nails/glue.","【Versatile for Any Spacee】 adhesive hooks for bathrooms, RV, living room, kitchen, hangers for cooking tools, umbrellas, towels, coats, robes, keys, clothes, hats, wreath hanger for front door etc..."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0751TRS6Y','Command Small Wire Toggle Hooks, 16 Hooks and 24 Strips, Damage-Free Hanging Wall Hook with Adhesive, No Tools Required, Great for Home, Kitchen, and Office Organization, Holds up to 0.5 lb','command-small-wire-toggle-hooks-16-hooks-and-24-strips-damag-b0751trs6y','Command','Wall & Décor',11.99,'Command White Small Wire Hooks let you decorate and organize how you want, when you want, without damaging surfaces. A great home improvement item, these no damage wall hooks stick on a variety of smooth surfaces without leaving holes, marks or sticky residue. Use these hanging hooks to hang hats, calendars, keys, measuring spools, cleaning tools, jewelry and other small items. Simply mount these indoor wall adhesive hooks on painted walls, finished wood, painted concrete cinder blocks, laminate, glass, metal and tiles and enjoy the damage free hanging of your favorite small decorations and organizers. Perfect for home renovators and college students, use these wall hooks for hanging decorations and organizers in your home, office, apartment or dorm room to elevate the appearance of your living or working space without tools. Directions are included, follow the directions closely to use the wall hangers as intended. A clever decorating and organizing solution that doesn’t damage surfaces, these small wire tool free wall hangers will help you fearlessly change your space. One package contains 16 white wire toggle hooks and 24 small adhesive strips. Each single wall hanger can hold up to 0.5 pounds. Decorate, organize and celebrate damage free with Command.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7197f1OyLNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SdAsl0nUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HzZ1t-0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Osb7nh7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71klU3LlBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71URz4f5o7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K2HFsg51L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zN1k5VlyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YlbwkxzJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fq9vGf89L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VmgfEFBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,40893,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0751TRS6Y',1778330773,1,NULL,'["HOLDS UP TO 0.5 POUNDS: One package of the Command White Small Wire Toggle Hooks includes 16 wall hooks and 24 adhesive strips and a metal wire toggle feature for versatile hanging, each adhesive wall hook can hold up to 0.5 pounds","DAMAGE FREE HANGING: Wall hooks work without leaving holes, marks or sticky residue so you can move and rehang hats, calendars, keys, measuring spools, cleaning tools, jewelry and accessories","WORKS ON A VARIETY OF SMOOTH SURFACES: Adhesive wall hangers work on a variety of smooth surfaces, including painted walls, finished wood, painted concrete cinder blocks, laminate, glass, metal and tiles","SURFACE PREP: Clean with rubbing alcohol to remove grime and dust to allow the hanging hooks to bond to the surface, the indoor temperature must be between 50 degrees Fahrenheit and 105 degrees Fahrenheit","USAGE TIPS: Wait seven days after painting before using the Command Hooks to allow paint to cure, do not hang over beds or on wallpaper, do not use the wall hooks for hanging valuable items","EASY CLEAN REMOVAL: Lightly hold the top of the wall adhesive strips and slowly pull straight down towards the floor to remove the 3M Hooks and prevent damage of walls and surfaces, reuse your hook and hardware again by purchasing small refill strips","WHAT TO HANG: Use these adhesive hooks to hang hats, calendars, keys, measuring spools, cleaning tools, jewelry and accessories","REUSE WITH REPLACEMENT STRIPS: Reuse your Command hooks and hardware again by purchasing refill strips"]');
