ttps://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WWC3T9Q',1778332359,1,NULL,'["RADIANT REVITALIZATION: Face roller effectively relieves muscle tension, quickly reduces facial puffiness and redness, leaving your skin fresh, firm, and dewy - lifted. Ideal for daily stress relief","ENERGIZED SKIN: Crafted from authentic rose quartz, this at - home face massager provides instant cooling and energizes your skin. Use it with your favorite oil or serum to brighten your complexion","GUA SHA FOR LIFT AND SCULPT:Gua Sha effectively lifts skin, smooths fine lines with upward pressure, and precisely shapes your jawline, which can be used as a Jawline sculptor tool","COOLING MORING ROUTINE: Keep the facial jade roller and Gua Sha in the fridge for an extra - cool touch. It rapidly reduces morning puffiness and refreshes your skin - IcyMe. Packaging may vary","AN IDEAL GIFT FOR HER: The pink skincare tool in a thoughtful packaging, makes an ideal mothers day gifts for women. We recommend washing the set before and after each use"]');
