PHZS8MV',1778330831,1,NULL,'["HIGH QUALITY: the facial roller and guasha are handcrafted authentic Rose Quartz Stone from Salvador city, State of Bahia, Brazil. The rose quartz roller and gua sha stone - delicate charm and soothing color give a calming effect to the mind and body.","FACE ROLLER: rose quartz roller for face reduce facial puffiness and make your skin glow by refining the pores, eliminating toxins, and improving the elasticity of the skin while using your favorite oil/serum.","GUA SHA: the face massager helps you relieve tension, sculpt your face, and increase circulation. Use daily for a number of weeks and apply upwards pressure to remove double chin and combat ageing effects","EASY TO USE: our face massager is easy to use and comes with a comprehensive ebook guide to help you make the most out of your purchase","TIPS: keep it in the fridge and use it in the morning to reduce puffiness and give your skin a beautiful glow. Remove the rollers from the frame for a quick and easy clean.","Portable Set: The compact size makes these facial tools perfect for travel or on-the-go pampering."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0BJD3VC2M','Satin Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, Vegan Silk Pillowcase Set-2 Ivory Satin Pillowcases Standard Size, 1 Eye Mask, 1 Scrunchie-Luxury Sleep Set, White Pillow Cases with Envelope Closure','satin-pillowcase-for-hair-and-skin-vegan-silk-pillowcase-set-b0bjd3vc2m','URLINENS','Hair Care & Accessories',15.83,'Get a good night''s sleep with URLINENS'' satin sleep set! Are you annoying sleep hardly with poor-breathable pillowcases? Try to sleep on our ivory white satin pillowcase set, which ensures you get a good night''s rest and allow you to wake up beautiful and refreshed! Enjoy Better Life Cozy-up satin pillowcase for hair and skin provides a soft feeling to help establish a sound sleep all night, which everyone in your family will love. They’re super gentle for your skin and hair, reduce hair breakage and loss, reduce fine lines while sleeping. Creates less attrition to maintain lusters hair. Premium Satin Material Our white pillow cases sleep set are made of 100% polyester satin fabirc, make you feel soft and smooth. And the breathable material is good for you to sleep comfortably whether summer or winter. Ideal-Gift Best gift to improve sleep quality for your wife, husband, parents and show your concern. Send this superior quality satin pillow case set to your newlywed-friends to show your best wishes. Specification Color: Ivory White Material: 100% polyester satin Standard Size: 20’’x26’’ Packing List: 2 Satin pillowcases + 1 Eye mask + 1 Scrunchie','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6115ooHH0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E3ELIOYgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S-wYB5AIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DyzGIf5NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91owZGzGGvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713usA83w6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71faqed790L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,792,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJD3VC2M',1778330865,1,NULL,'["You Can Get: The URLINENS Satin Pillowcase Gift Set comes complete with two standard size (20x26in) satin pillowcases with envelope closure, a matching satin eye mask, and a matching scrunchie. Also exquisite packing is a good thoughtful gift for your loved ones!","Premium Silky Satin: Satin fabric is an ideal option for comfortable sleep, our luxury satin pillow case utilizes 100% silky satin to provide soft and smooth feeling for a night of restorative beauty sleep. And also compared with silk pillowcase, quality satin pillowcases are more sturdy and durable.","Protect Your Hair: This white satin pillowcase set will prevent hair moisture loss and protect natural hair oils, it''s helpful to reduce hair frizz, breakage and tangles, making you keep beautiful hairstyles and vibrant-look every day.","Enjoy Beauty Sleep: Sleeping on our white pillow cases is good to keep your skin hydrated, Not as drying as cotton, satin pillow cases help to reduce friction and maintain your skin moisturized, protecting your skin against facial sleep lines.","Easy Care: These high-quality satin materials have a smooth appearance and a long service life even after times of washing and wear. No wrinkle, stain and fade resistance, easy to maintain, machine wash in cold water, low drying."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F6ST3SRG','Yanibest 8 Pcs Satin Scrunchies - Silk Scrunchies Ponytail Holders, Soft Satin Hair Ties No Damage, Hair Accessories for Women','yanibest-8-pcs-satin-scrunchies-silk-scrunchies-ponytail-hol-b0f6st3srg','Symeno Select','Hair Care & Accessories',7.99,'Soft Butter Satin: The fabric and the gentle elasticity of scrunchies, making them less likely to cause headaches or discomfort when worn for extended periods. These hair scrunchies won''t leave an annoying bend in your hair if worn overnight because the soft butter satin. Gentle on Hair: Satin hair scrunchies are healthy for your hair texture, and unlike traditional scrunchies which can damage your hair. Our satin hair ties are soft and do not squeeze tight on the hair causing damage. Perfect for All Hair Types: Whether you have thick, thin, curly, or straight hair, Yanibest satin scrunchies provide girls and women with a reliable hold without slipping or causing sudden breakage. Multiple uses and Fashion Item: Silk Hair scrunchies are a type of hair accessory used to tie hair, and also can be a fashion item for your wrist. Lovely box included 8 pcs hair scrunchies brings you and your friends a good experience. Washing tips: Use a mild soap or specially formulated satin shampoos, soak satin scrunchies in warm water for 2-4 minutes. After a maximum of 5 minutes remove them from water and rinse them with cold water. Never bleach. Never expose satin to direct sunlight for longer periods of time','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W4X7bxazL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zi02sCncL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-gHsHfk5L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zT3LbsD-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZxCzMJQSL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ibBY18piL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-vNREgNTL._SL1500_.jpg"]',4.8,312,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F6ST3SRG',1778330874,1,NULL,'["Soft Butter Satin: The fabric and the gentle elasticity of scrunchies, making them less likely to cause headaches or discomfort when worn for extended periods. These hair scrunchies won''t leave an annoying bend in your hair if worn overnight because the soft butter satin","Gentle on Hair: Satin hair scrunchies are healthy for your hair texture, and unlike traditional scrunchies which can damage your hair. Our satin hair ties are soft and do not squeeze tight on the hair causing damage","Perfect for All Hair Types: Whether you have thick, thin, curly, or straight hair, Yanibest satin scrunchies provide girls and women with a reliable hold without slipping or causing sudden breakage","Multiple uses and Fashion Item: Silk Hair scrunchies are a type of hair accessory used to tie hair, and also can be a fashion item for your wrist. Lovely box included 8 pcs hair scrunchies brings you and your friends a good experience","Washing tips: Use a mild soap or specially formulated satin shampoos, soak satin scrunchies in warm water for 2-4 minutes. After a maximum of 5 minutes remove them from water and rinse them with cold water. Never bleach. Never expose satin to direct sunlight for longer periods of time"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FMNH1KHC','Vegan Silk Sleep Set, Vegan Silk Pillowcase with Large Scrunchie and Eye Mask for Hair and Skin, Self Care Essential Satin Night Routine Kit (Light Blue Color)','vegan-silk-sleep-set-vegan-silk-pillowcase-with-large-scrunc-b0fmnh1khc','KISMETICS','Hair Care & Accessories',13.49,'Vegan Silk Satin. COMPLETE BEAUTY SLEEP SET: Elevate your nightly routine with our vegan silk pillowcase set. This luxurious 3-item ensemble includes a standard size satin pillowcase (26inchX20inch), a satin eye mask, and a matching scrunchie. Whether at home or on the go, this set provides everything you need for a restful sleep.. SILKY SMOOTH SKIN AND HAIR: Bid farewell to frizzy hair and creased skin caused by traditional pillowcases. Our pillow case eye mask is meticulously crafted to resist moisture absorption, ensuring you wake up with rejuvenated skin and silky, tangle-free hair. Enjoy effortless enhancement to your beauty routine with our silk pillow case and scrunchie set, offering a truly luxurious and restorative sleep experience.. PERFECT GIFT FOR LOVED ONES: Ideal for moms, teenage girls, bridesmaids, and friends, our pillowcase scrunchies is the perfect gift for anyone seeking the luxury of a peaceful night''s sleep and the confidence of a radiant morning. Crafted from no silkworms were harmed in the making of this pillowcase, KISMETICS pillowcase offer a beautiful gift set. Simply toss it in with the regular wash for easy care (use a delicate''s bag to prevent snagging on zippers from other items).. CRUELTY-FREE VEGAN SILK: Our KISMETICS blue ombre satin pillowcase delivers the ultimate indulgence without compromising on ethics. Experience the luxurious feel of satin fabric, which some even find softer than natural silk. Rest easy knowing that no silkworms were harmed in the making of this pillowcase, aligning with our commitment to cruelty-free practices.. PERFECT FOR YOUR SKIN: The soft and silky-textured material of this Night Routine Kit limits friction from the fabric to your skin and reduces the apperance of sleep wrinkles. Unlike cotton fabric, this satin finish fabric is less absorbent, and your night time skincare will stay in place. The soft cotton padded vegan silk eye mask blocks out light and ensures complete darkness for a stress-free sleep.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Xsq6m6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p17t3e4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YpfG01zcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yj8jtGkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GHuzb0jrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S03CRDmEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OjWhhiGZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,99,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FMNH1KHC',1778330882,1,NULL,'["Vegan Silk Satin","COMPLETE BEAUTY SLEEP SET: Elevate your nightly routine with our vegan silk pillowcase set. This luxurious 3-item ensemble includes a standard size satin pillowcase (26inchX20inch), a satin eye mask, and a matching scrunchie. Whether at home or on the go, this set provides everything you need for a restful sleep.","SILKY SMOOTH SKIN AND HAIR: Bid farewell to frizzy hair and creased skin caused by traditional pillowcases. Our pillow case eye mask is meticulously crafted to resist moisture absorption, ensuring you wake up with rejuvenated skin and silky, tangle-free hair. Enjoy effortless enhancement to your beauty routine with our silk pillow case and scrunchie set, offering a truly luxurious and restorative sleep experience.","PERFECT GIFT FOR LOVED ONES: Ideal for moms, teenage girls, bridesmaids, and friends, our pillowcase scrunchies is the perfect gift for anyone seeking the luxury of a peaceful night''s sleep and the confidence of a radiant morning. Crafted from no silkworms were harmed in the making of this pillowcase, KISMETICS pillowcase offer a beautiful gift set. Simply toss it in with the regular wash for easy care (use a delicate''s bag to prevent snagging on zippers from other items).","CRUELTY-FREE VEGAN SILK: Our KISMETICS blue ombre satin pillowcase delivers the ultimate indulgence without compromising on ethics. Experience the luxurious feel of satin fabric, which some even find softer than natural silk. Rest easy knowing that no silkworms were harmed in the making of this pillowcase, aligning with our commitment to cruelty-free practices.","PERFECT FOR YOUR SKIN: The soft and silky-textured material of this Night Routine Kit limits friction from the fabric to your skin and reduces the apperance of sleep wrinkles. Unlike cotton fabric, this satin finish fabric is less absorbent, and your night time skincare will stay in place. The soft cotton padded vegan silk eye mask blocks out light and ensures complete darkness for a stress-free sleep."]');
