surface and sturdy durability.","Pattern design: A combination set of three classic elements: solid color twill, paisley pattern, and cross grid pattern. The necktie and pocket square patterns are consistent, suitable for various formal and informal occasions.","Properly packaged: Exquisite paper box packaging to protect the tie set from further folding, making it an excellent gift for men!"]');
