oth surface and comfortable feeling, It is not easy to wrinkle, pill or fade, and can provide you with long term use","Suitable Length: the size of the uniform ties for men is about 20 inches/ 51 cm long, It is suitable for matching men''s clothes of different styles to make you look attractive","Versatile Applications: these clip ties for men are not only suitable for formal occasions such as work, ceremony and banquet, but also suitable for leisure occasions such as shopping, party and dinner","Easy to Wear: this striped clip on tie adopts clip design, which is convenient for you to wear, The tie is tied in advance, so you do not need to tie it yourself, which can save you valuable time","Gifts for Men: you can give this clip tie to your father or boyfriend on your birthday, anniversary, Valentine''s Day and Father''s Day to express your love for them, and they will be happy the whole day"]');
