on.com/images/I/71q2BqdsGkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n3d2NsQnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,42627,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S35399Y',1778331135,1,NULL,'["Premium Fabric: Smooth and durable fabric protects clothes from wrinkles and stains, high performance feature makes the packing cubes can bear high density wear and tear during traveling, water-repellent feature protect your clothes from spill or leaks","Lightweight: Light fabric ensures storing clothes neatly in luggage without extra weight, Double way zipper with extended cord ensure easy using, Mesh top panel protect clothes from wrinkles and odors help identifying clothes to avoid fumbling in luggage","Organized Packing and Space Saving: Separating your different clothes with packing cubes of multiple sizes and vivid color options available, Time saving for traveling by avoiding misplacing different items and make full use of the space in your luggage","Versatile and Multi Functional: Fit into different sizes of suitcase, Small size bag in the set can also fit airline carry-on bags, tote, weekender, backpack, duffel bag, Suitable for family breaks, business travel, vacation, hiking, camping, trip, etc","Easy Travel: Packing cubes help efficiently sort and organize your clothes for easy access, saving time and effort while maximizing travel comfort"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B01EBXYZQ6','5 Set Packing Cubes for Travel Large Suitcase Luggage Organizer Bags Travel Accessories Vacation 4 Cubes 1 Laundry Pouch Bag','5-set-packing-cubes-for-travel-large-suitcase-luggage-organi-b01ebxyzq6','HOPSOOKEN','Bags & Pouches',18.89,'VALUE SET - 4 TRAVEL PACKING CUBES that includes: 2 Large Cubes (16.15 x 11.4 x 4.3 inches) & 1 Extra-Large Cubes (17.8 x 13.1 x 5.3 inches) & 1 Medium Cubes:(13.05 x 9.9 x 3.15 inches) Cubes:of the same color. One Laundry Bag (13.35 x 10.24 inches). FASHION DESIGN - Double zipper pulls make opening/closing simple and fast. Mesh top panel for easy identification of contents, and ventilation. Soft mesh won''t damage delicate fabrics. Webbing handle for convenience when carried by itself. HIGHT QUALITY: Made of high-quality fabric with finished interior seams to increase durability.. CONVENIENT AND ROMMY: PERFECT FOR HOTEL ROOM, Simply unpack cubes from the luggage straight to closet or drawers and avoid clutter. SAVE TIME AND STRESS, Find Items or cloths easily and fast. PROTECT YOUR CLOTHES AND LUGGAGE.. AVOID OVERWEIGHT CHARGES AND AIRPORT STRESS - Easily on spot rearrange weights between bags by switching travel cubes. Take 1 cube with you as a carry-on item to reduce weight on checked-in luggage. Airport Security checks are easier','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fowlXg2+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xykbhxJnL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61asawiIWzL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZzjqPDVL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YRGljVtSL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710tpTpIS4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mezrrYQ7L._AC_SL1100_.jpg"]',4.7,1376,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EBXYZQ6',1778331143,1,NULL,'["VALUE SET - 4 TRAVEL PACKING CUBES that includes: 2 Large Cubes (16.15 x 11.4 x 4.3 inches) & 1 Extra-Large Cubes (17.8 x 13.1 x 5.3 inches) & 1 Medium Cubes:(13.05 x 9.9 x 3.15 inches) Cubes:of the same color. One Laundry Bag (13.35 x 10.24 inches)","FASHION DESIGN - Double zipper pulls make opening/closing simple and fast. Mesh top panel for easy identification of contents, and ventilation. Soft mesh won''t damage delicate fabrics. Webbing handle for convenience when carried by itself","HIGHT QUALITY: Made of high-quality fabric with finished interior seams to increase durability.","CONVENIENT AND ROMMY: PERFECT FOR HOTEL ROOM, Simply unpack cubes from the luggage straight to closet or drawers and avoid clutter. SAVE TIME AND STRESS, Find Items or cloths easily and fast. PROTECT YOUR CLOTHES AND LUGGAGE.","AVOID OVERWEIGHT CHARGES AND AIRPORT STRESS - Easily on spot rearrange weights between bags by switching travel cubes. Take 1 cube with you as a carry-on item to reduce weight on checked-in luggage. Airport Security checks are easier"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B089RWVCGK','Premium Bamboo Rayon Crew Work Socks- Moisture Wicking, Odor Eliminating Crew Socks for Men','premium-bamboo-rayon-crew-work-socks-moisture-wicking-odor-e-b089rwvcgk','Symeno Select','Socks & Comfort Wear',28.9,'Super Soft & Comfortable Everyday, Hiking, and Work Boot Socks: These bamboo rayon socks are the softest and most comfortable performance socks on the market! The cushioned sole provides added comfort for long days on your feet. 80% Bamboo Rayon, 18% Polyester, 2% Spandex. Prevent Sweaty Feet: Bamboo rayon socks are moisture wicking so that your feet stay nice and dry even in extreme weather conditions. Our customers rave about these moisture wicking socks because they keep their feet dry even in extremely hot temperatures, on long hikes, during construction work and/or while doing intense all day jobs. Bamboo rayon socks are amazing and will keep your feet comfortable and dry all day!. Breathable & Temperature Regulating: Bamboo rayon socks are breathable and temperature regulating to keep your feet cool in the summer and warm in the winter. These socks keep your feet ventilated in steel toed boots, motorcycle boots, hiking books, rain boots, winter boots, military boots, cowboy boots, work boots and regular shoes. These socks are also perfect for a variety of outdoor activities such as hiking, camping, working, hunting, and backpacking.. May Eliminate Odor: The bamboo rayon fibers in our socks may help to eliminate odors to keep your feet smelling fresh even after wearing them all day. If you struggle with smelly feet after a long work day or a strenuous hike, then our bamboo rayon socks are exactly what you need! So, if you constantly battle stinky then our socks are going to be your new favorite socks!. Quality Construction: The high-quality material and construction of our mens crew socks ensures durability and longevity. They''re great for work, hiking, and/or everyday wear.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81681H8n7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hjx81x0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z4V5TZJUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lky4l1+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91q30KNJ4OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cCjVIdKxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IvVduhSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OGKtPsIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+PEJxzmSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,2599,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089RWVCGK',1778331159,1,NULL,'["Super Soft & Comfortable Everyday, Hiking, and Work Boot Socks: These bamboo rayon socks are the softest and most comfortable performance socks on the market! The cushioned sole provides added comfort for long days on your feet. 80% Bamboo Rayon, 18% Polyester, 2% Spandex","Prevent Sweaty Feet: Bamboo rayon socks are moisture wicking so that your feet stay nice and dry even in extreme weather conditions. Our customers rave about these moisture wicking socks because they keep their feet dry even in extremely hot temperatures, on long hikes, during construction work and/or while doing intense all day jobs. Bamboo rayon socks are amazing and will keep your feet comfortable and dry all day!","Breathable & Temperature Regulating: Bamboo rayon socks are breathable and temperature regulating to keep your feet cool in the summer and warm in the winter. These socks keep your feet ventilated in steel toed boots, motorcycle boots, hiking books, rain boots, winter boots, military boots, cowboy boots, work boots and regular shoes. These socks are also perfect for a variety of outdoor activities such as hiking, camping, working, hunting, and backpacking.","May Eliminate Odor: The bamboo rayon fibers in our socks may help to eliminate odors to keep your feet smelling fresh even after wearing them all day. If you struggle with smelly feet after a long work day or a strenuous hike, then our bamboo rayon socks are exactly what you need! So, if you constantly battle stinky then our socks are going to be your new favorite socks!","Quality Construction: The high-quality material and construction of our mens crew socks ensures durability and longevity. They''re great for work, hiking, and/or everyday wear."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B089GJV16Q','Premium Bamboo Rayon Quarter Crew Socks for Men Moisture Wicking Odor Control Cushioned Sole Breathable Work Socks','premium-bamboo-rayon-quarter-crew-socks-for-men-moisture-wic-b089gjv16q','Symeno Select','Socks & Comfort Wear',26.7,'Super Soft & Comfortable Premium Quarter High Socks with Arch Support: These bamboo rayon socks by Bamboo Sports are the softest and most comfortable performance socks on the market! They have a cushioned sole to keep your feet happy all day even while you’re on your feet for hours on concrete or in touch work environments. They also have a support band for added arch support and greater comfort. 80% Rayon Made from Bamboo, 18% Polyester, 2% Spandex. Helps Prevent Sweaty Feet: Our bamboo rayon socks are moisture wicking to help prevent sweaty, soggy feet even in extreme heat or high intensity conditions. Our customers rave about these socks because they keep their feet dry even in extremely hot temperatures, during sweaty workouts, construction work and/or while doing intense all day jobs. Our bamboo rayon socks are amazing and will keep your feet comfortable and dry with every step, no more soggy, sweaty discomfort!. May Help Eliminate Odor: The bamboo rayon fibers may help to eliminate odor and keep your feet fresh even after long days in work boots, intense workouts or strenuous hikes.Some customers even use these socks for long travel hours because they can wear them multiple days in a row without odor. If you struggle with foot odor, these Premium Bamboo Rayon Quarter High socks are exactly what you need to stay confident and comfortable.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kUBNqJ+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RoOz54EuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tmAsfmWpS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IUHMSnDeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FXI7zp-rS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zg57n+00S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hAVJXXk1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d7UJjeFfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mLVfz6LYL._AC_.jpg"]',4.4,1863,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GJV16Q',1778331167,1,NULL,'["Super Soft & Comfortable Premium Quarter High Socks with Arch Support: These bamboo rayon socks by Bamboo Sports are the softest and most comfortable performance socks on the market! They have a cushioned sole to keep your feet happy all day even while you’re on your feet for hours on concrete or in touch work environments. They also have a support band for added arch support and greater comfort. 80% Rayon Made from Bamboo, 18% Polyester, 2% Spandex","Helps Prevent Sweaty Feet: Our bamboo rayon socks are moisture wicking to help prevent sweaty, soggy feet even in extreme heat or high intensity conditions. Our customers rave about these socks because they keep their feet dry even in extremely hot temperatures, during sweaty workouts, construction work and/or while doing intense all day jobs. Our bamboo rayon socks are amazing and will keep your feet comfortable and dry with every step, no more soggy, sweaty discomfort!","May Help Eliminate Odor: The bamboo rayon fibers may help to eliminate odor and keep your feet fresh even after long days in work boots, intense workouts or strenuous hikes.Some customers even use these socks for long travel hours because they can wear them multiple days in a row without odor. If you struggle with foot odor, these Premium Bamboo Rayon Quarter High socks are exactly what you need to stay confident and comfortable."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GCB4ZQKP','Bamboo Crew Socks – Ultra-Soft, Breathable, Reinforced Toe & Heel','bamboo-crew-socks-ultra-soft-breathable-reinforced-toe-heel-b0gcb4zqkp','Symeno Select','Socks & Comfort Wear',14.99,'Discover ultimate comfort and durability with Nyboo crew socks. These innovative socks feature a specially engineered toe area made from a robust nylon-cotton blend, addressing the common issue of wear and tear at the toes while maintaining exceptional comfort throughout. The thoughtful design ensures these socks are built to last, offering superior resistance to holes and thinning at high-stress areas. The gray-colored socks provide a versatile addition to any wardrobe, suitable for everyday wear. Each pair comes individually packaged, reflecting the brand''s commitment to quality. The unique construction combines lasting durability with day-long comfort, making these socks an excellent choice for those seeking reliable, comfortable footwear solutions. Whether for work, casual wear, or daily activities, these socks deliver consistent performance and comfort with every wear.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lKTy3BWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713dCIvBgdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814+9+YN6iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ox02v9T6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aNKZe2b6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E+G9zmfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OJAlMsJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,22,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GCB4ZQKP',1778331176,1,NULL,'["NO MORE HOLES – REINFORCED TOE & HEEL NYBOO socks are built with a durable nylon-cotton blend in high-stress areas to help prevent tearing. Ideal for long shifts, work, and everyday wear.","ULTRA SOFT BAMBOO COMFORT NYBOO bamboo fabric delivers a smooth, ultra-soft feel that stays comfortable all day without irritation.","BREATHABLE & SWEAT-WICKING Designed with moisture-wicking bamboo fibers to keep feet dry and cool — perfect for sweaty feet and active lifestyles.","ODOR-RESISTANT FRESHNESS Stay fresh longer with odor-resistant fabric that helps reduce unwanted smells, even after extended wear.","PERFECT FOR WORK & EVERYDAY USE NYBOO crew socks offer a secure, stay-up fit that won’t slip or bunch — great for work, walking, gym, or daily use."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F4DBP354','TigeJoy Extra Large Picnic Blanket Waterproof Foldable 80''''x80'''', Outdoor Picnic Mat Beach Blanket Sandproof for Park, Grass, Travel, Hiking, Camping Essentials, Gingham Picnic Blanket','tigejoy-extra-large-picnic-blanket-waterproof-foldable-80x80-b0f4dbp354','TigeJoy','Outdoor & Picnic',22.99,'Thicker Filler for Comfort: TigeJoy picnic blanket is fully upgraded for next-level comfort. Thick, high-resilience cotton padding offers better support and softness. Whether sitting or lying down, you can fully relax, even on hard or uneven ground.. Water & Dirt Resistant: Our camping blanket is made for outdoor conditions. The top layer is water-repellent and stain-resistant. Just shake off drinks, dirt, or sand after use. The waterproof base blocks moisture and insulates against heat or cold from the ground, keeping you dry and comfortable at the park, beach, campsite, or backyard.. Multiple Sizes: Available in six sizes for all outdoor needs. Whether you’re using it as a baby play mat, picnic blanket, beach throw, or camping ground cover, there’s a perfect size for every activity — from solo trips to large family outings.. Easy to Carry: Folds up in minutes with a wide V-shaped Velcro strap that keeps it securely closed. Once packed, it’s compact and lightweight. The adjustable strap lets you carry it by hand or wear it crossbody, and it’s easy to store or toss in the car for your next trip.. Durable & Machine Washable: Built with strong diamond-pattern stitching that maintains its shape and keeps the padding evenly distributed. The fabric is designed for long-term outdoor use and is machine washable, making cleanup simple after every trip.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hp0hIc2gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pqzc-2KjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M0Gppj47L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A2Eu81iwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a9dchcpnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V5tuSKn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zKEpg7GoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HZE+p6mSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,400,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F4DBP354',1778331228,1,NULL,'["Thicker Filler for Comfort: TigeJoy picnic blanket is fully upgraded for next-level comfort. Thick, high-resilience cotton padding offers better support and softness. Whether sitting or lying down, you can fully relax, even on hard or uneven ground.","Water & Dirt Resistant: Our camping blanket is made for outdoor conditions. The top layer is water-repellent and stain-resistant. Just shake off drinks, dirt, or sand after use. The waterproof base blocks moisture and insulates against heat or cold from the ground, keeping you dry and comfortable at the park, beach, campsite, or backyard.","Multiple Sizes: Available in six sizes for all outdoor needs. Whether you’re using it as a baby play mat, picnic blanket, beach throw, or camping ground cover, there’s a perfect size for every activity — from solo trips to large family outings.","Easy to Carry: Folds up in minutes with a wide V-shaped Velcro strap that keeps it securely closed. Once packed, it’s compact and lightweight. The adjustable strap lets you carry it by hand or wear it crossbody, and it’s easy to store or toss in the car for your next trip.","Durable & Machine Washable: Built with strong diamond-pattern stitching that maintains its shape and keeps the padding evenly distributed. The fabric is designed for long-term outdoor use and is machine washable, making cleanup simple after every trip."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B01LON78FQ','Pocket Blanket - Beach Blanket Waterproof Sandproof, Picnic Blankets Waterproof Foldable, Lightweight & Compact for Hiking, Camping, Travel, Festival Accessories','pocket-blanket-beach-blanket-waterproof-sandproof-picnic-bla-b01lon78fq','BEARZ Outdoor','Outdoor & Picnic',27.99,'Polyester. Imported. ✔ VERSATILE STYLE – This multipurpose pocket blanket can be used as a picnic blanket, travel blanket, beach blanket, park blanket, camping blanket, and so much more! Whether you use it as part of your hiking, picnic or festival accessories, this nifty gadget will definitely come in handy. ✔ WATERPROOF, LIGHTWEIGHT, COMPACT – The unique fabric of this outdoor blanket is puncture resistant and highly durable, a perfect companion for your adventures in nature. It can keep you dry from the wet ground or use it as an improvised shelter from the rain. Hook it onto your backpack, throw it in your bag or keep it in your car, open up this portable, packable blanket and use it while at a concert, a c on a lawn, or anywhere outside. ✔ EASY TO FOLD, EASY TO CARRY & EASY TO USE – The outdoor blanket has corner pockets you can fill with sand or stones to keep it to the ground, or you may put your belongings in them. The pocket loops at each corner are ready for camping stakes. Did we mention it’s super easy to clean? Simply water or hose it down and voilà!. ✔ IDEAL SIZE 55" x 60" – The picnic blanket was designed to fit 2 people comfortably but can fit up to 4 people. The blanket comes with matching colored pouches and carabiners. Go outdoors prepared and in style. ✔ Why BEARZ Outdoor – We care about our products, and most of all, we care about our customers. Every little detail has been thought out to make these waterproof, lightweight, and durable outdoor blankets from their vibrant colors and intricate stitching to the hidden corner pockets and other unique added accessories. If you ever have any questions at all, contact us and we promise to take good care of you!','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+QVjdil1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zOLNsUKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QJOqEy4KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BP0xkFjCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813lavH30SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ypf+ZELOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SPU3lk1iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818GtkQF1gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,2533,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LON78FQ',1778331235,1,NULL,'["Polyester","Imported","✔ VERSATILE STYLE – This multipurpose pocket blanket can be used as a picnic blanket, travel blanket, beach blanket, park blanket, camping blanket, and so much more! Whether you use it as part of your hiking, picnic or festival accessories, this nifty gadget will definitely come in handy","✔ WATERPROOF, LIGHTWEIGHT, COMPACT – The unique fabric of this outdoor blanket is puncture resistant and highly durable, a perfect companion for your adventures in nature. It can keep you dry from the wet ground or use it as an improvised shelter from the rain. Hook it onto your backpack, throw it in your bag or keep it in your car, open up this portable, packable blanket and use it while at a concert, a c on a lawn, or anywhere outside","✔ EASY TO FOLD, EASY TO CARRY & EASY TO USE – The outdoor blanket has corner pockets you can fill with sand or stones to keep it to the ground, or you may put your belongings in them. The pocket loops at each corner are ready for camping stakes. Did we mention it’s super easy to clean? Simply water or hose it down and voilà!","✔ IDEAL SIZE 55\" x 60\" – The picnic blanket was designed to fit 2 people comfortably but can fit up to 4 people. The blanket comes with matching colored pouches and carabiners. Go outdoors prepared and in style","✔ Why BEARZ Outdoor – We care about our products, and most of all, we care about our customers. Every little detail has been thought out to make these waterproof, lightweight, and durable outdoor blankets from their vibrant colors and intricate stitching to the hidden corner pockets and other unique added accessories. If you ever have any questions at all, contact us and we promise to take good care of you!"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B097P26RLV','sapsisel 80”x 80” Picnic Blanket Extra Large, Waterproof and Foldable Beach Blanket, 3-Layer Outdoor Blanket for 6 to 8 Adults, for Camping, Park, Beach, Grass, Indoors…','sapsisel-80x-80-picnic-blanket-extra-large-waterproof-and-fo-b097p26rlv','sapsisel','Outdoor & Picnic',28.99,'80” x 80” Extra Large: With 80” long and 80” width, the picnic blanket can allow 6-8 persons to sit on, or 4 persons to lie on. It’s large enough for family use or picnic with several friends. And it’s just a 16 inches long cylinder with a 9-inch diameter when you roll it up.. Waterproof and Sandproof Picnic blanket: The picnic blanket is great choice for beach, park, or bleachers thanks to its PEVA waterproof and sandproof backing. You can easily shake and wipe off dirt, wet grass and beach sand. The picnic blanket is designed to keep out the moisture and make you seat more comfortable.. 3 Layers Comfortable Structure: The Acrylic fiber on the top, foam in the middle, and a waterproof layer on the bottom. The top layer is soft enough to let you comfortably nap in the sun and gentle enough for a baby to lie. With the foam in the middle, you won’t feel uncomfortable even if you picnic for a long time. The waterproof bottom resists dirt, sand and water.. Lightweight and Foldable: The picnic blanket has 7 layers doesn’t mean it’s heavy—it has a lightweight design, so it’s designed for carry around. This park blanket can be packed as a classic roll-up style, you can pack it easily with the adjustable belt which comes with the picnic blanket. The belt also has a hand strap. It’ll be easy to take this blanket anywhere.. Designed for Outdoor and Indoor Use: It''s suitable for going out and relax on the Sapsisel picnic blanket, which offers the best combination of comfort, durability and compactness. Designed for picnic, camping, hiking, climbing, beach, grass, park, outdoor concert, and it’s also great to use as playing mat for kids indoor and outdoor.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yyr8ckmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817mcbXR3hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L-mZGheyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hhF-G0OhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xsMRZVZCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bBgBZH55L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wwm4qEp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lxk4hwdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,1721,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097P26RLV',1778331242,1,NULL,'["80” x 80” Extra Large: With 80” long and 80” width, the picnic blanket can allow 6-8 persons to sit on, or 4 persons to lie on. It’s large enough for family use or picnic with several friends. And it’s just a 16 inches long cylinder with a 9-inch diameter when you roll it up.","Waterproof and Sandproof Picnic blanket: The picnic blanket is great choice for beach, park, or bleachers thanks to its PEVA waterproof and sandproof backing. You can easily shake and wipe off dirt, wet grass and beach sand. The picnic blanket is designed to keep out the moisture and make you seat more comfortable.","3 Layers Comfortable Structure: The Acrylic fiber on the top, foam in the middle, and a waterproof layer on the bottom. The top layer is soft enough to let you comfortably nap in the sun and gentle enough for a baby to lie. With the foam in the middle, you won’t feel uncomfortable even if you picnic for a long time. The waterproof bottom resists dirt, sand and water.","Lightweight and Foldable: The picnic blanket has 7 layers doesn’t mean it’s heavy—it has a lightweight design, so it’s designed for carry around. This park blanket can be packed as a classic roll-up style, you can pack it easily with the adjustable belt which comes with the picnic blanket. The belt also has a hand strap. It’ll be easy to take this blanket anywhere.","Designed for Outdoor and Indoor Use: It''s suitable for going out and relax on the Sapsisel picnic blanket, which offers the best combination of comfort, durability and compactness. Designed for picnic, camping, hiking, climbing, beach, grass, park, outdoor concert, and it’s also great to use as playing mat for kids indoor and outdoor."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B010OLZ3E2','Survivor Filter Clear Collapsible Water Bottles - Travel, Hiking, Foldable, BPA-Free - 2 x','survivor-filter-clear-collapsible-water-bottles-travel-hikin-b010olz3e2','Survivor Filter','Outdoor & Picnic',16.95,'The perfect companion for your Survivor Filter. If you need a lightweight, space-saving way to carry clean water, these collapsible water bottle canteens are made for you. Designed to work perfectly with the Survivor Filter Straw, they let you drink safely anywhere — or use them as a regular water bottle when you already have clean water. (Survivor Filter straw sold separately – or in bundle with squeeze kit.) Ultra-light and compact: Weighs just 0.4 ounces and rolls up to fit in your pocket, glove box, or backpack. Ideal if you’re short on space or packing for travel, camping, hiking, or emergencies preparedness. Durable, reusable, and BPA-free: Built from tough, taste-free materials that last trip after trip. Smart, adventure-ready design: Integrated handle and carabiner make it easy to clip to your bag or belt. Push-pull cap keeps your drinking area clean. Ready for any situation: Perfect for camping, hiking, fishing, backpacking, or bug-out kits. A practical backup water carrier for preppers and outdoor enthusiasts. Also, being so light and portable, they are fantastic for music festivals to store your drinks in an easyily carriable way, whilst you dance the night away! Turn your Survivor Filter into a complete, adaptable hydration system — backed by a Lifetime Manufacturer’s Warranty.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hXqFIhOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P0ubfm+CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911jNxJ6LNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mnL7UNZQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ue2-D3O1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wP3KFxg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yz+kyiwSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nWGp-FhNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.2,3451,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010OLZ3E2',1778331260,1,NULL,'["Collapsible Water Bottle - Ideal collapsible water bottles for traveling. Each leak proof canteen can attach to any portable water filter with a 28 mm thread and holds 33oz (1L) of water.","Hiking Water Bottles - With built-in handles and sturdy carabiners, these canteens can clip on to most backpacks and make staying hydrated easy. Fill up when needed, or roll them and tuck them away.","BPA Free Squeeze Water Bottles - Each foldable water bottle is durable and made for outdoor environments. Comes with a mouthpiece cover to protect it from dirt and damage. Easy to clean.","Lightweight and Reusable - Each hiking water bottle can be used many times. When empty, they are only weigh 2.4oz, so you can take them on any adventure.","Manufacturer''s Warranty For A Lifetime - We are a North American company and we cover all manufacturing and other defects with our lifetime warranty. Our philosophy is that every customer is for life."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0D8SSF49G','Collapsible Water Bottles Travel water bottle Sports Portable Sport Water Bottle Reusable Water Bottles comes with mountaineering Buckle 500ml silicone Water-proof camping water bottle','collapsible-water-bottles-travel-water-bottle-sports-portabl-b0d8ssf49g','YCTMALL','Outdoor & Picnic',16.99,'Collapsible silicone water bottle is made of food grade silicone, free of BPA , safe and healthy to use. The temperature ranges from -20℃ to 60℃. Blue+Pink camouflage.. This foldable water bottle is very lightweight and easy to carry. The lightweight water bottles for travel can hold 500ml of liquid. After folding, it is converted from 24cm (height) to 13.5cm without taking up space.. This collapsible water bottle for traveling is equipped with mountaineering buckle, which can be easily hung on your backpack. It is a good helper for you to travel, outdoor mountaineering, fitness running.. The retractable water bottle contains silicone sealing ring, put inside the backpack without worrying about leakage. The lid can be removed for easy cleaning and ice storage.. These two pack camping silicone water bottle is of top quality, with a high quality silicone material, so you don''t need to worry about breaking when dropped.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+0zGumpdL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rwJB-RFBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716t0XCqYfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYuQSK8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EWyvtmbPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q1OXPFdnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UenPLZLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IRG-kyKyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.1,1862,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D8SSF49G',1778331267,1,NULL,'["Collapsible silicone water bottle is made of food grade silicone, free of BPA , safe and healthy to use. The temperature ranges from -20℃ to 60℃. Blue+Pink camouflage.","This foldable water bottle is very lightweight and easy to carry. The lightweight water bottles for travel can hold 500ml of liquid. After folding, it is converted from 24cm (height) to 13.5cm without taking up space.","This collapsible water bottle for traveling is equipped with mountaineering buckle, which can be easily hung on your backpack. It is a good helper for you to travel, outdoor mountaineering, fitness running.","The retractable water bottle contains silicone sealing ring, put inside the backpack without worrying about leakage. The lid can be removed for easy cleaning and ice storage.","These two pack camping silicone water bottle is of top quality, with a high quality silicone material, so you don''t need to worry about breaking when dropped."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FWK9LML9','Collapsible Water Bottles,16oz Portable Reusable Silicone Water Bottle,Leak-proof,with buckle,foldable storage,Lightweight Durable for Fitness,Cycling,Sports,Camping,Hiking (Black+Green)','collapsible-water-bottles16oz-portable-reusable-silicone-wat-b0fwk9lml9','Tundoro','Outdoor & Picnic',15.99,'COLLAPSIBLE DESIGN - Crafted from flexible food-grade silicone, this foldable water bottle can be compressed to a compact size when empty, maximizing space in your backpack. The reusable 16oz water bottle effortlessly bounces back to its original shape.. LEAK-PROOF SECURITY - Engineered with a precision sealed cap, this collapsible water bottle guarantees leak-proof performance. Your belongings stay completely dry whether you''re commuting or hiking.. PORTABLE CONVENIENCE - Featuring a durable climbing buckle, this foldable water bottle easily attaches to backpacks, gear loops, or belts. The 16oz reusable bottle is your ideal travel companion for any adventure.. DURABLE MATERIAL - Constructed with high-grade silicone and reinforced with stainless steel accents, this collapsible water bottle maintains its integrity through repeated use. The reusable 16oz bottle withstands daily wear while staying leak-proof.. VERSATILE USE - From gym sessions to camping trips, this 16oz foldable water bottle adapts to all your hydration needs. The leak-proof reusable bottle is perfect for hiking, travel, sports, and outdoor activities.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FQUHDLDJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DZaEoL35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W7MnDxffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DsBj8f3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nzGGk+2AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S-iqsy1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81etJ4QsmxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VPPDGw5AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.1,61,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FWK9LML9',1778331275,1,NULL,'["COLLAPSIBLE DESIGN - Crafted from flexible food-grade silicone, this foldable water bottle can be compressed to a compact size when empty, maximizing space in your backpack. The reusable 16oz water bottle effortlessly bounces back to its original shape.","LEAK-PROOF SECURITY - Engineered with a precision sealed cap, this collapsible water bottle guarantees leak-proof performance. Your belongings stay completely dry whether you''re commuting or hiking.","PORTABLE CONVENIENCE - Featuring a durable climbing buckle, this foldable water bottle easily attaches to backpacks, gear loops, or belts. The 16oz reusable bottle is your ideal travel companion for any adventure.","DURABLE MATERIAL - Constructed with high-grade silicone and reinforced with stainless steel accents, this collapsible water bottle maintains its integrity through repeated use. The reusable 16oz bottle withstands daily wear while staying leak-proof.","VERSATILE USE - From gym sessions to camping trips, this 16oz foldable water bottle adapts to all your hydration needs. The leak-proof reusable bottle is perfect for hiking, travel, sports, and outdoor activities."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FBW6NJC5','KUTIZE Ankle Resistance Bands with Cuffs & Fabric Resistance Bands Set - Legs & Glutes Workout Equipment for Women & Men, Home Gym Heavy Exercise Bands for Hip, Yoga, Strength Training, Rehab, Pilates','kutize-ankle-resistance-bands-with-cuffs-fabric-resistance-b-b0fbw6njc5','KUTIZE','Fitness Accessories',21.77,'Maximize Fitness Results: Has your body fat percentage plateaued at 18% for 3 months straight? Burning Under 300 Calories per Workout? Try KUTIZE Resistance Bands Set—our scientifically engineered synergistic training system includes:Ankle resistance bands with cuffs (10/20/30lbs) and 3 Heavy fabric resistance bands (20-50lbs),Simultaneously trains upper and lower body to unlock up to 83% more muscle activation vs single bands.. Resistance Bands Set = 2X Gains at 1/3 Cost: Our ultimate budget-friendly strength solution – ankle resistance bands with cuffs & fabric band kit. Saves 30% vs. buying cable machines, Hip thrust machine, hip abductor & other gear separately + cuts workout time by 50%. See visible improvements in 21 days: sculpted calves, defined abs, peach-shaped glutes.. Break Through Training Plateaus & Ditch Single-Workout Equipment Boredom: This versatile system diversifies your training modes to eliminate workout boredom while delivering targeted high-efficiency workouts for legs, hips, butt, arms, and core—ideally suited for strength training, yoga, Pilates, body sculpting, rehabilitation, and postpartum recovery, with adjustable resistance for all fitness levels from beginners to professionals.. Premium Materials: Designed for sensitive skin, these fabric resistance bands for working out stay comfortable during intense workouts—whether worn directly against skin or over clothing. The booty bands combine cotton-polyester with latex for durable elasticity that resists fraying or rolling. At 3.3in wide, they prevent pinching during squats and lunges, while adjustable ankle cuffs with cushioned neoprene padding lock in place for secure stability during high-intensity leg/speed training.. Sculpted, Peach-Perfect Glutes: Our fabric resistance bands for women are engineered for glute activation! During bridges, kickbacks, and clamshells, the wraparound resistance intensely engages your upper gluteus maximus. See the potential for rounder, lifted contours in 30 days—effectively combating sagging or flat contours. Achieve that "jeans-ready lift" for a peach-perfect silhouette! It''s your most perfect glutes workout equipment！. Tighten thighs and reduce cellulite::Our adjustable ankle exercise bands feature dual D-ring cuffs + breathable mesh for slip-proof wear, targeting inner/outer thighs and calves! Just 15-minute daily sessions of squats, kickbacks, lateral lifts, or leg extensions reveal visibly firmer contours. Adding resistance band intensity may help boost calorie burn during exercise while accelerating muscle definition—ankle weights for women, all from your home!. Portable and space saving: This set is lightweight and complete, equipped with a portable mesh storage bag that can quickly expand your training whether at home, gym, office, or on the go - turning any room into your Pilates space. Whether you want to give a gift or upgrade your fitness equipment, this set is the ideal choice for home fitness enthusiasts who want to enhance their feel, exercise, and quality of life.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Uqpe5nRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PHW5n6OFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717BuaowUbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sj-J-2eDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71slAkuxIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IzYgBIc8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RDGBbLt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vN9QsEmXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,71,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FBW6NJC5',1778331300,1,NULL,'["Maximize Fitness Results: Has your body fat percentage plateaued at 18% for 3 months straight? Burning Under 300 Calories per Workout? Try KUTIZE Resistance Bands Set—our scientifically engineered synergistic training system includes:Ankle resistance bands with cuffs (10/20/30lbs) and 3 Heavy fabric resistance bands (20-50lbs),Simultaneously trains upper and lower body to unlock up to 83% more muscle activation vs single bands.","Resistance Bands Set = 2X Gains at 1/3 Cost: Our ultimate budget-friendly strength solution – ankle resistance bands with cuffs & fabric band kit. Saves 30% vs. buying cable machines, Hip thrust machine, hip abductor & other gear separately + cuts workout time by 50%. See visible improvements in 21 days: sculpted calves, defined abs, peach-shaped glutes.","Break Through Training Plateaus & Ditch Single-Workout Equipment Boredom: This versatile system diversifies your training modes to eliminate workout boredom while delivering targeted high-efficiency workouts for legs, hips, butt, arms, and core—ideally suited for strength training, yoga, Pilates, body sculpting, rehabilitation, and postpartum recovery, with adjustable resistance for all fitness levels from beginners to professionals.","Premium Materials: Designed for sensitive skin, these fabric resistance bands for working out stay comfortable during intense workouts—whether worn directly against skin or over clothing. The booty bands combine cotton-polyester with latex for durable elasticity that resists fraying or rolling. At 3.3in wide, they prevent pinching during squats and lunges, while adjustable ankle cuffs with cushioned neoprene padding lock in place for secure stability during high-intensity leg/speed training.","Sculpted, Peach-Perfect Glutes: Our fabric resistance bands for women are engineered for glute activation! During bridges, kickbacks, and clamshells, the wraparound resistance intensely engages your upper gluteus maximus. See the potential for rounder, lifted contours in 30 days—effectively combating sagging or flat contours. Achieve that \"jeans-ready lift\" for a peach-perfect silhouette! It''s your most perfect glutes workout equipment！","Tighten thighs and reduce cellulite::Our adjustable ankle exercise bands feature dual D-ring cuffs + breathable mesh for slip-proof wear, targeting inner/outer thighs and calves! Just 15-minute daily sessions of squats, kickbacks, lateral lifts, or leg extensions reveal visibly firmer contours. Adding resistance band intensity may help boost calorie burn during exercise while accelerating muscle definition—ankle weights for women, all from your home!","Portable and space saving: This set is lightweight and complete, equipped with a portable mesh storage bag that can quickly expand your training whether at home, gym, office, or on the go - turning any room into your Pilates space. Whether you want to give a gift or upgrade your fitness equipment, this set is the ideal choice for home fitness enthusiasts who want to enhance their feel, exercise, and quality of life."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FZR9DV2F','Ab Roller Wheel for Abs Workout - Core Strength Training Equipment for Home Gym with Knee Pad, Abdominal Exercise Wheel for Men and Women','ab-roller-wheel-for-abs-workout-core-strength-training-equip-b0fzr9dv2f','SaintCos','Fitness Accessories',22.99,'【Ultra-Wide Wheels for Rock-Solid Stability】：3.4-inch extra-wide dual wheels redefine stability, surpassing traditional single-wheel designs. Inspired by sports car tire principles, they provide a reinforced support base that effectively prevents tipping or wobbling during use. Perfect for beginners to master proper form with confidence and tackle core training safely.. 【Superior Grip for All Floor Types】：The tire-inspired tread pattern enhances traction on any surface. Its uniquely textured wheel surface significantly increases friction on hardwood, tile, laminate, and even carpets or yoga mats, preventing slippage and ensuring precise control during roll-outs and returns. This maximizes both workout efficiency and safety.. 【Heavy-Duty Construction for Lasting Performance】：Built with a high-carbon steel core, this ab wheel supports up to 440 lbs (200 kg), making it ideal for intense training. The reinforced steel tube construction has undergone rigorous pressure testing, guaranteeing it remains firm and wobble-free through long-term use, adapting to all fitness levels.. 【Ergonomic & Non-Slip Comfort Grip】：Features high-density rubber foam handles for extreme slip resistance and durability. This advanced rubber foam material offers greater wear and tear resistance compared to ordinary EVA, ensuring long-lasting comfort. The ergonomic design effectively disperses palm pressure, maintaining a secure and comfortable grip even during the most strenuous workouts.. 【Compact & Portable for On-the-Go Fitness】：Its one-piece, lightweight design brings the gym to you. Forget bulky equipment – this compact roller stores easily in a corner, under a bed, or in a travel bag. Whether at home, in the office, or on the road, you can maintain your core workout routine anywhere, anytime.. 【Full-Body Fitness in One Efficient Tool】：While excellent for targeting abs, this roller truly delivers a complete workout. It deeply engages the chest, shoulders, back, arms, and glutes, simultaneously building core strength and enhancing overall body coordination. It''s the ultimate all-in-one solution for your home gym.. 【The Perfect Gift for Fitness Enthusiasts】：With its premium quality and professional design, this ab roller is an ideal gift for friends, family, or yourself. It’s a thoughtful present that shows you care about their health and well-being, helping your loved ones kickstart their fitness journey.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qVlRPPD3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UPaXc5i+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813w44jQOKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718a6Z3G2+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712ml8vmX4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tx92fp0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8131s+f9PlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wnoxeOV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.8,30,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FZR9DV2F',1778331326,1,NULL,'["【Ultra-Wide Wheels for Rock-Solid Stability】：3.4-inch extra-wide dual wheels redefine stability, surpassing traditional single-wheel designs. Inspired by sports car tire principles, they provide a reinforced support base that effectively prevents tipping or wobbling during use. Perfect for beginners to master proper form with confidence and tackle core training safely.","【Superior Grip for All Floor Types】：The tire-inspired tread pattern enhances traction on any surface. Its uniquely textured wheel surface significantly increases friction on hardwood, tile, laminate, and even carpets or yoga mats, preventing slippage and ensuring precise control during roll-outs and returns. This maximizes both workout efficiency and safety.","【Heavy-Duty Construction for Lasting Performance】：Built with a high-carbon steel core, this ab wheel supports up to 440 lbs (200 kg), making it ideal for intense training. The reinforced steel tube construction has undergone rigorous pressure testing, guaranteeing it remains firm and wobble-free through long-term use, adapting to all fitness levels.","【Ergonomic & Non-Slip Comfort Grip】：Features high-density rubber foam handles for extreme slip resistance and durability. This advanced rubber foam material offers greater wear and tear resistance compared to ordinary EVA, ensuring long-lasting comfort. The ergonomic design effectively disperses palm pressure, maintaining a secure and comfortable grip even during the most strenuous workouts.","【Compact & Portable for On-the-Go Fitness】：Its one-piece, lightweight design brings the gym to you. Forget bulky equipment – this compact roller stores easily in a corner, under a bed, or in a travel bag. Whether at home, in the office, or on the road, you can maintain your core workout routine anywhere, anytime.","【Full-Body Fitness in One Efficient Tool】：While excellent for targeting abs, this roller truly delivers a complete workout. It deeply engages the chest, shoulders, back, arms, and glutes, simultaneously building core strength and enhancing overall body coordination. It''s the ultimate all-in-one solution for your home gym.","【The Perfect Gift for Fitness Enthusiasts】：With its premium quality and professional design, this ab roller is an ideal gift for friends, family, or yourself. It’s a thoughtful present that shows you care about their health and well-being, helping your loved ones kickstart their fitness journey."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0CH3LQK1W','2026 Upgraded Ab Roller Wheel with Knee Mat &Timer - Automatic Rebound Abdominal Wheel with Elbow Support, Abs Workout Equipment for Core Strength Training, Ab Exercise Roller for Women Men','2026-upgraded-ab-roller-wheel-with-knee-mat-timer-automatic-b0ch3lqk1w','Bersauji','Fitness Accessories',27.99,'2026 New Ab Roller Wheel with Knee Mat &Timer, Automatic Rebound Abdominal Wheel Specification： Material: Alloy Steel+Plastic+Rubber Color：Black/Orange/Blue Function: works your muscles Weight: 3.5 Pounds/1600 gramsSize: 40cm x 15cm x 17cm/15.74 x 5.9 x 6.69 inches Why choose us? 1.The surface of this ab roller wheel is natural rubber, which makes very little noice and will not disturb others. 2.The ab roller wheels are made of high-density rubber material to ensure it withstands even the most intense workout sessions, which will not damage the floor. 3.A strong core will help you perform a long list of daily movements with greater ease and a reduced risk of injury. It can support up to 800lbs. 4.It works your muscles and joints effectively and helps with overall body exercise and weight loss. Package included:1 x Ab roller wheels1x Timer1x Mat','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rRL3g0YtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+NzLXGEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YXxImtZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zSAcSst3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wJ0f4Bf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pxH1vfn+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71amryvG-IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mqv-ucI3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,1632,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CH3LQK1W',1778331335,1,NULL,'["ABS","【Ab Roller Automatic Rebound Assistance】This ab roller features a built-in assisted rebound system with a steel spring mechanism that provides smooth, controlled return movement. The intelligent braking support helps beginners avoid overextension and reduces strain during core training","【Stable Double-Wheel Design】Wider front and rear wheels offer enhanced balance and smoother rolling on various floor surfaces. This dual-wheel configuration supports better control during each rollout, helping you engage core muscles safely—ideal for home workouts and fitness beginners","【Quiet & Floor-Friendly Build】Bersauji This ab roller from durable ABS plastic and Stainless steel, with sponge grips that are non-slip, sweat-absorbent, comfortable, fade-resistant, Will not make noise or scratch floors and is durable","【Ergonomic with Elbow Support】Designed with an elbow rest and ergonomic structure to reduce wrist pressure while targeting abs, back, shoulders, and chest. This full-core support helps maintain proper form, supporting both muscle shaping and trunk line definition","【Build your 6-packs abs quickly】This ab roller wheel burns fat fast, helps men and women accelerate core toning and supports the visibility of six-pack abs. Help you quickly shape your body and improve muscle strength! Ideal for daily abdominal training, home fitness and progressive fat burning goals"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B07RKW5H68','VINSGUIR Ab Roller Wheel, Abs & Core Workout Equipment for Home Gym with Knee Pad Accessories, Abdominal Wheel for Full-body Strength Training','vinsguir-ab-roller-wheel-abs-core-workout-equipment-for-home-b07rkw5h68','VINSGUIR','Fitness Accessories',23.99,'【More Accessible & Hassle Free】The 3.2 inch dual-wheel ab roller offers extra support and stability compared to the common single ab wheel. Equipped with a knee pad, this ab roller wheel delivers comfortable workout experience and caring protection. Just embrace the freedom of more thrilling and challenging routines without the hassle of using resistance bands!. 【Grow Six Packs Faster & Safer】The Vinsguir abs wheel targets your abdominals, hip flexors and back muscles. With dedicated practice, this exercise wheel will speed up your core & low back strengthening while lessoning your risk of muscle injury.. 【Efficient Exercise Equipment】Unlike big gym machines, or heavy weight benches, dumbbells and the like, the Vinsguir ab wheel roller is portable size-wise -- a compact design that enables you to take it anywhere to exercise, be it your home, office, gym, or outdoors.. 【Amazingly Durable & Stable】The high-strength stainless steel shaft of the ab roller for abs workout can hold a maximum weight of 440 pounds for your safety. The 3.2 inch ultra-wide abs roller ensures balance and stability as it does not deviate sideways. EVA rubber cotton handles provide nonslip and comfortable grip.. 【Top Gift Choice for Fitness Enthusiasts】This workout roller goes beyond working your abs and burning your fat. As a versatile roller wheel, it is of no contest when it comes to selecting an ideal gift for your family and friends, not to mention the satisfaction guaranteed after-sales services. Wish you a joyful shopping experience!. 30-DAY NO HASSLE RETURNS 12-MONTH WARRANTY & LIFETIME CUSTOMER SERVICE.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WYhvuQfbL._AC_SL1497_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GPGiBJ+DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CXlfhaE7L._AC_SL1254_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MOESrxROL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pro+u8iiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xwr-ZraWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VoU2zAUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sItr0ileL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Jo3jtqdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,23294,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RKW5H68',1778331342,1,NULL,'["【More Accessible & Hassle Free】The 3.2 inch dual-wheel ab roller offers extra support and stability compared to the common single ab wheel. Equipped with a knee pad, this ab roller wheel delivers comfortable workout experience and caring protection. Just embrace the freedom of more thrilling and challenging routines without the hassle of using resistance bands!","【Grow Six Packs Faster & Safer】The Vinsguir abs wheel targets your abdominals, hip flexors and back muscles. With dedicated practice, this exercise wheel will speed up your core & low back strengthening while lessoning your risk of muscle injury.","【Efficient Exercise Equipment】Unlike big gym machines, or heavy weight benches, dumbbells and the like, the Vinsguir ab wheel roller is portable size-wise -- a compact design that enables you to take it anywhere to exercise, be it your home, office, gym, or outdoors.","【Amazingly Durable & Stable】The high-strength stainless steel shaft of the ab roller for abs workout can hold a maximum weight of 440 pounds for your safety. The 3.2 inch ultra-wide abs roller ensures balance and stability as it does not deviate sideways. EVA rubber cotton handles provide nonslip and comfortable grip.","【Top Gift Choice for Fitness Enthusiasts】This workout roller goes beyond working your abs and burning your fat. As a versatile roller wheel, it is of no contest when it comes to selecting an ideal gift for your family and friends, not to mention the satisfaction guaranteed after-sales services. Wish you a joyful shopping experience!","30-DAY NO HASSLE RETURNS 12-MONTH WARRANTY & LIFETIME CUSTOMER SERVICE."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B01D4IGB48','Gaiam Solid Color Yoga Mat, Non Slip Exercise & Fitness Mat for All Types of Yoga, Pilates & Floor Exercises','gaiam-solid-color-yoga-mat-non-slip-exercise-fitness-mat-for-b01d4igb48','Gaiam','Yoga & Mindfulness',34.23,'These Premium 2-Color Yoga Mats provide a 6mm stable non-slip surface for your practice. Each mat is reversible, so you can choose which color you want to practice on. Manufactured free of latex and the top six most harmful phthalates and all come with Gaiam''s lifetime guarantee. Reversible, choose between two colors 6mm of premium cushioning Textured for non-slip performance Protects you and your joints Lightweight and durable Latex-free Comes with our lifetime guarantee Measurements: 68"L x 24"W x 6mm. Materials: PVC. Latex-Free. Care Instructions: Yoga mats release a very strong but harmless odor when first unwrapped. Please unroll and air out your mat for 2-3 days before use. Spot clean with our Yoga Mat Wash or damp cloth with cold water and mild detergent. Dry flat. The mat may fade and become brittle and unusable if exposed to the sun for extended periods of time. We recommend storing your mat in a mat bag when not in use. Learn more about How to Remove That New Yoga Mat Smell.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vYr+ZCyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91E967vxneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z6bjESphL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814-5ZeFNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oEjakY05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,2720,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D4IGB48',1778331365,1,NULL,'["LIGHTWEIGHT YOGA MAT: These durable, yet extremely lightweight exercise yoga mats give you just the right amount of cushioning your joints need during any yoga or fitness routine","STICKY NON-SLIP TEXTURE: Yoga mat features a textured sticky non-slip surface for excellent traction and superior grip and a stylish reversible two color design to suit any mood and keep you motivated and focused","NON-TOXIC & 6P FREE - PVC yoga mat is a healthier choice for you and the planet and free of DEHP, DBP, BBP, DINP, DIDP and DNOP (Note: For best results unroll and air out your mat for 2-3 days before use - a harmless odor may be present when unwrapped)","FREE YOGA CLASS: Yoga mat purchase includes a free bonus downloadable yoga workout to help get you started","DIMENSIONS: 78\"L x 26\"W x 6mm Thick"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B077V135W7','Gaiam Yoga Mat - Premium 6mm Print Extra Thick Non Slip Exercise & Fitness Mat for All Types of Yoga, Pilates & Floor Workouts (68"L x 24"W x 6mm Thick)','gaiam-yoga-mat-premium-6mm-print-extra-thick-non-slip-exerci-b077v135w7','Gaiam','Yoga & Mindfulness',28.42,'Extra-thick Premium Print Yoga Mats provide a stable, sticky, non-slip 5/6mm cushioned surface for your yoga practice. Perfect for home or studio use, this mat ensures the safety and comfort you need to enhance proper alignment and maintain poses and the additional cushioning helps to protect joints. Manufactured free of the top six most harmful phthalates, this mat is a healthier choice for both you and the planet! Please note a packaging change from 5mm or 6mm, but rest assured it is the same size and style mat, just in new and improved packaging. Also, printed yoga mats may release a harmless odor when first unwrapped. For best results unroll and air out your mat for 2-3 days before use.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910EtLaSVSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T+7r65xcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919G6fseaOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814-5ZeFNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oEjakY05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,22060,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077V135W7',1778331373,1,NULL,'["LIGHTWEIGHT & THICK YOGA MAT: These durable, yet lightweight exercise yoga mats are extra thick for the additional cushioning your joints need during any yoga or fitness routine","STICKY NON SLIP TEXTURE: Yoga mat features a textured sticky non slip surface for excellent traction and superior grip and a stylish design to keep you motivated and focused","NON TOXIC & 6P FREE PVC yoga mat is a healthier choice for you and the planet and free of DEHP, DBP, BBP, DINP, DIDP and DNOP (Note: For best results unroll and air out your mat for 2 3 days before use a harmless odor may be present when unwrapped)","FREE YOGA CLASS: Yoga mat purchase includes a free bonus downloadable yoga workout to help get you started","DIMENSIONS: 68\"L x 24\"W x 6mm Thick"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B092DXFGVH','Retrospec Sedona Zafu Meditation Cushion with Buckwheat Hull Fill - Adjustable Yoga & Pilates Equipment Support - 17in Crescent Cotton Cover','retrospec-sedona-zafu-meditation-cushion-with-buckwheat-hull-b092dxfgvh','Retrospec','Yoga & Mindfulness',26.99,'Make your meditation and yoga practice better with this versatile cushion that doubles as a comfortable seat for any occasion. Filled with natural buckwheat hulls, it provides customizable support that molds to your body''s unique shape. The pure cotton cover is machine washable and features a handy carrying strap for on-the-go mindfulness. Whether you''re deep in meditation, practicing yoga, or just need extra comfort while sitting, this cushion helps maintain proper posture and reduce fatigue. Adjust the filling to your desired firmness level and enjoy deeper, more focused sessions.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mfOtOuy9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xe-y2oMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZeJq1okDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815QPstJiRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zKWZozPLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91C5CoceGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1eCNJDh6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wmPMFfQDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,2968,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DXFGVH',1778331391,1,NULL,'["Cotton","Imported","NATURAL COMFORT & SUPPORT: Filled with sustainable buckwheat hulls, this meditation cushion elevates your practice by aligning your spine and hips - no more achy joints during those long sessions","CUSTOMIZE YOUR ZEN: Unzip the inner compartment to add or remove buckwheat hulls, creating the ideal firmness for your comfy chair experience - whether you''re meditating or relaxing","ECO-FRIENDLY DESIGN: The 100% cotton cover keeps your workout space free from microplastics. Machine washable and built to last, it''s as gentle on the planet as it is on your body","VERSATILE COMPANION: Double as physical therapy equipment or exercise support. The sturdy handle makes it easy to carry from home workouts to outdoor bench sessions","MINDFUL ENGINEERING: Expertly crafted to boost circulation and maintain proper posture, helping you stay focused on your practice instead of fidgeting for comfort on your yoga mat"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0DQF5YWYX','Meditation Cushion Bolster Pillow for Restorative Yoga – Supportive Cushion for Meditation, Pilates, and Relaxation – Filled with Buckwheat Hulls - Removable Cover','meditation-cushion-bolster-pillow-for-restorative-yoga-suppo-b0dqf5ywyx','Sweet Home Collection','Yoga & Mindfulness',25.48,'100% Faux Suede Polyester. ✅ COMFORTABLE 16” ROUND DESIGN 📏 – This meditation cushion measures 16" in diameter and 5" thick to lift hips, align spine, and promote healthy posture during long sits, breathwork, or yoga 🧘♂️🌿💆♀️. ✅ BUCKWHEAT FILLED & ADJUSTABLE 🌾 – Inner fill contains natural buckwheat hulls that mold to your body for support. Easily unzip to add or remove filling and customize firmness 🌰🧺🔧. ✅ MULTI-USE FLOOR CUSHION 🧘 – Use for meditation, yoga, zazen, mindfulness, cross-legged seating, or a comfy floor pillow for tea, reading, or gaming. Perfect posture anytime, anywhere 🛋️📖🎮. ✅ WASHABLE COVER & EASY TO CARRY 🧼 – Removable outer cover is machine washable for easy care. Built-in handle makes it simple to carry to class, the park, or your zen corner 💼🧳🧼. ✅ POSTURE SUPPORT & SPINE ALIGNMENT 💪 – Elevates hips above knees to relieve tension in back and joints. Ideal for yoga, stress relief, or daily grounding practices at home or studio 📿🪷💨','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818DfDP8DhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ziXLcH+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n653CZZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712VvF9Je1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8136cDr1EML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716W2grM5DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZXqHtIylL._AC_SL1490_.jpg"]',4.3,204,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DQF5YWYX',1778331400,1,NULL,'["100% Faux Suede Polyester","✅ COMFORTABLE 16” ROUND DESIGN 📏 – This meditation cushion measures 16\" in diameter and 5\" thick to lift hips, align spine, and promote healthy posture during long sits, breathwork, or yoga 🧘♂️🌿💆♀️","✅ BUCKWHEAT FILLED & ADJUSTABLE 🌾 – Inner fill contains natural buckwheat hulls that mold to your body for support. Easily unzip to add or remove filling and customize firmness 🌰🧺🔧","✅ MULTI-USE FLOOR CUSHION 🧘 – Use for meditation, yoga, zazen, mindfulness, cross-legged seating, or a comfy floor pillow for tea, reading, or gaming. Perfect posture anytime, anywhere 🛋️📖🎮","✅ WASHABLE COVER & EASY TO CARRY 🧼 – Removable outer cover is machine washable for easy care. Built-in handle makes it simple to carry to class, the park, or your zen corner 💼🧳🧼","✅ POSTURE SUPPORT & SPINE ALIGNMENT 💪 – Elevates hips above knees to relieve tension in back and joints. Ideal for yoga, stress relief, or daily grounding practices at home or studio 📿🪷💨"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0BJ87SC6K','Organic Round Meditation Cushion by renoo - Durable Comfortable Cotton, Linen, Hemp - Modern Zafu - Buckwheat Floor Pillow Yoga Bolster in 15 Colors Removable Cover - 15 inches - Dune','organic-round-meditation-cushion-by-renoo-durable-comfortabl-b0bj87sc6k','r e n o o','Yoga & Mindfulness',70,'Designed for the modern home yet anchored solidly in ancient tradition, renoo meditation pillows are remarkably comfortable and durable. They have been tested by numerous meditation instructors and are used daily by practitioners worldwide, from all traditions and backgrounds, from beginners to teachers alike. Organic buckwheat hulls conform perfectly to your individual shape bringing both stability and softness to your spine and seat. The more our cushion adapts to your seat, the more support it offers to your spine. All materials in our zafu cushion are plant-derived, biodegradable, easy to clean, and wonderfully breathable. Since the cushion is handmade, you may find beautiful and discreet naturally-occurring imperfections in the fabric or the color, making it unique and your very own. We hope you find joy in discovering your own perfection in these minor imperfections. Our renoo exclusive fabric is custom-woven to our specific standards. We promise you won’t slide off your cushion! We work at bringing you meditation goods in a mindful, purposeful, and informed way. Mindfully made by renoo, all products are ethically sourced. Materials and labor to create our products are entirely traceable – from crop to cushion. We work with specialized independent artisans to produce high-performance, tradition-based, consciously-made goods, using high-quality organic materials to ensure all our products are long-lasting and enjoyed for many years. A portion of every order helps support the renoo Mindfulness Impact Program. The program supports non-profits that provide evidence-based mindfulness training to public schools in underserved communities. Give the gift of wellness to yourself, a loved one, and the greater community through your purchase of this meditation cushion.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MuuX6XXxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912OusM5cHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ckDghfDiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1q6KHemC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814mzRZx+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91w68c1Jw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YIqboUziL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.9,19,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ87SC6K',1778331407,1,NULL,'["DESIGNED FOR COMFORT, BEAUTY, and JOY: We believe that our living space affects our inner space. With that in mind, we designed our organic meditation cushion to help you create a cozy, peaceful meditation space where you can quickly return to the present moment and reconnect to your true self. Available in a range of soothing colors, renoo cushions deliver calm, healing energy to your home, studio, or office meditation space","MEDITATION INSTRUCTOR APPROVED: Used by meditation and yoga practitioners and sold in renowned hotels and studios worldwide, the renoo organic round meditation cushion has been tested and approved by meditation coaches and teachers for posture support and comfort. Bringing alignment and stability to your sitting posture, our GOTS-certified organic round meditation cushions are made mindfully and specially designed for a supported and comfortable posture","UNSURPASSED ORGANIC CRAFTSMANSHIP and QUALITY: the renoo round zafu (pronounced ‘za - foo’) is handcrafted by traditional artisans in small quantities, 100% eco-friendly, cruelty-free, and sustainably sourced. Entirely plant-based, made with organic cotton, linen, and hemp, this meditation pillow comes with a removable zippered sleeve cover for easy washing. The inside shell is also equipped with a zipper for easy refill or height adjustment","FOR BEGINNERS AND GURUS ALIKE: Use it at home, office, studio, or while traveling to help you focus on the present moment and come back to your true self. Great for meditation teachers, school teachers, yogis, sound therapists, energy healers, and meditation practitioners. This peaceful cushion will benefit both beginner and experienced mindfulness practitioners of all ages. Comes with a handy white cover bag for portability and protection","IDEAL MINDFULNESS GIFT and 100-DAY TRIAL GUARANTEE: Give the gift of well-being, loving-kindness, joy, compassion, and equanimity with this meditation cushion - a thoughtful birthday, anniversary, or holiday gift. Each purchase supports non-profits that provide mindfulness training to children in underserved communities. Every order comes with a 100-day money-back guarantee for added peace of mind - not that you’ll need it."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0D99J3X5L','10 Set Compression Packing Cubes for Travel Essentials,Compressible Expandable Packing Cubes for Suitcase,OlarHike Luggage Organizer Bags for Travel,Handy Helper for Organizing Clothes(Black)','10-set-compression-packing-cubes-for-travel-essentialscompre-b0d99j3x5l','OlarHike','Travel Accessories',29.99,'All-in-One Travel Storage Solution - Say goodbye to chaotic packing! This comprehensive set includes four compression packing cubes in varying sizes (XL, L, M, S) to accommodate everything from bulky coats to delicate tops. Plus, enjoy added convenience with a hanging toiletry bag, shoe bag, machine-washable laundry bag, and versatile pouch—all designed to keep your luggage perfectly organized and clutter-free.. Maximize Packing Efficiency - Make every inch of your luggage count! These compression cubes work like a mini vacuum sealer, using an extra outer zipper to reduce bulk and create more space. Pack more clothes without sacrificing options—your favorite outfits, now travel-ready.. Durable for Every Journey - Crafted from premium, high-density, tear-resistant polyester, our packing cubes are designed to handle frequent travel. Reinforced stitching and heavy-duty zippers ensure durability, so your packing companions stay reliable throughout your travels.. Lightweight & Organized - Stay effortlessly organized with breathable mesh panels that let you see the contents of each cube at a glance. No more digging through your luggage. And with a lightweight design, you’re adding minimal weight to your luggage.. Ready for Any Adventure - Whether you’re heading out for a weekend getaway, a business conference, or a month-long backpacking trip, This high-capacity 10-piece compression cet seamlessly accommodates 20-32-inch suitcases of all types. We’re he