zed scans. RFID blocking shielding material of the passport holder men women is used to prevent thieves from swiping your credit card to steal your personal information in airports or crowded places","Compact Size: The size of passport holder women men is 4.0 inches W x 5.6 inches L x 0.4 inches D. The passport wallets are designed with stringent measurements to make sure they will fit your documents precisely. The rfid passport protector will hold any standard size passport book. The ultra-slim design allows our passport card holder and vax card holder to fit comfortably in your pocket, purse or handbag and is lightweight and easy to carry","High Quality Material: The passport case is made of durable padded premium leather material, which is lightweight, waterproof, anti-tear, anti-spills and shockproof. The beautiful cover of 3D embossing provides a comfortable soft touch feeling and professional look for the pasaporte case","Thoughtful Gift Option: The passport travel wallet is a suitable choice for you and your family, kids, boys and girls when traveling around. This guarda pasaporte mujer helps you keep organized and store your important items and also ensure a nice appearance. This travel wallet is frequently-used travel must have that will accompany them for many years"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0CRHP8NV9','Vtopmart 8pcs Clear Organizers and Storage Bins with Lids, Stackable Plastic Storage Containers with Handles for Fridge, Freezer, Pantry, Cabinet, Kitchen Organization','vtopmart-8pcs-clear-organizers-and-storage-bins-with-lids-st-b0crhp8nv9','Vtopmart','Home Organization',25.99,'【Ideal Storage Solution for Home】Our storage containers are perfect for creating a clean and organized refrigerator, pantry, cabinets and kitchen space. Suitable for storing fruits, vegetables, snacks, condiments and organizing office supplies, craft materials, toys and other sundries to keep your home neatly arranged. Each storage bin measures 12” L x 6” W x 3.4” H. 【Plastic Organizer Bins with Lids】Clear kitchen pantry organizers with removable lids can be stacked vertically to make more efficient use of space. This storage box with a lid prevents items from being squeezed when stacked.. 【Portable Handles】These versatile organizing bins built-in carry handles for easy transportation. When accessing items deep in the refrigerator, you can easily pull out the box and quickly find what you need without rummaging around.. 【Clear and Practical Design】These clear plastic storage bins allow you to find what you need at a glance, no longer needing to rummage, making it easy to find items in your pantry or fridge. Enjoy the benefits of an organized space with our high-quality refrigerator organizers.. 【Durable PET Material】Clear fridge organizer bins made of durable food grade PET and BPA-free, shatterproof plastic that''s durable and easy to clean. Easy to clean! Wash by hand with mild soapy water. DO NOT place in dishwasher!','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CuwxQl+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oiRHMMRxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mVk+euqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fjm7KNJWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lr5T9q3pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813laZZA0nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qvfn4FVdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',NULL,0,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CRHP8NV9',1778332163,1,NULL,'["【Ideal Storage Solution for Home】Our storage containers are perfect for creating a clean and organized refrigerator, pantry, cabinets and kitchen space. Suitable for storing fruits, vegetables, snacks, condiments and organizing office supplies, craft materials, toys and other sundries to keep your home neatly arranged. Each storage bin measures 12” L x 6” W x 3.4” H","【Plastic Organizer Bins with Lids】Clear kitchen pantry organizers with removable lids can be stacked vertically to make more efficient use of space. This storage box with a lid prevents items from being squeezed when stacked.","【Portable Handles】These versatile organizing bins built-in carry handles for easy transportation. When accessing items deep in the refrigerator, you can easily pull out the box and quickly find what you need without rummaging around.","【Clear and Practical Design】These clear plastic storage bins allow you to find what you need at a glance, no longer needing to rummage, making it easy to find items in your pantry or fridge. Enjoy the benefits of an organized space with our high-quality refrigerator organizers.","【Durable PET Material】Clear fridge organizer bins made of durable food grade PET and BPA-free, shatterproof plastic that''s durable and easy to clean. Easy to clean! Wash by hand with mild soapy water. DO NOT place in dishwasher!"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B09ZKYQMVD','Vtopmart 4 Pack Small Clear Stackable Storage Drawers,Acrylic Bathroom Makeup Organizer,Plastic Storage Bins For Vanity, Undersink, Kitchen Cabinets, Pantry, Home Organization','vtopmart-4-pack-small-clear-stackable-storage-drawersacrylic-b09zkyqmvd','Vtopmart','Home Organization',20.99,'[Multi-Purpose Organizers] Small storage drawers help you to organize everywhere in your home. They can be used as organizers and storage for makeup, bathroom countertop, kitchen or laundry under sink, medicine cabinet, pantry, vanity. You can flexibly use our storage organizer for house organization and storage according to your needs.. [Stackable Design] Come with 4 drawer storage organizers, the outside box measures 7.5"D x 6"W x 4.4"H,the drawer measures 6.9"D x 5.4"W x 3.7"H,it is usable size. Please measure the space of using before purchasing.The storage containers are stackable, vertical storage will save a lot of space. You can also use them side by side. Put your small objects on top of acrylic bins to make your countertop space more tidy.. [Built-in Handle and Non-Slip] The storage containers are designed with pull-out handles, it is convenient for you to store and take out items.Extra silicone pads are included, just stick them on the bottom of the outer box for non-slip,the outer box will not move when the drawer is pulled out,providing you with easy organization and storage.. [Keep Your Home Organized] Our acrylic organizer bins help you to organize your home with style. They are clear, which helps you to identify contents easily. Keep items contained, organized and dust-free and create a neat space in your bathrooms, laundry, bedrooms, offices, garages, toy rooms, craft rooms and playrooms, refrigerator, cupboards or pantry shelves.. [Quality Construction and Easy to Clean] Made of durable BPA free shatter-resistant plastic. The sturdy, transparent and fashionable design is compatible with the decoration of any room. PLEASE DO NOT PUT IN DISHWASHER. Easily clean with soap and warm water.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-CEXaLxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o81vPHbiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712kzfpxuhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CcpDmupWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cz0MH3eUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611t5OEzBmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D5C3Y9fOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,16807,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZKYQMVD',1778332171,1,NULL,'["[Multi-Purpose Organizers] Small storage drawers help you to organize everywhere in your home. They can be used as organizers and storage for makeup, bathroom countertop, kitchen or laundry under sink, medicine cabinet, pantry, vanity. You can flexibly use our storage organizer for house organization and storage according to your needs.","[Stackable Design] Come with 4 drawer storage organizers, the outside box measures 7.5\"D x 6\"W x 4.4\"H,the drawer measures 6.9\"D x 5.4\"W x 3.7\"H,it is usable size. Please measure the space of using before purchasing.The storage containers are stackable, vertical storage will save a lot of space. You can also use them side by side. Put your small objects on top of acrylic bins to make your countertop space more tidy.","[Built-in Handle and Non-Slip] The storage containers are designed with pull-out handles, it is convenient for you to store and take out items.Extra silicone pads are included, just stick them on the bottom of the outer box for non-slip,the outer box will not move when the drawer is pulled out,providing you with easy organization and storage.","[Keep Your Home Organized] Our acrylic organizer bins help you to organize your home with style. They are clear, which helps you to identify contents easily. Keep items contained, organized and dust-free and create a neat space in your bathrooms, laundry, bedrooms, offices, garages, toy rooms, craft rooms and playrooms, refrigerator, cupboards or pantry shelves.","[Quality Construction and Easy to Clean] Made of durable BPA free shatter-resistant plastic. The sturdy, transparent and fashionable design is compatible with the decoration of any room. PLEASE DO NOT PUT IN DISHWASHER. Easily clean with soap and warm water."]');
