ingerie, bras, underwear, and baby clothes","Multiple Sizes: Set includes 3 laundry bags in different sizes to wash anything from small to large items. Made of high-quality mesh material, durable and allow water and detergent to flow through easily for a thorough wash.Easy to clean and reuse","Convenient Zipper Closure: The bag features a zipper closure that keeps items inside from getting tangled and stuck. Please do not put in too much laundry. Keep the capacity around 2/3 for smoother washing","Versatile Use: These laundry bags can be used not only for washing clothes, but also for organizing and storing toys, socks, and other items. These laundry bags are essential for college students who need to wash their clothes in a public laundry room","Buy with confidence: If you encounter any problems when signing the product, please contact us in time. We are glad to provide you with services and consultations"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B083SCJ8G8','Muchfun 3Pcs Durable Honeycomb Mesh Laundry Bags for Delicates 12 x 16 Inches (3 Medium)','muchfun-3pcs-durable-honeycomb-mesh-laundry-bags-for-delicat-b083scj8g8','Symeno Select','Cleaning & Laundry',5.94,'This heavy duty Honeycomb mesh laundry bag is specially designed to wash delicate clothes without wear and tear in washing machines and dryers. With our breathable mesh construction, you''ll have a thoroughly clean wash in the washing machine and evenly dry process in the dryer. Medium and extra strong: our 12" x 16" (30 x 40 cm) laundry bag made of durable material (120g honey comb mesh) for a long-lasting usage. Our premium anti-rust zipper with auto lock and smart zipper protection will prevent the bag from opening during washing and drying cycle. You’ll have a quiet laundry experience. Protect your delicates, extend the life of your lingerie, socks and gloves, yoga pants, jeans or even jackets, scarves, and shoes','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4PHUpSML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ywT+bTXSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71np4SWhJHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CuKfvPYCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bb2CwY9iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPhlP4U5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,39230,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SCJ8G8',1778332259,1,NULL,'["This heavy duty Honeycomb mesh laundry bag is specially designed to wash delicate clothes without wear and tear in washing machines and dryers","With our breathable mesh construction, you''ll have a thoroughly clean wash in the washing machine and evenly dry process in the dryer","Medium and extra strong: our 12\" x 16\" (30 x 40 cm) laundry bag made of durable material (120g honey comb mesh) for a long-lasting usage","Our premium anti-rust zipper with auto lock and smart zipper protection will prevent the bag from opening during washing and drying cycle. You’ll have a quiet laundry experience","Protect your delicates, extend the life of your lingerie, socks and gloves, yoga pants, jeans or even jackets, scarves, and shoes"]');
