L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vZ4CkcHAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,2165,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L7B32FC',1778332245,1,NULL,'["Quality Polyester Mesh with non-deforming diamond structure, has better penetration performance, and strengthen the bag''s long-lasting performance . They are perfect for washing your coats,sweater,pants, lingerie, and etc","Sturdy auto-lock zipper keeps the bags closed during washing, preventing lost items. The side zipper cover protects clothes and the washing machine—just tuck the zipper under the cover each time you use the bag","Excellent Cleaning Performance - GOGOODA delicates laundry bags with suitable structure makes detergent and water flow through the mesh holes easily thus providing an optimal rinsing in the washing machine and drying in the dryer","Get all you need in one wash bag set: 2 M 12*16 inch, 2 L 16*20 inch, 1 jumbo 24*24 inch, 2 cylinder bag 8*7 inch for washing your delicates from socks to large sheet, with with color-coded zippers for easy selection","Multi-use Mesh Bags - Our machine wash bag not only great for doing laundry but also ideal for using as travel organizer bag, house organization bags for tidy garments,toys, stationary, and etc"]');
