 QUALITY: the facial roller and guasha are handcrafted authentic Jade Stone from Anshan city, Liaoning province. The jade roller and gua sha stone is known for promoting balance and good energy which will have a positive effect on your skin.","FACE ROLLER: jade roller for face reduce facial puffiness and make your skin glow by refining the pores, eliminating toxins, and improving the elasticity of the skin while using your favorite oil/serum.","GUA SHA: the face massager helps you relieve tension, sculpt your face, and increase circulation. Use daily for a number of weeks and apply upwards pressure to remove double chin and combat ageing effects","EASY TO USE: our face massager is easy to use and comes with a comprehensive ebook guide to help you make the most out of your purchase","GIFT SET: No matter the occasion, give your loved one the gift of glowing skin. Our beauty tools makes the perfect addition to anyone''s skincare routine.","Portable Set: The compact size makes these facial tools perfect for travel or on-the-go pampering."]');
