zon.com/images/I/61zqTeqwTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CM1UZirRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G-iY5Id9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716t99Y12rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,211,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F1TBQ96J',1778332384,1,NULL,'["Gua Sha Facial Tools for Daily Skincare: Handcrafted from natural jade stone, the face massager and guasha tool set is designed to relieve tension, contour, and define your face. Its unique shape helps sculpt the jawline and is suitable for all skin types","Jade Roller and Gua Sha Set: Often used with facial oils or serums, this face roller and guasha set helps reduce wrinkles and puffiness. It massages and refreshes the skin, improving elasticity and helping you achieve a dewy look as part of your daily skincare routine","Facial Scrubber Pore Brush: This brush is widely used as an applicator for DIY masks, mud, clay, cream, and lotion. It is perfect for exfoliating and removing blackheads, cleansing pores, and providing a daily massage","Non-Slip Headband for Women and Men: Made from lightweight, breathable, and elastic fabric, this headband ensures comfort during your skincare routines, sports, and various activities","Real Perfection Skincare Tool Travel Set: This facial jade roller massage set comes in a tin box, making it a great self-care gift for your loved ones on special occasions such as Christmas, Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, birthdays, and more"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B08RRTDR29','Yes4All EVA Firm Foam Roller for Back - Round Back Roller for Exercise, Yoga & Pilates 12/18/24/36 inch','yes4all-eva-firm-foam-roller-for-back-round-back-roller-for-b08rrtdr29','Yes4All','Wellness Accessories',14.17,'BUILT TO LAST: Constructed of eco-friendly, professional-quality EVA foam that is formamide and phthalate-free, Yes4All EVA Foam Roller is extremely durable and can retain peak performance for a long time. FOUR SIZES FOR ALL YOUR EXERCISES: Available in 12 inch, 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch size options, suitable for all your exercises. The bigger size is better for upper body training, while the smaller size is fruitful for hamstring, IT band, calves workout. VARIOUS COLORS: You can choose the colors you want for your rollers, from classical to cutting-edge colors will make your workout routines both efficient and exhilarating than ever. CLOSED CELL EVA: Yes4All EVA Foam Roller has a closed-cell foam design that provides extra durability, making it easy to clean and reuse in a long time. WIDE APPLICATIONS: These foam rollers can be used in a wide variety of ways such as rehabilitation, massage therapy, endurance, or general fitness training for people of all genders and professions, both athletes and office workers alike','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DxOEKbn6L._AC_SL1401_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812UrGmUNoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715gAcWGP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HGUUIv8uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711SWgwPewL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEbWGxowL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,4009,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RRTDR29',1778332497,1,NULL,'["BUILT TO LAST: Constructed of eco-friendly, professional-quality EVA foam that is formamide and phthalate-free, Yes4All EVA Foam Roller is extremely durable and can retain peak performance for a long time","FOUR SIZES FOR ALL YOUR EXERCISES: Available in 12 inch, 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch size options, suitable for all your exercises. The bigger size is better for upper body training, while the smaller size is fruitful for hamstring, IT band, calves workout","VARIOUS COLORS: You can choose the colors you want for your rollers, from classical to cutting-edge colors will make your workout routines both efficient and exhilarating than ever","CLOSED CELL EVA: Yes4All EVA Foam Roller has a closed-cell foam design that provides extra durability, making it easy to clean and reuse in a long time","WIDE APPLICATIONS: These foam rollers can be used in a wide variety of ways such as rehabilitation, massage therapy, endurance, or general fitness training for people of all genders and professions, both athletes and office workers alike"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F9XZ6FZJ','Velvet Jewelry Drawer Organizer Trays – 4-Layer Stackable Jewelry Storage Inserts Set, Beige Jewelry Tray Set for Earrings, Rings, Necklaces, Bracelets with Removable Dividers for Dresser & Vanity','velvet-jewelry-drawer-organizer-trays-4-layer-stackable-jewe-b0f9xz6fzj','pickpiff','Jewellery Accessories',23.99,'4-Piece Velvet Jewelry Trays Set - This stackable jewelry organizer includes 4 jewelry tray inserts that neatly store and display rings, earrings, necklaces, bracelets, watches, sunglasses and so on. Easily view your collection and find what you need in seconds—no more tangled chains or missing pieces.. Customizable Compartments Design - Removable inner dividers design, allowing you to resize compartments to suit different types of jewelry. Perfect as a drawer jewelry organizer for necklaces, bracelets, earrings, rings, sunglasses, watches, brooches, pendants, and more.. 4-in-1 Jewelry Organizer Box：5.9*9.4*1.1/1.57 inches. 1 necklace tray with 8 hooks, ideal for chains and pendants, 1 earrings tray with 24 compartments, perfect for studs, earrings, and ear cuffs, 1 ring & bracelet tray featuring 9 ring rolls and 5 open slots for bracelets or bangles, 1 deeper removable tray (1.57inches) with 8 large compartments, designed for statement earrings, watches, or sunglasses. All trays can be used individually or stacked together, giving you the flexibility to create your own jewelry storage system.. Stackable & Slide-Free for Space Saving - The velvet jewelry trays stack securely without slipping, making them a great space-saving solution. Whether on a vanity or inside a drawer, these jewelry organizer trays offer both functionality and elegance.. Elegant Gift for Her - A thoughtful gift for women on birthdays, Valentine''s Day, Mother’s Day, Christmas, and more. This jewelry organizer for drawers combines luxury and practicality, ideal for anyone who loves keeping their jewelry beautifully organized.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E43mdO3bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tvA6pGBZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jAtQIJpGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Acik0vsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hzPmwIP8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ufwgQ1vmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QcaZsZOOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,292,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F9XZ6FZJ',1778332528,1,NULL,'["4-Piece Velvet Jewelry Trays Set - This stackable jewelry organizer includes 4 jewelry tray inserts that neatly store and display rings, earrings, necklaces, bracelets, watches, sunglasses and so on. Easily view your collection and find what you need in seconds—no more tangled chains or missing pieces.","Customizable Compartments Design - Removable inner dividers design, allowing you to resize compartments to suit different types of jewelry. Perfect as a drawer jewelry organizer for necklaces, bracelets, earrings, rings, sunglasses, watches, brooches, pendants, and more.","4-in-1 Jewelry Organizer Box：5.9*9.4*1.1/1.57 inches. 1 necklace tray with 8 hooks, ideal for chains and pendants, 1 earrings tray with 24 compartments, perfect for studs, earrings, and ear cuffs, 1 ring & bracelet tray featuring 9 ring rolls and 5 open slots for bracelets or bangles, 1 deeper removable tray (1.57inches) with 8 large compartments, designed for statement earrings, watches, or sunglasses. All trays can be used individually or stacked together, giving you the flexibility to create your own jewelry storage system.","Stackable & Slide-Free for Space Saving - The velvet jewelry trays stack securely without slipping, making them a great space-saving solution. Whether on a vanity or inside a drawer, these jewelry organizer trays offer both functionality and elegance.","Elegant Gift for Her - A thoughtful gift for women on birthdays, Valentine''s Day, Mother’s Day, Christmas, and more. This jewelry organizer for drawers combines luxury and practicality, ideal for anyone who loves keeping their jewelry beautifully organized."]');
