stays open to collect any leftover food or liquids, which helps to keep baby''s meal neat and tidy and avoids staining clothes, a must-have for baby feeding!","High Quality Material: Our 3 pack baby bibs are made of food grade silicone, BPA free, soft and reusable.","Adjustable Design: The silicone bibs neck straps provide four adjustable different sizes, baby girl bibs are suitable for 0-6 6-12 12-18 18-72 months babies.","Perfect Gift: Our silicone baby feeding set is affordable, multiple classic color combinations, waterproof bibs are a baby shower gifts for boys and girls and a baby girl newborn essentials.","Easy to Clean and Carry: Waterproof silicone bibs is easy to clean, just simple cleaning with soapy water. The toddler bibs can be rolled up for storage and is suitable for traveling in your handbag."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B07VW9PR8K','EVLA''S Baby Feeding Set, Baby Led Weaning Supplies, Adjustable Silicone Bibs, Divided Plate, Suction Bowl with Lid, Soft Spoons for Babies or Toddlers, Baby Registry must have!(Blue and Green)','evlas-baby-feeding-set-baby-led-weaning-supplies-adjustable-b07vw9pr8k','Symeno Select','Baby Accessories',9.95,'Silicone. Imported. COMPLETE BABY FEEDING SET: EVLA’S Feeding Set provides all the essential items you need for a successful and stress-free mealtime experience. This growing baby must-have set includes comfortable and adjustable Silicone Bibs, Divided Plate, Suction Bowl with Lid and Soft Spoons. FOOD GRADE SILICONE BIBS: Indulge your little one in the epitome of comfort with our premium feeding Bibs, crafted from food-grade silicone. Designed with utmost care, these high-quality bibs offer an adjustable fit, ensuring a perfect and secure placement. The deep pocket effortlessly captures spills and crumbs. Cleaning is a breeze with our bib - a quick wipe is all it takes. Embrace convenience with our Silicone Bibs, a must-have for stress-free and mess-free mealtimes.. DIVIDED PLATE & SUCTION BOWL WITH LID: Easily portion out food groups with the divided plate to help promote a balanced diet for your little one. No more messy spills and unexpected flips, thanks to the reliable suction feature on the bowl. Our baby feeding items are oven safe, microwave safe, freezer safe and dishwasher-safe for effortless cleaning.. SOFT SPOONS: Nurture your baby''s self-feeding journey with the Soft Spoons specially crafted to encourage their budding independence. With a gentle touch on delicate gums, these spoons provide the perfect introduction to solid foods. The ergonomic handle design enables little hands to confidently grasp and maneuver the spoon. Designed to ensure a comfortable fit in small mouths, these soft feeding spoons for growing babies help facilitate a seamless transition from bottle or breastfeeding.. MESS-FREE MEALTIMES & EFFORTLESS CLEANUPS: Transform mealtimes into a joyous, hassle-free affair. The EVLA''S Baby Feeding Set is the ideal companion for parents and babysitters seeking to create a positive and comfortable feeding experience for their little ones. Bid farewell to unnecessary mess and wasted time, and elevate mealtimes to a whole new level of convenience and enjoyment with EVLA''S Child Dinner Set.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J7+2T3hOL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E14QVioSL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ChiddWtiL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cq0GygbYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X69MHZsXL._SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,2837,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VW9PR8K',1778332845,1,NULL,'["Silicone","Imported","COMPLETE BABY FEEDING SET: EVLA’S Feeding Set provides all the essential items you need for a successful and stress-free mealtime experience. This growing baby must-have set includes comfortable and adjustable Silicone Bibs, Divided Plate, Suction Bowl with Lid and Soft Spoons","FOOD GRADE SILICONE BIBS: Indulge your little one in the epitome of comfort with our premium feeding Bibs, crafted from food-grade silicone. Designed with utmost care, these high-quality bibs offer an adjustable fit, ensuring a perfect and secure placement. The deep pocket effortlessly captures spills and crumbs. Cleaning is a breeze with our bib - a quick wipe is all it takes. Embrace convenience with our Silicone Bibs, a must-have for stress-free and mess-free mealtimes.","DIVIDED PLATE & SUCTION BOWL WITH LID: Easily portion out food groups with the divided plate to help promote a balanced diet for your little one. No more messy spills and unexpected flips, thanks to the reliable suction feature on the bowl. Our baby feeding items are oven safe, microwave safe, freezer safe and dishwasher-safe for effortless cleaning.","SOFT SPOONS: Nurture your baby''s self-feeding journey with the Soft Spoons specially crafted to encourage their budding independence. With a gentle touch on delicate gums, these spoons provide the perfect introduction to solid foods. The ergonomic handle design enables little hands to confidently grasp and maneuver the spoon. Designed to ensure a comfortable fit in small mouths, these soft feeding spoons for growing babies help facilitate a seamless transition from bottle or breastfeeding.","MESS-FREE MEALTIMES & EFFORTLESS CLEANUPS: Transform mealtimes into a joyous, hassle-free affair. The EVLA''S Baby Feeding Set is the ideal companion for parents and babysitters seeking to create a positive and comfortable feeding experience for their little ones. Bid farewell to unnecessary mess and wasted time, and elevate mealtimes to a whole new level of convenience and enjoyment with EVLA''S Child Dinner Set."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0G5NZ9C9M','david''s kids Muslin Swaddle Blankets, 4 Pack Organic Cotton Baby Blankets, Breathable Soft Receiving Blanket for Boys Girls, Newborn Essentials, Large 47 x 47 inches, Animal & Forest','davids-kids-muslin-swaddle-blankets-4-pack-organic-cotton-ba-b0g5nz9c9m','david''s kids','Baby Accessories',21.99,'Soft & Breathable:Made of 70% rayon from bamboo and 30% organic cotton, our muslin swaddle blankets are soft, breathable, and gentle on sensitive skin. This lightweight baby muslin blanket helps regulate temperature to keep your baby cool, dry, and comfortable day or night. Up to 3x softer than regular cotton, it feels smooth and cozy. The upgraded woven texture improves airflow and absorbs moisture quickly for everyday use. Designed for delicate skin, it’s one of the must-have newborn essentials for modern parents. Meets OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100.. Multi-Use Design:These versatile baby swaddle blankets are made for daily use. Use them as swaddles for newborns, a nursing cover, burp cloth, or stroller cover when you''re on the go. They also work well as a receiving blanket or for tummy time. One set covers multiple needs, helping reduce extra items and simplify your routine. Designed as nursery swaddling blankets, they combine function and style for home and outings.. Grows with Your Baby:Measuring 47 x 47 inches, these muslin swaddle blankets offer plenty of space to wrap your baby comfortably. Ideal as swaddles for newborns, they create a snug, womb-like feel to help soothe and support better sleep. As your baby grows, they easily transition into a baby blanket for toddlers. The 4-pack set ensures you always have a clean one ready, making it a practical and long-lasting newborn essential.. Perfect Gift Idea:Our 4-pack baby swaddle blankets come in a gift-ready box, making them a thoughtful baby shower gift or a great addition to any baby registry. Perfect for welcoming a new arrival or special occasions, this set combines style and convenience. Compared to single packs, it offers better value and ensures you always have a clean blanket ready. A practical gift parents will appreciate.. Machine Washable & Durable:Designed for everyday life, these muslin swaddle blankets are easy to care for and built to last. Machine washable with low-temperature drying, they keep their softness and shape over time. Made from premium cotton, this durable baby muslin blanket resists pilling, shrinking, and fading. It gets softer with every wash, making it a reliable part of your newborn essentials.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tor3aUYOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WHrPINPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mgK7rRd2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWcQsSQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wV9v8SyVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819TJEoLFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815o4MEQPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712rQZZvzAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,243,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0G5NZ9C9M',1778332866,1,NULL,'["Soft & Breathable:Made of 70% rayon from bamboo and 30% organic cotton, our muslin swaddle blankets are soft, breathable, and gentle on sensitive skin. This lightweight baby muslin blanket helps regulate temperature to keep your baby cool, dry, and comfortable day or night. Up to 3x softer than regular cotton, it feels smooth and cozy. The upgraded woven texture improves airflow and absorbs moisture quickly for everyday use. Designed for delicate skin, it’s one of the must-have newborn essentials for modern parents. Meets OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100.","Multi-Use Design:These versatile baby swaddle blankets are made for daily use. Use them as swaddles for newborns, a nursing cover, burp cloth, or stroller cover when you''re on the go. They also work well as a receiving blanket or for tummy time. One set covers multiple needs, helping reduce extra items and simplify your routine. Designed as nursery swaddling blankets, they combine function and style for home and outings.","Grows with Your Baby:Measuring 47 x 47 inches, these muslin swaddle blankets offer plenty of space to wrap your baby comfortably. Ideal as swaddles for newborns, they create a snug, womb-like feel to help soothe and support better sleep. As your baby grows, they easily transition into a baby blanket for toddlers. The 4-pack set ensures you always have a clean one ready, making it a practical and long-lasting newborn essential.","Perfect Gift Idea:Our 4-pack baby swaddle blankets come in a gift-ready box, making them a thoughtful baby shower gift or a great addition to any baby registry. Perfect for welcoming a new arrival or special occasions, this set combines style and convenience. Compared to single packs, it offers better value and ensures you always have a clean blanket ready. A practical gift parents will appreciate.","Machine Washable & Durable:Designed for everyday life, these muslin swaddle blankets are easy to care for and built to last. Machine washable with low-temperature drying, they keep their softness and shape over time. Made from premium cotton, this durable baby muslin blanket resists pilling, shrinking, and fading. It gets softer with every wash, making it a reliable part of your newborn essentials."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F4WTKRP7','Momcozy Muslin Swaddle Blankets, 4-Pack Breathable and Skin-Friendly Receiving Blankets, Best Wishes Swaddle Blanket Shower Gifts & Baby Registry Essentials, Large 47"x47", Ocean Pixie Dream','momcozy-muslin-swaddle-blankets-4-pack-breathable-and-skin-f-b0f4wtkrp7','Symeno Select','Baby Accessories',34.99,'70% Viscose Derived from Bamboo Fiber, 30% Cotton. 【OEKO-TEX Certified: Soft & Breathable Swaddle Blanket】Momcozy muslin swaddle blankets are made with 70% viscose derived from bamboo fiber and 30% cotton, an OEKO-TEX certified lightweight and breathable fabric that feels soft and gentle on delicate newborn skin. The airy muslin fabric helps keep babies comfortable during sleep, cuddling, and everyday use.. 【Generous 47" x 47" Size for Easy Swaddling】Designed as swaddles for newborns, the large 47 x 47 inch swaddle blanket makes wrapping babies easier while providing a cozy and secure feeling similar to the womb. The breathable muslin fabric helps babies stay comfortable during naps, bedtime, or cuddling.. 【Versatile Muslin Swaddle Blanket for Daily Use】More than just a baby swaddle blanket, this multipurpose muslin baby blanket can also be used as receiving blankets, nursing cover, stroller cover, burp cloth, tummy time blanket, changing pad, or lightweight travel blanket, making it a practical everyday essential for parents.. 【Beautiful Colors & Thoughtful Designs】Momcozy muslin swaddle blankets feature a variety of stylish colors and charming patterns designed to suit both babies and parents. These baby swaddle blankets easily complement different nursery styles while adding a warm and lovely touch to everyday moments.. 【A Thoughtful Gift & Baby Registry Essential】Part of Momcozy’s thoughtfully designed line of swaddles for newborns, these muslin swaddle blankets combine softness, versatility, and timeless design. A practical choice for baby showers, baby registry gifts, and newborn essentials for new families.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HkUAkfYtL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QpNfb8q6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KF3YfylLL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CULcZ0hPL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KU5YNhLUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YzKFPmR+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LT68GKYNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-1Tv6eycL._SL1500_.jpg"]',4.8,8031,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F4WTKRP7',1778332873,1,NULL,'["70% Viscose Derived from Bamboo Fiber, 30% Cotton","【OEKO-TEX Certified: Soft & Breathable Swaddle Blanket】Momcozy muslin swaddle blankets are made with 70% viscose derived from bamboo fiber and 30% cotton, an OEKO-TEX certified lightweight and breathable fabric that feels soft and gentle on delicate newborn skin. The airy muslin fabric helps keep babies comfortable during sleep, cuddling, and everyday use.","【Generous 47\" x 47\" Size for Easy Swaddling】Designed as swaddles for newborns, the large 47 x 47 inch swaddle blanket makes wrapping babies easier while providing a cozy and secure feeling similar to the womb. The breathable muslin fabric helps babies stay comfortable during naps, bedtime, or cuddling.","【Versatile Muslin Swaddle Blanket for Daily Use】More than just a baby swaddle blanket, this multipurpose muslin baby blanket can also be used as receiving blankets, nursing cover, stroller cover, burp cloth, tummy time blanket, changing pad, or lightweight travel blanket, making it a practical everyday essential for parents.","【Beautiful Colors & Thoughtful Designs】Momcozy muslin swaddle blankets feature a variety of stylish colors and charming patterns designed to suit both babies and parents. These baby swaddle blankets easily complement different nursery styles while adding a warm and lovely touch to everyday moments.","【A Thoughtful Gift & Baby Registry Essential】Part of Momcozy’s thoughtfully designed line of swaddles for newborns, these muslin swaddle blankets combine softness, versatility, and timeless design. A practical choice for baby showers, baby registry gifts, and newborn essentials for new families."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FNQS31SJ','Muslin Swaddle Blankets for Newborn, 4 Pack Cotton Baby Blankets for Boys, Large 31.5 x 43.3 Breathable Soft Receiving Blanket, Essentials Swaddle Wrap Burping Clothes, Blue Whale','muslin-swaddle-blankets-for-newborn-4-pack-cotton-baby-blank-b0fnqs31sj','CIVARUA KIDS','Baby Accessories',23.99,'Soft & Breathable: Made of 100% muslin cotton, the Civarua Kids swaddle blankets are breathable、lightweight and skin-friendly, with three times the softness of regular cotton. These baby swaddle blankets are certified by OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100, ensuring meticulous quality and meeting the highest safety standards for babies.. Practical & Multi-Use: Baby muslin swaddle blankets are incredibly versatile, supporting both infants and parents in countless scenarios. They work perfectly as a tummy time mat, nursing cover, changing table cover, or stroller shield. Whether at home or on the go, these swaddles prove indispensable—ideal for bath time, feeding, burping, swaddling, or quick cleanups. Reusable, ultra-soft, breathable, and highly absorbent, they’re designed to simplify daily care for both baby and you.. Focus on Baby Design: Measuring 31.5×43.3 inches, these baby receiving blankets provide ample space to effortlessly wrap newborns from shoulders to feet. They recreate a comforting sense reminiscent of the womb, soothing your little one and preventing newborns from being startled awake. This 4-pack set comes in a variety of colors, meeting the personalized preferences of babies of different genders.. Easy Care & Stain-Resistant: These muslin baby blankets are easy to care for—simply hand wash or machine wash with cold water and mild detergent. They can be hung flat to dry or tumble dried on low heat. Withstanding multiple machine washes without fading, they help reduce household chores for parents, turning parenting into an enjoyable and fulfilling experience.. Awesome Essential Baby Shower Gift: Each set is well-made and neatly packaged. These durable, soft muslin swaddle blankets make a practical and thoughtful gift for baby showers, baby registries, Christmas, housewarmings, or any special gifting occasion.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qvuK+7nKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zFGkRm37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pUqBC8l2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815rBAnjfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811wjMZNAaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y4ZESDTFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ppsrFDp-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618mAwVuISL._AC_SL1024_.jpg"]',4.7,161,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FNQS31SJ',1778332880,1,NULL,'["Soft & Breathable: Made of 100% muslin cotton, the Civarua Kids swaddle blankets are breathable、lightweight and skin-friendly, with three times the softness of regular cotton. These baby swaddle blankets are certified by OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100, ensuring meticulous quality and meeting the highest safety standards for babies.","Practical & Multi-Use: Baby muslin swaddle blankets are incredibly versatile, supporting both infants and parents in countless scenarios. They work perfectly as a tummy time mat, nursing cover, changing table cover, or stroller shield. Whether at home or on the go, these swaddles prove indispensable—ideal for bath time, feeding, burping, swaddling, or quick cleanups. Reusable, ultra-soft, breathable, and highly absorbent, they’re designed to simplify daily care for both baby and you.","Focus on Baby Design: Measuring 31.5×43.3 inches, these baby receiving blankets provide ample space to effortlessly wrap newborns from shoulders to feet. They recreate a comforting sense reminiscent of the womb, soothing your little one and preventing newborns from being startled awake. This 4-pack set comes in a variety of colors, meeting the personalized preferences of babies of different genders.","Easy Care & Stain-Resistant: These muslin baby blankets are easy to care for—simply hand wash or machine wash with cold water and mild detergent. They can be hung flat to dry or tumble dried on low heat. Withstanding multiple machine washes without fading, they help reduce household chores for parents, turning parenting into an enjoyable and fulfilling experience.","Awesome Essential Baby Shower Gift: Each set is well-made and neatly packaged. These durable, soft muslin swaddle blankets make a practical and thoughtful gift for baby showers, baby registries, Christmas, housewarmings, or any special gifting occasion."]');
