 large enough to swaddle your baby securely, keeping them cozy and comfortable.","Multi-functional Uses: Perfect as a receiving blanket, stroller cover, nursing cover, burp cloth, play mat, or tummy time blanket—essential for every parent. Each blanket is made of 100% cotton muslin with a breathable design, keeping your baby warm in cooler weather and cool in warmer weather.","Neutral Colors for Boys and Girls: Featuring unisex, neutral colors and classic patterns that match any nursery or baby outfit, ideal for baby boys and girls.","Durable and Easy Care: Machine washable and tumble dry on low, blankets get softer with every wash and retain their vibrant colors.","Must-Have Baby Gift: A thoughtful gift for baby showers, newborn registries, and parents-to-be, ideal for baby boys and girls alike."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0C7VM6R3N','GLLQUEN BABY Receiving Blanket Boy Cotton Muslin Swaddle Blankets Girl Newborn Squares Breathable & Soft Thin Baby Blankets Cloths Double Absorbent Infant Swaddling Wrap - 6 Pack (Sun)','gllquen-baby-receiving-blanket-boy-cotton-muslin-swaddle-bla-b0c7vm6r3n','GLLQUEN BABY','Baby Accessories',19.99,'Kind to Baby''s Skin: Soft and silky natural fabric—the best fabric for babies—is up to 3 times softer than regular cotton and maintains durability. Our swaddle blanket set is made of 70% viscose derived from bamboo and 30% cotton, which is softer, lighter, and more skin-friendly than 100% organic cotton. Breathable and gentle on sensitive skin, these breathable muslin squares are perfect for your little one. Four Seasons General & Versatile: Due to their practical size (70 x 70 cm, SIX-pack), these baby blankets can be used for a variety of purposes, such as a receiving blanket, cuddle blanket, nursing cover, sunscreen for strollers, burp cloth, car seat cover, play mat, changing pad, mini crib sheet, cleaning the face, catching spit-up, sunshade cover, picnic pad, or tummy time blanket. Fast-drying and ready for the next use, they provide even more day-to-day versatility for parents. Focus on Baby Design: Inspired by parenthood and a passion to bring the colourful imagination of a child to life, we develop each of our products in close collaboration with experienced midwives and young parents, best quality, individual designs and responsible production are always our top priority. Rest assured, every product meets the OEKO-TEX Standard 100 and is safe for babies. Superior Quality & Reusable: Muslin blankets can be hand-washed or machine-washed with cold water and mild detergent. Hang flat to dry or tumble dry on low heat. Our high-quality fabric ensures they will keep their softness and color even after many washes, remaining gentle on sensitive skin and becoming softer with each wash. Great Baby Shower Gift: Looking for something incredibly useful for an expecting couple or new parents? Our swaddle blankets make a great baby shower gift. The cute patterned muslin cloths for baby girls and boys are perfect for both. A great baby essential for your own home, these versatile blankets are the perfect present for any mom or dad-to-be','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714SQLZIBsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tz+qf-IXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717XOBc63ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G-41Jrj2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IsSmsFaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kjcNsCC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9nRkVMbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pn4xnRJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ZfENqNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,3666,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7VM6R3N',1778332906,1,NULL,'["Kind to Baby''s Skin: Soft and silky natural fabric—the best fabric for babies—is up to 3 times softer than regular cotton and maintains durability. Our swaddle blanket set is made of 70% viscose derived from bamboo and 30% cotton, which is softer, lighter, and more skin-friendly than 100% organic cotton. Breathable and gentle on sensitive skin, these breathable muslin squares are perfect for your little one","Four Seasons General & Versatile: Due to their practical size (70 x 70 cm, SIX-pack), these baby blankets can be used for a variety of purposes, such as a receiving blanket, cuddle blanket, nursing cover, sunscreen for strollers, burp cloth, car seat cover, play mat, changing pad, mini crib sheet, cleaning the face, catching spit-up, sunshade cover, picnic pad, or tummy time blanket. Fast-drying and ready for the next use, they provide even more day-to-day versatility for parents","Focus on Baby Design: Inspired by parenthood and a passion to bring the colourful imagination of a child to life, we develop each of our products in close collaboration with experienced midwives and young parents, best quality, individual designs and responsible production are always our top priority. Rest assured, every product meets the OEKO-TEX Standard 100 and is safe for babies","Superior Quality & Reusable: Muslin blankets can be hand-washed or machine-washed with cold water and mild detergent. Hang flat to dry or tumble dry on low heat. Our high-quality fabric ensures they will keep their softness and color even after many washes, remaining gentle on sensitive skin and becoming softer with each wash","Great Baby Shower Gift: Looking for something incredibly useful for an expecting couple or new parents? Our swaddle blankets make a great baby shower gift. The cute patterned muslin cloths for baby girls and boys are perfect for both. A great baby essential for your own home, these versatile blankets are the perfect present for any mom or dad-to-be"]');
