m/images/I/81IW9W5Y4cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jjrR5WqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y1WECH5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h1XlTffsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,539,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DS2VB3JH',1778332915,1,NULL,'["Ultra - Soft for Baby''s Skin: Crafted from 100% muslin cotton, its high - density fabric is perfect for daily swaddling. Gentle on sensitive skin, it''s non - irritating and free of harmful substances.","Multi - Functional: Baby Muslin Swaddle Blanket This swaddle blanket has multiple uses. It can be a tummy - time mat, nursing cover, changing table or stroller cover. It''s useful at home or outdoors, for bathing, feeding, etc. It''s reusable, soft, breathable, and absorbent.","Thin, Breathable & Absorbent: Each 41X41 - inch muslin swaddle blanket is thin yet breathable. It keeps babies warm in cool weather and allows skin to breathe in warm weather. It helps regulate body temperature, preventing overheating.","Set of Unisex Colors: The package contains 2 swaddle blankets in neutral colors, perfect for both baby boys and girls. selected unisex hues that can effortlessly match any baby outfit. These muslin blankets are easy to clean—you can either hand - wash them or machine - wash with cold water and mild detergent.","Ideal Baby Shower Gift: Each well - made set comes neatly packaged. These durable, soft muslin swaddle blankets are a practical, thoughtful gift for baby showers, registries, Christmas, housewarmings, or other special occasions."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FNX5TL6P','New Little Ouchies Pain Fidget, 3D Printed Pain Stim Fidget for Adult , Spiky Grippy Stim Keychain with [Spinner & Clicker] Functions, Sensory Toys for Stress Relief - 2 Pack','new-little-ouchies-pain-fidget-3d-printed-pain-stim-fidget-f-b0fnx5tl6p','Symeno Select','Kids Toys & Learning',9.99,'[3-in-1 Fidget: Squeeze Away Overwhelm] When tension peaks and your thoughts are in chaos, firmly squeeze, momentary stim and pain feeling replaces mental chaos with physical focus, bringing instant clarity and calm.Spin and Click this Little Ouchies Fidget to settle restless hands, helping curb nail-biting and other fidgeting habits.. [Comfort-Focused Textured Spikes] Say goodbye to overly sharp spikes. Our 3D-printed, rounded spikes are designed with a lower profile for intense yet comfortable and sustained pressure. It''s the refined choice for effective stimulation.. [Durable & Backed by Our Promise] Crafted from premium, plant-based PLA for exceptional durability. We rigorously test each piece and stand behind our quality. Should any issue arise, contact us and we''ll promptly resolve your concern.. [Portable & Discreet Daily Companion] Your calm, on the go. The compact design and secure metal chain make it the perfect pocket-sized companion for instant, discreet relief anywhere.. [Quality Guaranteed + The Perfect Gift] Shop with confidence. Our Little Ouchies are built to last, and backed by a worry-free guarantee—contact us for any quality issues. It''s the unique gift that delivers real sensory relief.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VomwabS4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xs3Ph-mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D1kLoUhzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718I6-IPl1L._A