: With five vibrant silicone bubbles set in a sturdy plastic frame, these sensory baby toys captivate babies and toddlers with sensory exploration for fine motor skills development","ENCOURAGES FINE MOTOR SKILLS: The push-and-pop action of the baby sensory toys promotes the development of fine motor skills in young children","PORTABLE SENSORY DELIGHT: Sized at just 5.5 x 5 inches, this lightweight sensory toy for babies and toddlers 10 months+ is easy to carry, great for on-the-go entertainment","FIDGETS: Made from high-quality ABS plastic, 100% food-grade silicone, and made without BPA, this baby toy with squishy fidget bubbles has long-lasting durability","SUITABLE FOR BABIES AND TODDLERS: These sensory toys for toddlers are designed for ages 10 months and up, these toddler sensory toys foster cause-and-effect learning while keeping little fingers engaged and entertained"]');
