,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DprufrmSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,75,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CRF13PTP',1778332963,1,NULL,'["HEXEL: The everyday fidget toy for hands of all sizes. Crafted with six Plus-Plus pieces and connected by a flexible cord, HEXEL bends, twists, and connects to allow you to create mesmerizing forms or simply just fidget!","INCREASE FOCUS: Channel extra energy into fiddling with these puzzle toys so you can focus during work, school, or at home. Creates comfort for your mind, hands, and nerves.","REDUCE ANXIETY: Let HEXEL help you relax! Use our sensory fidget toy to fight stress, anxiety, and impatience. Perfect for kids or adults with restlessness, ADD, ADHD, or Autism.","PERFECT FOR ON-THE-GO: Quiet, pocket-friendly and portable for anytime fidgeting at your fingertips. Great for at home or on an adventure – car rides, restaurants, work, or a friend’s house!","Kid-safe: This art kit appeals to a broad range of ages! Suggested ages 5+. Made from high quality BPA-free and phthalate-free plastic. Made in Denmark in our own zero-plastic-waste factory powered by renewable energy."]');
