hey stand up to drops, twists, and rough play without breaking or cracking. Every piece meets US toy safety standards","Great Value and Gifts Packed: This fidget toys set offers unbeatable value with 25 different toy types packed together in one affordable box. The versatile collection works for multiple purposes, such as party favors, classroom rewards and gift giving, so you don’t have to buy separate items for every occasion","Popular Uses: Perfect for birthday party favors, classroom rewards, carnivals, school prizes boxes, piñata filler, Christmas stocking stuffers, and goodie bag fillers. It’s a safe, calming choice for kids with autism or ADHD, OCD, or high stress, helping with anxiety relief and stress relief in a gentle, natural way","You deserve the best, and that''s why we offer a 2-year warranty","Party Favors: Tired of messy party favors? Our fidget toys are the answer: quiet, mess-free, and loved by kids and parents. Great for birthdays, carnivals, or classroom parties, they’re easy to toss into goody bags or hand out as prizes. Watch faces light up as little hands stay busy and big smiles stay on—all party long","Amazing Gift Prizes and Rewards: These fidget toys great for carnival prizes, pinata fillers, Christmas giveaways, goodie bag fillers, miniature novelty toys, Valentine gifts bag, Easter basket stuffers, Easter egg fillers, Halloween party giveaway","This compact fidget toy set slips effortlessly into your daily carry, keep it into your work desk drawer, backpack, purse, or car console. The perfect pocket-sized solution for managing stress during travel, long waits, or any situation needing a quick focus tool","Keep your hands busy with these super fun fidget toys, perfect for twisting, pulling, popping, and messing around whenever you need to fidget","We''re just trying to get a little relief in these crazy years of 2025 and 2026. When we press the bubbles down, they make a slight popping sound, then flip over and start all over again"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0DSZKJFKQ','Sensory Fidget Toys for Kids Toddler: 4 Pack Color Sorting Sensory Toys for Autism - Squeeze Calming Toys for Toddler Girls Boys - Quiet Fidget Toys for Student Classroom - Goodie Bags Stuffers','sensory-fidget-toys-for-kids-toddler-4-pack-color-sorting-se-b0dszkjfkq','Symeno Select','Kids Toys & Learning',12.99,'【Quiet Squeeze to Relax Mood】These Fidget sensory toys are filled with gel and super soft marble beads, providing an extraordinary sensory experience for children aged 3 years and above. They help children relieve stress and nervousness while relieving emotional outbursts. They are also great for adults to improve concentration and release work pressure, with a silent design that will not disturb others.. 【Toddler Travel Toy Set】This set includes four hourglass-shaped sensory toys. By squeezing the beads on both sides to the other side of the channel, kids can complete fun color-matching games while developing finger fine motor and hand-eye coordination. This travel-friendly design allows kids to focus during flights, car or train trips, and the operation is quiet and mess-free. Parents can enjoy stress-free travel. Perfect silent squeeze toy for long trips.. 【Durable fidget sensory toys】 These sensory toys are designed to withstand the intense use of kids and are durable. They will not break or fade, making them ideal fidget toys. Kids can treat it in various ways, such as pinching it in their hands, folding it, or violently squeezing it, and it will still not deform and remain intact.. 【Play Anytime, Anywhere】Compactly patented design at 5.6 inches x 5.6 inches, this portable, quiet sensory toy can be taken to school classrooms or played outdoors with friends. A must-have travel toy, it provides a calming distraction for impatient children, helping them settle down when needed.. 【Perfect Gift Option】Perfect for birthdays, easter basket stuffers, and Thanksgiving, or as stocking stuffers, these kids'' sensory toys serve as excellent party favors, class rewards, or goody bag fillers. They are also ideal gifts for individuals with ADD, ADHD, Autism, or nervousness.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z-SllOMiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlU5fkhQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bonwzuwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Je-5CHboL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wANJJX2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817eOpR2sgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716s6gTri2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gokY9iSpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,256,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DSZKJFKQ',1778332985,1,NULL,'["【Quiet Squeeze to Relax Mood】These Fidget sensory toys are filled with gel and super soft marble beads, providing an extraordinary sensory experience for children aged 3 years and above. They help children relieve stress and nervousness while relieving emotional outbursts. They are also great for adults to improve concentration and release work pressure, with a silent design that will not disturb others.","【Toddler Travel Toy Set】This set includes four hourglass-shaped sensory toys. By squeezing the beads on both sides to the other side of the channel, kids can complete fun color-matching games while developing finger fine motor and hand-eye coordination. This travel-friendly design allows kids to focus during flights, car or train trips, and the operation is quiet and mess-free. Parents can enjoy stress-free travel. Perfect silent squeeze toy for long trips.","【Durable fidget sensory toys】 These sensory toys are designed to withstand the intense use of kids and are durable. They will not break or fade, making them ideal fidget toys. Kids can treat it in various ways, such as pinching it in their hands, folding it, or violently squeezing it, and it will still not deform and remain intact.","【Play Anytime, Anywhere】Compactly patented design at 5.6 inches x 5.6 inches, this portable, quiet sensory toy can be taken to school classrooms or played outdoors with friends. A must-have travel toy, it provides a calming distraction for impatient children, helping them settle down when needed.","【Perfect Gift Option】Perfect for birthdays, easter basket stuffers, and Thanksgiving, or as stocking stuffers, these kids'' sensory toys serve as excellent party favors, class rewards, or goody bag fillers. They are also ideal gifts for individuals with ADD, ADHD, Autism, or nervousness."]');
