 turns petting into an effective deshedding tool","Pet Hair Removal Glove – Removing hair not only helps reduce flying hair in the air, it stimulates skin oils and improves coat softness and shine","Versatile Wet or Dry Use – Great for dogs and cats with short, medium, curly, or long coats, this pet hair removal glove can be used daily or during bath time for an even deeper clean","Adjustable Comfort Fit – Flexible and breathable, our cat and dog brush fits most pet owners thanks to the adjustable wrist strap, better yet, it’s machine washable","What You Get – Every order comes complete with 1 right-hand pet grooming glove"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FG7D2TR9','SAWMONG Pet Hair Removal Glove, 2Pcs Cat & Dog Reusable Pet Hair Remover Gloves New Upgrade, Grooming Pet Hair Remover Tool, Alternative to Lint Rollers','sawmong-pet-hair-removal-glove-2pcs-cat-dog-reusable-pet-hai-b0fg7d2tr9','SAWMONG','Pet Accessories',19.99,'Electrostatic Technology for Effortless Cleaning: Equipped with advanced electrostatic adsorption technology, this pet hair removal glove picks up lint, pet fur, and dust with just gentle side-to-side wiping. Using pure physical adsorption, it works effectively without snagging fabric. Safe and gentle to use on clothes, bed sheets, sofas, carpets, car seats, and more, it delivers deep cleaning while protecting your belongings. Reusable & Easy to Clean: This washable pet fur remover glove is designed for repeated use. It replaces wasteful lint sheets and rollers, helping you save money while reducing environmental impact. Cleaning is also simple: just remove the clumped hair with the included flea comb, then rinse it under water. It even has a built-in hanging loop, so you can hang it up to air dry right after washing. Ergonomic Design for Easy Handling: The fingerless pet grooming gloves feature an ergonomic design for a secure, comfortable fit. It flexibly conforms to any surface for effortless cleaning. Slip it on and start cleaning right away — no complicated setup required, making whole-home pet hair removal simple and stress-free. Complete Pet Grooming & Cleaning Set: This reusable pet care kit includes two high-quality pet hair removal gloves, plus a bonus flea comb. Use the comb to clear hair from the gloves or groom your pet directly, giving you an all-in-one solution for pet fur removal and grooming. Works on All Surfaces: This pet hair removal tool handles pet fur on clothes, bedding, sofas, carpets, car seats, and even pet beds with ease. The ideal cleaning essential for pet households, car trips, and daily chores — it takes the hassle out of removing stubborn pet hair from anywhere in your life','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8188hAKGjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jRqIlmyQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WZ+9iWddL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r7zPiDxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hi1D4eO+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B7QQ-VTiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PUHMefa9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L+xWvkVRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.1,206,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FG7D2TR9',1778333037,1,NULL,'["Electrostatic Technology for Effortless Cleaning: Equipped with advanced electrostatic adsorption technology, this pet hair removal glove picks up lint, pet fur, and dust with just gentle side-to-side wiping. Using pure physical adsorption, it works effectively without snagging fabric. Safe and gentle to use on clothes, bed sheets, sofas, carpets, car seats, and more, it delivers deep cleaning while protecting your belongings","Reusable & Easy to Clean: This washable pet fur remover glove is designed for repeated use. It replaces wasteful lint sheets and rollers, helping you save money while reducing environmental impact. Cleaning is also simple: just remove the clumped hair with the included flea comb, then rinse it under water. It even has a built-in hanging loop, so you can hang it up to air dry right after washing","Ergonomic Design for Easy Handling: The fingerless pet grooming gloves feature an ergonomic design for a secure, comfortable fit. It flexibly conforms to any surface for effortless cleaning. Slip it on and start cleaning right away — no complicated setup required, making whole-home pet hair removal simple and stress-free","Complete Pet Grooming & Cleaning Set: This reusable pet care kit includes two high-quality pet hair removal gloves, plus a bonus flea comb. Use the comb to clear hair from the gloves or groom your pet directly, giving you an all-in-one solution for pet fur removal and grooming","Works on All Surfaces: This pet hair removal tool handles pet fur on clothes, bedding, sofas, carpets, car seats, and even pet beds with ease. The ideal cleaning essential for pet households, car trips, and daily chores — it takes the hassle out of removing stubborn pet hair from anywhere in your life"]');
