n is extended to 10 yards per roll, a total of 120 yards. Most ribbons on the market are 5 yards per roll.","Rainbow Shades：Enjoy 12 bright colors, this classic rainbow-themed ribbon is enough for any occasion.Each color is bright and eye-catching, with high saturation, just like concentrating the gorgeous rainbow on the ribbon.","Excellent Quality：Made from washable 100% polyester fabric with a smooth finish, these ribbons won''t shrink or fade, keeping them looking new for years to come, giving you peace of mind.","Wide Application：Perfect for gift wrapping, craft hair accessories, bouquets, wedding party decorations. 12 rich colors can meet your different decoration ideas and style needs, easily creating a unique and unforgettable atmosphere."]');
