quality single faced satin ribbon, 100% polyester fabric ribbon. The surface is smooth, shiny and comfortable to the touch, it is a good choice for craft ribbons","This style solid color satin ribbon width is 1 inch and length is 50 yards, Enough quantity to meet your needs, super cost-effective for you to save money","Bright Color ribbons, great color fastness, Bright and lively, this ribbon adds a lively atmosphere to gift wrapping or holiday decorations","Versatile ribbon, wide range of applications, especially for gift box packaging, invitations, floral design, handmade roses, festival and party decorations, baking packaging, bouquet ribbons, crafts, and more creative design","These wrapping ribbons and decorative ribbons are suitable for many occasions, birthday, party decoration, Mother''s Day, Valentine''s Day, Easter, Independence Day, Halloween, Christmas, New Year''s Gift, scene setting, baby shower, etc"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F3D2QTC8','Navy Blue Balloons 145pcs Different Sizes 5in 10in 12in 18in Dark Blue Round Latex Balloon Arch Kit Garland for Graduation Wedding Baby Shower Birthday Party Decoration','navy-blue-balloons-145pcs-different-sizes-5in-10in-12in-18in-b0f3d2qtc8','IXVAN','Party & Gifting',9.99,'Package Includes: 145 pcs navy blue balloons different sizes include 18 inch (5 pcs), 12 inch (30 pcs), 10 inch (35 pcs), and 5 inch (75 pcs).. Material: These navy blue balloons are made of natural latex, durable and harmless, thicker and not easy to explode, you can inflate them with air or helium, and stand well in the whole party, never worry about any problems with these balloons.. Widely Applications: These large and small navy blue balloons are perfect for creating stunning balloon garlands and arch kits. So it widely used for varied occasions, such as birthday party, graduation, baby shower, New Year, anniversary, holiday, Halloween, Father''s Day and so on.. Warm reminder: Do not over inflate the latex balloons beyond 90%. Keep the balloons round when inflated, and avoid exposing them to direct sunlight, extreme heat, sharp objects, or excessive friction.. After Sales：If you encounter any problems after purchasing balloons, you can contact us and we will be happy to serve you.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6zIG-+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616a6RzTjvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L4CsHjzJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8139u2uILyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TIozK9ciL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qkTKFxlbL._AC_SL1088_.jpg"]',4.6,275,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F3D2QTC8',1778333201,1,NULL,'["Package Includes: 145 pcs navy blue balloons different sizes include 18 inch (5 pcs), 12 inch (30 pcs), 10 inch (35 pcs), and 5 inch (75 pcs).","Material: These navy blue balloons are made of natural latex, durable and harmless, thicker and not easy to explode, you can inflate them with air or helium, and stand well in the whole party, never worry about any problems with these balloons.","Widely Applications: These large and small navy blue balloons are perfect for creating stunning balloon garlands and arch kits. So it widely used for varied occasions, such as birthday party, graduation, baby shower, New Year, anniversary, holiday, Halloween, Father''s Day and so on.","Warm reminder: Do not over inflate the latex balloons beyond 90%. Keep the balloons round when inflated, and avoid exposing them to direct sunlight, extreme heat, sharp objects, or excessive friction.","After Sales：If you encounter any problems after purchasing balloons, you can contact us and we will be happy to serve you."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FG7J3NHY','White and Gold Balloon Garland Arch Kit 132Pcs Metallic gold Ivory white Cream White Clear Balloons Different Sizes for Wedding Engagements Birthday Bridal Shower Baby Shower Anniversary Decorations','white-and-gold-balloon-garland-arch-kit-132pcs-metallic-gold-b0fg7j3nhy','CROSSFINGERS','Party & Gifting',9.99,'White and Gold Balloon Garland Arch Kit 132Pcs Metallic gold Ivory white Cream White Clear Balloons Different Sizes for Wedding Engagements Birthday Bridal Shower Baby Shower Anniversary Decorations','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3gHfVqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SFswwTfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b2OtzIqBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7FMNvBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613G145Un1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-bMJod0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619OT27OszL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,334,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FG7J3NHY',1778333207,1,NULL,'["Package Includes: 132 pcs white and gold balloon arch garland kit includes 46pcs chrome gold balloons (1x18\", 25x10\", 20x5\"), 41pcs ivory white balloons (1x18\", 20x10\", 20x5\"), 41pcs cream white balloons (1x18\", 20x10\", 20x5\"), 4pcs clear 12\" balloons, 1pc balloon chain and glue point. You can put together this white and gold balloon garland that makes a wonderful statement piece","Reusable Material: Made of non-toxic and safe material, the balloons will be safe for everyone. High-quality balloons will ensure your balloons last longer than you want","Wide Usage: The white and gold balloon arch kit is suitable for many occasions. You can use them to decorate birthdays, baby showers, weddings, engagements, bridal showers, bachelorette parties, gender reveals, anniversaries, graudation party, baptism party","Easy To DIY: Balloon strips and adhesive dots are provided to make a balloon arch garland easier. You can use your imagination to create unique and eye-catching decorations and arrange them as party backdrops","100% Satisfaction Guaranteed: The white and gold balloon decorations were carefully checked before going up for sale, If you have any unhappiness about party supplies, please do not hesitate to contact us"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FN3YXQHD','Pink Blue Yellow Pastel Balloon Arch Kit, 124Pcs Macaron Light Pink Blue Yellow Balloons for Spring Tea Party Baby Shower Wedding Birthday Gender Reveal Party Decorations','pink-blue-yellow-pastel-balloon-arch-kit-124pcs-macaron-ligh-b0fn3yxqhd','CROSSFINGERS','Party & Gifting',12.99,'Balloon Arch Kit','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nUsLAWlyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PNW-iMMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t2DcpiQ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iYjdc6HvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kCM4Yc-aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DKGuVtJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N3zqR9-3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,124,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FN3YXQHD',1778333216,1,NULL,'["Package Includes: Light Pink--5\"*15pcs/10\"*10pcs/12\"*10pcs/18\"*1pcs, Macaron Yellow--5\"*15pcs/10\"*10pcs/12\"*10pcs/18\"*1pcs；Macaron Blue--5\"*15pcs/10\"*15pcs/18\"*1pcs, Mist Blue--5\"*10pcs/10\"*15pcs/18\"*1pcs","Premium Quality：Made of non-toxic, durable latex. It''s not uncommon for balloons to have tiny, barely noticeable pinholes due to the manufacturing process. Before inflating, gently stretch the balloon—especially around the neck—to check for any visible tears or holes","Versatile Decor：Perfect for birthdays, weddings, baby showers, graduations & more! Transform any space into a festive wonderland effortlessly. For a fuller balloon arch, you can use two to three sets. Feel free to customize and arrange them however you like","Customer Service: Quality-checked before shipping. Contact us for any issues - we''ll make it right! Your happiness is our priority"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F299FFGG','CROSSFINGERS Sage Green White Balloon Garland Arch Kit,145pcs Green Sand White Balloons Different Sizes for Birthday Baby Shower Gender Reveal Bridal Weddings Party Decoration','crossfingers-sage-green-white-balloon-garland-arch-kit145pcs-b0f299ffgg','CROSSFINGERS','Party & Gifting',10.99,'[Package Includes]--The sage green balloon arch kit includes a total of 145 balloons in different sizes: 18”, 12”, 10”, and 5”. The kit features 3colors— sage green, sand white, and white-great for designing a show-stopping balloon garland. [Thick & Long-Lasting]--Dusty green balloon garland kit features thick, long-lasting latex balloons that are non-toxic, skin-friendly, and resistant to leaks or punctures. These green and sand white balloons maintain their vibrant colors throughout your entire party, whether used for indoor or outdoor decorations. [Wide Application]--the neutral green balloon arch kit is ideal for birthday, gender reveal baby showers, celebrations, bridal weddings, graduation,engagements, anniversaries, corporate events, bachelor party, galentine’s day, bridal showers,first communion ,baptism,and more! Use them as a photo backdrop, entrance decor, ceiling garland, or table centerpiece. The mix of green and white shades creates a dreamy vibe. [Beginner-Friendly]--Quick setup! Simply inflate with air or helium, attach to the included balloon strip, and customize your design. The glue dots and ribbons help secure the balloons effortlessly. Tip: Use a balloon pump for faster inflation. [Warm Reminder]--Let us know if any balloons are damaged or missing. Tip: For best results, keep balloons out of direct sunlight and avoid over-inflating','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CcuRAq4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PnodYKXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wFt-XW7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-uRTC7SJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bclEVf1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iR0OzRNPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZD1ct6FTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712ysbaqyyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mtx5IABKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,251,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F299FFGG',1778333222,1,NULL,'["[Package Includes]--The sage green balloon arch kit includes a total of 145 balloons in different sizes: 18”, 12”, 10”, and 5”. The kit features 3colors— sage green, sand white, and white-great for designing a show-stopping balloon garland","[Thick & Long-Lasting]--Dusty green balloon garland kit features thick, long-lasting latex balloons that are non-toxic, skin-friendly, and resistant to leaks or punctures. These green and sand white balloons maintain their vibrant colors throughout your entire party, whether used for indoor or outdoor decorations","[Wide Application]--the neutral green balloon arch kit is ideal for birthday, gender reveal baby showers, celebrations, bridal weddings, graduation,engagements, anniversaries, corporate events, bachelor party, galentine’s day, bridal showers,first communion ,baptism,and more! Use them as a photo backdrop, entrance decor, ceiling garland, or table centerpiece. The mix of green and white shades creates a dreamy vibe","[Beginner-Friendly]--Quick setup! Simply inflate with air or helium, attach to the included balloon strip, and customize your design. The glue dots and ribbons help secure the balloons effortlessly. Tip: Use a balloon pump for faster inflation","[Warm Reminder]--Let us know if any balloons are damaged or missing. Tip: For best results, keep balloons out of direct sunlight and avoid over-inflating"]');
