h as Birthday Parties, Family Gatherings, Christmas, Halloween, Wedding, Banquets, Baby Shower, Graduation Ceremonies etc. Please Feel Free to Contact Us with Any Issues, We Will Try Our Best to Help."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0CQV6JCWX','RUBFAC Balloon Arch Kit, 8ft Tall & 9ft Wide Adjustable Balloon Arch Frame Stand with 2 PVC Bases,2 Water Fillable Bags, 50pcs Balloon Clips for Wedding Party Baby Shower Supplies Christmas Decoration','rubfac-balloon-arch-kit-8ft-tall-9ft-wide-adjustable-balloon-b0cqv6jcwx','rubfac','Party & Gifting',18.99,'【Complete Package】This balloon arch stand kit includes 13pcs 17 inch foldable fiberglass rods, 2pcs PVC bases, 2pcs water fillable bags, 50pcs balloon clips, 2pcs PVC pipes, 4pcs ground nails, 2pcs ground secure ropes.. 【8ft Tall & 9ft Wide Arch Kit】The supporting PVC pipes and the foldable fiberglass rods are very strong and sturdy, not easy to break. To prevent shaking, you can put water or sand in the water fillable bags. This balloon arch kit can be reused, so enjoy the fun of DIY arches.. 【Adjustable Size】The balloon column stand is 8ft tall and 9ft wide, you can adjust the height of the arch by adjusting the distance of the base.. 【Easy to Assemble】You can use 150-200 pieces of 10-12inch balloons to make arches. Please install it one day before the party. This arch can be used indoors or outdoors, and it is fixed with plastic ground nails outdoors.. 【Widely Used】This balloon arch kit can be used for any large or small party, such as birthday party, Christmas, Halloween, wedding, graduations, Baby Shower, etc.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fdf583gIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612l0ikJuEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ShrwmhtSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aWvq2nYNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PRjADkfLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s1uhESYEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DPS9t5BmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.2,379,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CQV6JCWX',1778333243,1,NULL,'["【Complete Package】This balloon arch stand kit includes 13pcs 17 inch foldable fiberglass rods, 2pcs PVC bases, 2pcs water fillable bags, 50pcs balloon clips, 2pcs PVC pipes, 4pcs ground nails, 2pcs ground secure ropes.","【8ft Tall & 9ft Wide Arch Kit】The supporting PVC pipes and the foldable fiberglass rods are very strong and sturdy, not easy to break. To prevent shaking, you can put water or sand in the water fillable bags. This balloon arch kit can be reused, so enjoy the fun of DIY arches.","【Adjustable Size】The balloon column stand is 8ft tall and 9ft wide, you can adjust the height of the arch by adjusting the distance of the base.","【Easy to Assemble】You can use 150-200 pieces of 10-12inch balloons to make arches. Please install it one day before the party. This arch can be used indoors or outdoors, and it is fixed with plastic ground nails outdoors.","【Widely Used】This balloon arch kit can be used for any large or small party, such as birthday party, Christmas, Halloween, wedding, graduations, Baby Shower, etc."]');
