-amazon.com/images/I/61xsWT4u87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qzi14hGaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kKyn3NO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.9,222,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4VBNDYT',1778333335,1,NULL,'["Dotted Notebook: Durable vegan leather material for you to decorate the cover freely as a personalized journal. Solid thread-bound notebook helps lay flat to write easily for both right and left-handed users and prevent detaching.","Bullet Dotted Journal: 120GSM thicker paper, designed for pencils, ballpoint pens, fineliner pens, watercolor pens, markers, brush pens, fountain pens to write, sketch, paint and doodle without bleeding through and ghosting.","Dot Grid Notebook: Each journal has 80 Sheet / 160 pages dot grid paper with numbered pages and index, tablet of content to quick reference. Multi purposes book for sketchbook, journaling, painting, coloring, brainstorming, notes taking, scrapbook, collage and so on.","Dotted Journals: 5.7 inches x 8.3 inches, suitable for handbag, purse, bookbag to take around with you. Each journal has 2 inner pockets, 2 sticker labels, 2 colored ribbon bookmarks & elastic closure band and pen holder for organized writing experience.","Pack of Journal Gifts: 7 multicolored journals for quick classify different themes, projects by colors. Each Journal is individually packed, ideal gifts for kids, families, friends, students and workers as Christmas, Birthday, Back to School, office supplies."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B072FDGMW1','newestor Set of 3 A5 Dotted Notebook/Travel Journal - 5.5 x 8.25 Dot Grid Paper for Bullet Notes Journaling, Total 120 Sheets/240 Pages, Black/White/Kraft Brown Cover','newestor-set-of-3-a5-dotted-notebooktravel-journal-55-x-825-b072fdgmw1','newestor','Stationery & Journaling',9.99,'IDEAL NOTEBOOKS FOR BULLET NOTES JOURNALING This A5 notebook pack features: # 3 notepads with 40 sheets/80 pages each # lay flat binding # round corner # faint yet visible dots is perfect for planning out your layouts # 80gsm thick paper handles well with fountain pens and brush pens Great for: # daily journaling # to-do lists # goal-setting # habit tracking # and much more... Try it Today to Start Bullet Notes Journaling','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WYnB0IuML._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VS4zAEGFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q3UMzwQyL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mQe3pIooL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YREZzikEL._AC_SL1005_.jpg"]',4.7,2030,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072FDGMW1',1778333350,1,NULL,'["3-pack dotted notebook journal, inserts for A5 size travelers notebook","40 sheets/80 pages per notepad, not too thin, not too thick","Lay flat sewn binding, round corner, multicolor covers & eye pleasing cream paper","The dots are dark enough, make it easy to draw straight lines and graphs, but not distracting at all","Great for bullet notebook journal, class notes, doodles, project notebook for work, home or school and much more"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GG4F7338','60 Rolls Washi Tape Set, Aesthetic Decorative Masking Tape for Journaling Supplies, Scrapbooking Kit, DIY Arts & Crafts, Bullet Journal, Planner, Junk Journal, Gift Wrapping, School Supplies','60-rolls-washi-tape-set-aesthetic-decorative-masking-tape-fo-b0gg4f7338','SorPranxic','Stationery & Journaling',14.99,'60 Rolls size & specifications: this set contains 60 individual rolls of decorative washi tape. each roll measures 0.59 inches (15mm) in width and 6.56 feet (2m) in length. there is plenty of tape for all kinds of craft activities. Assorted patterns & designs: the collection features a wide variety of printed designs including fresh fruits, floral arrangements, ocean waves, geometric grids, hearts, and seasonal motifs. the high-definition printing ensures clear patterns for detailed artistic projects.. Removable & residue-free: features a specialized adhesive that sticks securely to smooth surfaces such as paper, walls, and plastic. the tape is repositionable and can be removed easily without peeling off the underlying paper or leaving any sticky residue behind.. High quality: manufactured from traditional semi-transparent japanese paper. the material is durable yet easy to tear by hand without scissors. it can be written on with pens, markers, or pencils, making it suitable for labeling and note-taking.. Wide application for crafts: designed for scrapbooking, bullet journaling (bujo), planners, calendars, and card making. these masking tapes serve as decorative elements for gift wrapping, photo frames, school projects, and home organization for both adults and students.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bzSWhgWaL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7166Iu8NbIL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7162WuxOFTL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ndaTYM9YL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fFQ-fD+8L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71728dw+EZL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ivdjpNP7L._SL1500_.jpg"]',4.9,17,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GG4F7338',1778333369,1,NULL,'["60 Rolls size & specifications: this set contains 60 individual rolls of decorative washi tape. each roll measures 0.59 inches (15mm) in width and 6.56 feet (2m) in length. there is plenty of tape for all kinds of craft activities","Assorted patterns & designs: the collection features a wide variety of printed designs including fresh fruits, floral arrangements, ocean waves, geometric grids, hearts, and seasonal motifs. the high-definition printing ensures clear patterns for detailed artistic projects.","Removable & residue-free: features a specialized adhesive that sticks securely to smooth surfaces such as paper, walls, and plastic. the tape is repositionable and can be removed easily without peeling off the underlying paper or leaving any sticky residue behind.","High quality: manufactured from traditional semi-transparent japanese paper. the material is durable yet easy to tear by hand without scissors. it can be written on with pens, markers, or pencils, making it suitable for labeling and note-taking.","Wide application for crafts: designed for scrapbooking, bullet journaling (bujo), planners, calendars, and card making. these masking tapes serve as decorative elements for gift wrapping, photo frames, school projects, and home organization for both adults and students."]');
