High-pigment hues stay bold in scrapbooks, planners, and DIY gift wrapping projects","【Premium Tear-Proof Material】2M per roll with reinforced edges, withstands curling and frequent repositioning","【Curated Crafting Bundle】36-style set in gift-ready packaging inspires artists, students, and stationery lovers"]');
