78333442,1,NULL,'["Extensive Color Range: Embrace creativity with 30 rolls of rainbow washi tapes in colors ranging from red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo to purple. Ideal for all scrapbooking enthusiasts.","Craft and Decor Essential: Each washi tape roll, measuring 3 meters in length and 1.5 cm in width, is perfect for decorating journals, creating scrapbook layouts, or customizing stationery.","Premium Quality Material: Our washi tapes are crafted from high-grade washi paper, ensuring easy application and removal without residue, making them the perfect colored masking tape for various surfaces.","Versatile and Functional: Whether it’s for a washi tape dispenser or freehand use, these tapes are perfect for enhancing your planners, scrapbook supplies, photo albums, and DIY craft projects,vision board supplies.","Best Gift: This set is pretty packaged with a gift box, ensuring each colored washi tape is easily accessible and stored, making it a nice gift for Women''s Day, Birthday, Mother''s Day, and other holidays."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FR7SYW25','TW SHINE Ramadan Star Moon Curtain String Lights, 138 LED 8.2 FT Star Moon Hanging Lights with 8 Modes and Timer, Waterproof Fairy Lights for Indoor Outdoor Window Holiday Mubarak Ramadan Decorations','tw-shine-ramadan-star-moon-curtain-string-lights-138-led-82-b0fr7syw25','TW SHINE','Eid & Festive',22.99,'Elegant Ramadan Decorations: This Ramadan star moon curtain string lights is the perfect way to celebrate the holy month of Ramadan. With 138 bright LED, it creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, making it ideal for decorating your home or mosque. The string lights are 6.5 feet long and feature charming star and moon shapes that symbolize the beauty of Ramadan. 8 Modes: The string lights come with 8 different lighting modes: combination, slow glow, wave, sequential, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, and steady on. This allows you to choose the perfect setting for any occasion. Simply press the button on the adapter to switch between these 8 modes. Timer Function: With a long press of the button on the adapter, you can set the lights to turn on automatically for 6 hours each day and then turn off for 18 hours. The timer function not only saves you time and effort but also helps conserve energy, making it an eco-friendly choice for your festive decorations. Waterproof and Durable: Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, these fairy lights are waterproof, ensuring they can withstand various weather conditions. This makes them ideal for decorating windows, balconies, or even hanging outdoors. The durable construction ensures that these lights will last for many Ramadans to come. It still safe when you touch the lights after long time of usage and will not overheat. Perfect for Holiday Decorations: These string lights are not just for Ramadan, they can also be used for other holidays or special occasions. Their versatile design allows you to create a festive atmosphere for Eid al-Fitr, Eid al-Adha, or any other celebration. Transform your space into a magical wonderland with these enchanting lights','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ddh9AOesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThBnu06uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UIcaQbvfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DdIjeTv9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s1u6tZ7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f3o7t7N1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zGVE5uF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.3,29,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FR7SYW25',1778333469,1,NULL,'["Elegant Ramadan Decorations: This Ramadan star moon curtain string lights is the perfect way to celebrate the holy month of Ramadan. With 138 bright LED, it creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, making it ideal for decorating your home or mosque. The string lights are 6.5 feet long and feature charming star and moon shapes that symbolize the beauty of Ramadan","8 Modes: The string lights come with 8 different lighting modes: combination, slow glow, wave, sequential, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, and steady on. This allows you to choose the perfect setting for any occasion. Simply press the button on the adapter to switch between these 8 modes","Timer Function: With a long press of the button on the adapter, you can set the lights to turn on automatically for 6 hours each day and then turn off for 18 hours. The timer function not only saves you time and effort but also helps conserve energy, making it an eco-friendly choice for your festive decorations","Waterproof and Durable: Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, these fairy lights are waterproof, ensuring they can withstand various weather conditions. This makes them ideal for decorating windows, balconies, or even hanging outdoors. The durable construction ensures that these lights will last for many Ramadans to come. It still safe when you touch the lights after long time of usage and will not overheat","Perfect for Holiday Decorations: These string lights are not just for Ramadan, they can also be used for other holidays or special occasions. Their versatile design allows you to create a festive atmosphere for Eid al-Fitr, Eid al-Adha, or any other celebration. Transform your space into a magical wonderland with these enchanting lights"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0BN87S6LR','Staraise Eid Mubarak Decorations- 3pcs Mubarak Eid Hollow Boxes with Lights,Eid Mubarak Decorations for Home,DIY Eid Mubarak Boxes for Ramadan Lights Decorations,Eid Decorations Party Decor','staraise-eid-mubarak-decorations-3pcs-mubarak-eid-hollow-box-b0bn87s6lr','Staraise','Eid & Festive',32.99,'🌙【UNIQUE Ramadan Decoration DESIGN】 These ramadan mubarak decorations for home are printed with distinctive cutout stars, moons, mosque patterns and EID letters,and 3 pieces warm white lights string,which bringing cozy and warm vibes, the eye-catching details and vibrant colors will help you light up your home.. ⭐ 【PACKAGE INCLUDES】 With 3PCS white 12”*12”*12” Hollow " E I D "boxes with 3 safe warm white string lights ，our Eid Hollow letter boxes are Indispensable applause winning decorations for your Islamic or Arabic festivals and events,you can order one set or more of this product according to your needs.. 🕌 【Perfect Ramadan /ramadan decorations for home 2024】 These attractive ramadan mubarak decorations for home , Happy EID, Hari Raya , Eid al-Fitr, Lesser Bairam parties, and other Islamic festivals . They are also outstanding ornaments at home, mosque and other Islamic places or anywhere you want to have some Islam or Arab flavor.. 🌙【EASY TO USE】 The Eid Mubarak box decorations is very easy to build without tools in just a few minutes.Just assemble the ramdan docration box with lights in a few simple steps and place it where you want to decorate, also gift these to your family and friends who wants Eid al-Adha Decorations.. ⭐【Premium Quality 】Our Ramadan decorations boxes are made of resistant paper ,safe and non-toxic, The light strings are made of copper wire, safe and easy to fold, portable to use, will not overheat after long time usage.The lighting period provided by our pre-installed batteries is around 8 hours, after which the brightness will begin to wane. If you want a longer lighting time, you need to have more coin-cell batteries to replace.After use, you can fold it up and store it for the next party theme use.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QXkH31i9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zyg0TIPmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7164ODSWieL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qi3zvy6nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TjqGalwAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ub38P32uL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ImG6nXCoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ylffKlQoL._AC_.jpg"]',4.2,70,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN87S6LR',1778333475,1,NULL,'["🌙【UNIQUE Ramadan Decoration DESIGN】 These ramadan mubarak decorations for home are printed with distinctive cutout stars, moons, mosque patterns and EID letters,and 3 pieces warm white lights string,which bringing cozy and warm vibes, the eye-catching details and vibrant colors will help you light up your home.","⭐ 【PACKAGE INCLUDES】 With 3PCS white 12”*12”*12” Hollow \" E I D \"boxes with 3 safe warm white string lights ，our Eid Hollow letter boxes are Indispensable applause winning decorations for your Islamic or Arabic festivals and events,you can order one set or more of this product according to your needs.","🕌 【Perfect Ramadan /ramadan decorations for home 2024】 These attractive ramadan mubarak decorations for home , Happy EID, Hari Raya , Eid al-Fitr, Lesser Bairam parties, and other Islamic festivals . They are also outstanding ornaments at home, mosque and other Islamic places or anywhere you want to have some Islam or Arab flavor.","🌙【EASY TO USE】 The Eid Mubarak box decorations is very easy to build without tools in just a few minutes.Just assemble the ramdan docration box with lights in a few simple steps and place it where you want to decorate, also gift these to your family and friends who wants Eid al-Adha Decorations.","⭐【Premium Quality 】Our Ramadan decorations boxes are made of resistant paper ,safe and non-toxic, The light strings are made of copper wire, safe and easy to fold, portable to use, will not overheat after long time usage.The lighting period provided by our pre-installed batteries is around 8 hours, after which the brightness will begin to wane. If you want a longer lighting time, you need to have more coin-cell batteries to replace.After use, you can fold it up and store it for the next party theme use."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0CQTD9635','Fussion Ramadan String Lights Decorations 10.3 Feet, 20 LED Battery Operated Eid LED Moon and Star Light, Ramadan Mubarak Lantern for Bedroom, Indoor, Tree, Home Decor','fussion-ramadan-string-lights-decorations-103-feet-20-led-ba-b0cqtd9635','Fussion','Eid & Festive',24.99,'Eid Al Adha Decorations String Lights','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Nx6XUjbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xz42QLhFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714YTocSZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jto8ErapL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m2DTBJnCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C+E6qvhWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dspjet0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,82,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CQTD9635',1778333492,1,NULL,'["【2 Lighting Modes】Illuminate your Ramadan celebrations with our 10.3 Feet Eid al Adha string lights are matched with 20 LED lights and 2 lighting modes (constant light+flashing), featuring a beautiful lantern, moon, and star design with vibrant LED bulbs.","【Premium Quality】Crafted with high-quality silver-plated copper wire and bright LED bulbs, our kerosene-shaped lantern string lights are not only easy to set up but also safe to use. The soft and flexible wire allows you to shape and bend the ramadan lights to suit your decorative needs.","【Hassle-free Ramadan Decoration】Our battery-powered ramadan fairy lights require 3 AA batteries (not included), making them versatile for both indoor and outdoor use. Decorate anywhere effortlessly and carry the festive spirit with you wherever you go.","【Safety first】Enjoy worry-free celebrations with our safe-to-use lights. Operating under low voltage conditions, they won''t overheat even after extended use. The copper wire is covered with ABS material, ensuring durability and protection against electric shock.","【Versatile applications】Beyond Ramadan, our waterproof string lights are perfect for adorning homes, patios, and terraces during weddings, birthday parties, Halloween carnivals, and more. Bring the enchanting glow of moon and stars to any celebration with this exquisite decorative lighting."]');
