ce. Even your moody fiddle leaf fig will flourish in these self watering pots for outdoor plants or indoor settings alike.","Smart Design for Strong Growth: The upper terracotta section provides ample room for soil and roots, while the lower section maintains gentle water contact. This balance promotes healthy root systems and prevents overwatering. The large terracotta planter structure ensures both beauty and functionality for all your houseplants.","Stylish and Thoughtful Gift Idea: Featuring a unique blend of terracotta warmth and modern clarity, this self watering terracotta pot fits effortlessly into both indoor and outdoor spaces. Its elegant, practical design makes it a thoughtful gift for birthdays, holidays, or housewarmings. A must-have for fans of terracotta self watering pots for indoor plants and plant lovers of all kinds."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B01MQGEO93','Watering Can Indoor Plants - Copper Plant Mister - Stylish and Rust Resistant Watering Cans for Healthy Hydration - Prevents Overwatering','watering-can-indoor-plants-copper-plant-mister-stylish-and-r-b01mqgeo93','Sustainable Village','Plant Care',25.7,'Vintage Style Meets Function: This brass plated plant mister isn’t just practical, it adds a vintage touch to your home. It’s a beautiful upgrade from regular watering cans or spray bottles for plants and makes a perfect gift for any plant lover.. No More Overwatering: The fine mist it produces ensures your plants get just the right amount of moisture. Whether it’s for your indoor plants, succulents, or orchids, this plant mister helps keep them hydrated without the risk of overwatering.. Rust and Stain Resistant: Made from high-quality brass, this plant watering can is durable, rust-resistant, and features a stain-resistant finish. It ensures your plant mister stays looking as striking as the day you got it, even with everyday use.. Comfortable and Easy to Use: The handle is designed for a comfortable grip, making it easy to hold during long watering sessions. Whether you''re tending to house plants or a terrarium, this plant mister spray bottle ensures a smooth and strain-free watering experience.. Perfect Hydration Every Time: The fine mist spray provides controlled moisture, so you won’t have to worry about soggy plants. It’s great for keeping your indoor plants and terrariums hydrated and healthy, with just the right amount of moisture.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJ-oGOiZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816HpcBBSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VgDLISEaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xm8-U9tVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CGeHKXF7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614e-xKOxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GCxkzs8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r4ZMIrpVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg"]',4.3,1341,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MQGEO93',1778333640,1,NULL,'["Vintage Style Meets Function: This brass plated plant mister isn’t just practical, it adds a vintage touch to your home. It’s a beautiful upgrade from regular watering cans or spray bottles for plants and makes a perfect gift for any plant lover.","No More Overwatering: The fine mist it produces ensures your plants get just the right amount of moisture. Whether it’s for your indoor plants, succulents, or orchids, this plant mister helps keep them hydrated without the risk of overwatering.","Rust and Stain Resistant: Made from high-quality brass, this plant watering can is durable, rust-resistant, and features a stain-resistant finish. It ensures your plant mister stays looking as striking as the day you got it, even with everyday use.","Comfortable and Easy to Use: The handle is designed for a comfortable grip, making it easy to hold during long watering sessions. Whether you''re tending to house plants or a terrarium, this plant mister spray bottle ensures a smooth and strain-free watering experience.","Perfect Hydration Every Time: The fine mist spray provides controlled moisture, so you won’t have to worry about soggy plants. It’s great for keeping your indoor plants and terrariums hydrated and healthy, with just the right amount of moisture."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B08C9BQLF7','Esschert Design Plant Mister, 0.3 L, Copper','esschert-design-plant-mister-03-l-copper-b08c9bqlf7','Esschert Design','Plant Care',27.06,'In 1989 Mrs. Mosterd started the business out of her 15th century farmhouse “Het Esschert” in the middle of the beautiful Twentse landscape. Her business consisted of selling gift items and items for the dining room table. Appropriately she named the business “Esschert Design”. In 1993 she was joined by 2 of her 4 sons: Arend and Gerard Mosterd. They helped to create the wholesale distribution division. Arend had just graduated from the University of Amsterdam, and Gerard had just left the military service, after earning a degree in Business Economics. They started their wholesale distribution business with the items they had developed themselves and were being produced exclusively from Esschert Design. This division was launched at a major trade show in Utrecht (Holland), in March 1993. They soon outgrew their converted barns on the family farm. They bought a bigger barn across the street. As the distribution business matured and required everyone’s time they stopped their retail business. During the following years the company grew fast and it expanded out into several different categories without losing sight of their objective to stay unique and ahead of any possible competitors. Esschert Design found its niche in home and garden gifts. Unique products but practical to use.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xMfVjEMiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wc254+43L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-JmqONieL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',3.2,4,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9BQLF7',1778333627,1,NULL,'["This plant sprayer is an essential tool for any gardener, not just during cultivation but also during the upkeep of the plants.","While sprouting, the gentle fine mist will moisten the soil without washing away the seeds.","Plants can absorb water through their leaves as well as their roots. In periods of low humidity, moisten the leaves of the plants inside and outside to keep them healthy.","Material: Copper"]');
