gh for indoor plants like succulents.It is the best present for plants lover","Multiple application: Lightweight and multiple function,this plant mister can be used for general spraying both indoor and outdoor,gardening,general cleaning,and many more other applications","Material: The top pump is made of plastic which prevent rust,and the spray bottle is made of thickened glass, not easily broken","Nordic Style: This mini pressure watering can style novel fashion,mini and lovely.Simple and vintage Nordic style is perfect for decorating your home and garden","Elegant Design:Small watering can with a convenient finger holder,it''s more comfortable to spray plants in this way.It aslo can be as decoration,the indoor plant mister looks so cool sitting on your plant stand or on your bookshelf"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B079322D72','Esschert Design TG236 Mister, Copper','esschert-design-tg236-mister-copper-b079322d72','Symeno Select','Plant Care',16.65,'Use this small stylish modern metal watering can to water your plants. Perfect for placement in the yard, in the garden, or on the patio','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHIgDSwWL._AC_SL1240_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHIgDSwWL._AC_SL1240_.jpg"]',3.7,307,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079322D72',1778333671,1,NULL,'["Perfect for watering indoor or outdoor plants","Copper Plated","Stylish and modern","Model Number: TG236"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F5PRX5MS','Glass Plant Mister Bottle - 13.5 oz Refillable Leak Proof Water Spray Bottle for Indoor Plants, Spring Gardening,Cleaning, Hair, Pets Care with Adjustable Mist Nozzle (Green)','glass-plant-mister-bottle-135-oz-refillable-leak-proof-water-b0f5prx5ms','Sincengel','Plant Care',9.96,'[ Greeting Card Enclosed ] This elegant plant mister is both an indispensable tool for nurturing indoor greenery and a thoughtful gift for plant lovers. Comes with a customizable greeting card to write your heartfelt wishes – let your love bloom with every spray.. [ Adjustable 360° Nozzle for Optimal Spray ] The mister spray bottle comes with adjustable nozzle that allows for effortless control of the spray pattern. Whether you need a fine mist, a steady stream, or a complete shut-off, the nozzle can be easily adjusted to suit your specific spraying needs, offering versatile performance for different tasks.. [ Gentle and Even Spray ] The fine mist simulates natural dew, protecting leaves from impact and making it ideal for delicate plants and flowers. Such as succulent plants, herbs, ferns, orchids, cactus etc.. [ Large Capacity ] This plant mister bottle measures 7.68 inches in height and 3.07 inches in diameter. No need for frequent water refills, saving your valuable time. The transparent glass bottle enables clear visibility of water levels for easy monitoring.. [ Versatile for Home & Garden Use ] Suitable for watering indoor plants and outdoor garden, as well as for hair care, cleaning, spraying air fresheners, and applying diluted perfumes. Stylish and elegant design perfectly paired with greenery to elevate home aesthetics.. [ Eco-friendly & Durable ] This plant watering can made of lead and BPA-free chemical-resistant thickened glass, ensuring long-lasting durability without cracking, aging, or any unpleasant odors. For the Home You Love, and the Planet You Protect.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81at8zl965L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EyGHt2RRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wNRfDkPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofYnPVctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R494pxDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vhvf8xFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716MSvurKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,416,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F5PRX5MS',1778333678,1,NULL,'["[ Greeting Card Enclosed ] This elegant plant mister is both an indispensable tool for nurturing indoor greenery and a thoughtful gift for plant lovers. Comes with a customizable greeting card to write your heartfelt wishes – let your love bloom with every spray.","[ Adjustable 360° Nozzle for Optimal Spray ] The mister spray bottle comes with adjustable nozzle that allows for effortless control of the spray pattern. Whether you need a fine mist, a steady stream, or a complete shut-off, the nozzle can be easily adjusted to suit your specific spraying needs, offering versatile performance for different tasks.","[ Gentle and Even Spray ] The fine mist simulates natural dew, protecting leaves from impact and making it ideal for delicate plants and flowers. Such as succulent plants, herbs, ferns, orchids, cactus etc.","[ Large Capacity ] This plant mister bottle measures 7.68 inches in height and 3.07 inches in diameter. No need for frequent water refills, saving your valuable time. The transparent glass bottle enables clear visibility of water levels for easy monitoring.","[ Versatile for Home & Garden Use ] Suitable for watering indoor plants and outdoor garden, as well as for hair care, cleaning, spraying air fresheners, and applying diluted perfumes. Stylish and elegant design perfectly paired with greenery to elevate home aesthetics.","[ Eco-friendly & Durable ] This plant watering can made of lead and BPA-free chemical-resistant thickened glass, ensuring long-lasting durability without cracking, aging, or any unpleasant odors. For the Home You Love, and the Planet You Protect."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0BTCSYTX8','Glass Plant Mister Spray Bottle, 7.5" Green Glass Water Spray Bottle with Gold Top Pump Small Watering Can, Small Plant Sprayer Mister for Indoor Outdoor House,(Green+Gold E)','glass-plant-mister-spray-bottle-75-green-glass-water-spray-b-b0btcsytx8','Aebor','Plant Care',9.49,'The Glass Plant Mister Spray Bottle! --These lovely spray bottles provide you with the perfect decorative accent to place next to your potted plants on your patio, deck, or windowsill. --This glass misting bottle with perfume to spray a fine mist of your favorite scent on yourself or around your house. Specification: Color:Color:Green+Gold Capacity: 10.5 Oz. Size: 7.5" Tall:3.15" Diameter Material: Plastic Painted Metallic (Top Pump) + Glass (Bottle) Package includes: -1 x Small Glass Spray Bottle -1 x Top Pump Note: 1.Please allow 0-1cm error due to manual measurement. pls make sure you do not mind before you bid. 2.Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. Thank you!','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wwRkkwA7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLAG4jc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616y2Ok1YWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMV-S4A6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aG297zkEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K4dheg1uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqecqLWeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.1,879,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTCSYTX8',1778333684,1,NULL,'["【Material】Green Thickened Glass Container + Gold Plastic Painted Top Pump.","【Multi-Application】This plant mister can be used for general spraying both indoor and outdoor, gardening, general cleaning.","【Comfortable Design】Small pressure watering can with a convenient finger holder, it''s more comfortable to spray plants in this way.","【Small House Plants】This small watering can is perfect to water small house plants such as succulent plants, ferns, orchids, air plants etc.","【Approximate Dimensions (in inches)】3.5\" W X 7.5\" H X 3\" D."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B08172V3Y5','VIVAGO Bamboo Toothbrushes 10 Pack - BPA Free Soft Bristles Toothbrushes, Eco-Friendly, Natural Wooden Toothbrush','vivago-bamboo-toothbrushes-10-pack-bpa-free-soft-bristles-to-b08172v3y5','Symeno Select','Sustainable Living',9.98,'NATURAL SOLUTION - Our toothbrushes feature handles made from natural, sustainable bamboo, offering the same quality as generic plastic brushes. While the handle is fully compostable. Our packaging is also 100% recyclable. PERFECT FOR FAMILIES - Package of 10 tooth brushes, Packed 2 to each individual box in this pack of 10, and each numbered to avoid confusion among family members.. SAME BUT DIFFERENT - Same method of brushing as plastic toothbrushes while being kinder to the environment.. BPA FREE SOFT BRISTLES - Our high-quality nylon bristles are soft, ensuring a gentle clean that’s easy on your gums while being durable enough to never shed. If your gums are sensitive or inflamed, we recommend brushing gently at first to see how your gums respond.. VIVAGO Satisfaction Promise: We stand behind our premium bamboo toothbrushes with a satisfaction guarantee. Join our community of happy customers and embrace a greener oral care routine.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eEsIolGQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nbp7dLhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HOJEX1QmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DLTM19E1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81onYcPngRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nvut1L6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hhs5F2jvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,7688,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08172V3Y5',1778333731,1,NULL,'["NATURAL SOLUTION - Our toothbrushes feature handles made from natural, sustainable bamboo, offering the same quality as generic plastic brushes. While the handle is fully compostable. Our packaging is also 100% recyclable","PERFECT FOR FAMILIES - Package of 10 tooth brushes, Packed 2 to each individual box in this pack of 10, and each numbered to avoid confusion among family members.","SAME BUT DIFFERENT - Same method of brushing as plastic toothbrushes while being kinder to the environment.","BPA FREE SOFT BRISTLES - Our high-quality nylon bristles are soft, ensuring a gentle clean that’s easy on your gums while being durable enough to never shed. If your gums are sensitive or inflamed, we recommend brushing gently at first to see how your gums respond.","VIVAGO Satisfaction Promise: We stand behind our premium bamboo toothbrushes with a satisfaction guarantee. Join our community of happy customers and embrace a greener oral care routine."]');
