 are designed with sustainability in mind.","Gentle & Effective Cleaning: Featuring BPA-free plant-based bristles made from castor oil, these toothbrushes provide a soft yet thorough clean, perfect for sensitive gums.","Family-Friendly Pack: A 10-pack with numbered toothbrushes, ensuring easy identification and hygiene for the whole family.","Comfortable Bamboo Handle: Smooth, ergonomic, and designed for a natural grip, making brushing easy and sustainable.","VIVAGO’s Guarantee: We’re confident in the quality of our bamboo toothbrushes and back them with a satisfaction promise. Join our community of eco-minded customers and elevate your oral care routine to a greener level."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0GNNRBFY5','Bamboo Toothbrushes for Adults 10 Pack – Eco Friendly Wooden Toothbrush, Soft BPA Free Bristles, Biodegradable Organic Toothbrush, Plastic Free Natural Toothbrush Bulk','bamboo-toothbrushes-for-adults-10-pack-eco-friendly-wooden-t-b0gnnrbfy5','Symeno Select','Sustainable Living',4.99,'✅ Natural Bamboo Handle: Crafted from responsibly sourced natural bamboo, the handle offers an organic, smooth, and well-balanced grip for comfortable everyday use.. ✅ Eco-Friendly Choice: Our non toxic toothbrush features a plastic free bamboo handle that helps reduce everyday plastic waste. A sustainable alternative to traditional toothbrushes for environmentally conscious users.. ✅ 10 Pack Value Set: The packaging includes 10 bamboo toothbrushes in total with 5 white bristles and 5 grey bristles for easy identification. These wooden toothbrushes are perfect for family, travel, or long-term use.. ✅ Soft & BPA-Free Bristles: Made with high-quality, BPA-free tapered bristles, these bamboo toothbrushes gently clean between teeth and along the gumline for effective daily hygiene. The soft design is ideal for sensitive gums while still delivering a deep clean.. 🌱 More Than Just a Toothbrush: We hope you enjoy the gentle, effective clean each biodegradable toothbrush provides. Your satisfaction—and a cleaner planet—mean everything to us.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q8ESwXwgL._AC_SL1254_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KmSpQlQGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ys33MbKzL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ls9QLbpHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-ZaXwCMdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-7ToY2PsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613PlF3loHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715HJzR0C2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',NULL,0,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GNNRBFY5',1778333724,1,NULL,'["✅ Natural Bamboo Handle: Crafted from responsibly sourced natural bamboo, the handle offers an organic, smooth, and well-balanced grip for comfortable everyday use.","✅ Eco-Friendly Choice: Our non toxic toothbrush features a plastic free bamboo handle that helps reduce everyday plastic waste. A sustainable alternative to traditional toothbrushes for environmentally conscious users.","✅ 10 Pack Value Set: The packaging includes 10 bamboo toothbrushes in total with 5 white bristles and 5 grey bristles for easy identification. These wooden toothbrushes are perfect for family, travel, or long-term use.","✅ Soft & BPA-Free Bristles: Made with high-quality, BPA-free tapered bristles, these bamboo toothbrushes gently clean between teeth and along the gumline for effective daily hygiene. The soft design is ideal for sensitive gums while still delivering a deep clean.","🌱 More Than Just a Toothbrush: We hope you enjoy the gentle, effective clean each biodegradable toothbrush provides. Your satisfaction—and a cleaner planet—mean everything to us."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B077Z2WWP8','Isshah Biodegradable Eco-Friendly Natural Bamboo Charcoal Toothbrushes, FSC Certified and PETA Approved - 12 Count','isshah-biodegradable-eco-friendly-natural-bamboo-charcoal-to-b077z2wwp8','Symeno Select','Sustainable Living',8.98,'★ GO GREEN! – Why fill up landfills with plastic when you don’t have to? Help the environment, and feel better about your mark on this world with Bamboo Toothbrush! It’s the ecological way to not only keep your mouth fresh for just as long as a normal toothbrush, but help the environment at the same time!. ★ SMOOTH & NATURAL BAMBOO HANDLE – will never splinter and is water resistant. Stronger and harder than wood, Bamboo is also more durable and healthier than any plastic. No need to dry the handle after use, just rinse your toothbrush and put back into its holder, just like you would with any other old plastic toothbrush.. ★100% RECYCLED BIODEGRADABLE PACKAGING – even the packaging is made in craft paper,no worry about it polluting the environment when you throw it away.. ★Soft Nylon Bristles for Gentle Cleaning - The toothbrush features soft bristles that are gentle on the gums and teeth, providing a comfortable brushing experience while effectively removing plaque and promoting oral hygiene.. ★ PACK OF 12 TOOTHBRUSHES – will last your family a year. Buy a pack of 12 toothbrushes for each person in your household.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aPcd2DkzL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x6rq9HInL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X1FkbkJcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IXCK9sO1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kCKmDgrQL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SRNsqhsDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dKVRdiGUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQXD-4BJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DrzSs6pQL._SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,16597,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077Z2WWP8',1778333751,1,NULL,'["★ GO GREEN! – Why fill up landfills with plastic when you don’t have to? Help the environment, and feel better about your mark on this world with Bamboo Toothbrush! It’s the ecological way to not only keep your mouth fresh for just as long as a normal toothbrush, but help the environment at the same time!","★ SMOOTH & NATURAL BAMBOO HANDLE – will never splinter and is water resistant. Stronger and harder than wood, Bamboo is also more durable and healthier than any plastic. No need to dry the handle after use, just rinse your toothbrush and put back into its holder, just like you would with any other old plastic toothbrush.","★100% RECYCLED BIODEGRADABLE PACKAGING – even the packaging is made in craft paper,no worry about it polluting the environment when you throw it away.","★Soft Nylon Bristles for Gentle Cleaning - The toothbrush features soft bristles that are gentle on the gums and teeth, providing a comfortable brushing experience while effectively removing plaque and promoting oral hygiene.","★ PACK OF 12 TOOTHBRUSHES – will last your family a year. Buy a pack of 12 toothbrushes for each person in your household."]');
