 honeycomb or blue bees & bears print","MULTIPLE SIZES for all your kitchen storage solutions. Use the mediums as a sandwich wrap or cheese storage and the large wraps as reusable produce bags or bowl covers","BREATHABLE FOOD STORAGE helps food stay fresh longer by allowing airflow while protecting flavor and texture","WASHABLE & REUSABLE, beeswax food wraps can be hand washed, used repeatedly, and composted when finished","MADE IN THE USA and make thoughtful gifts for housewarming, zero waste kitchens, and sustainable living"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B09W19JZTL','Akeeko Reusable Beeswax Food Wraps - Assorted 9 Packs, Reusable, Plastic-Free Food Storage, 5 Small, 2 Medium, 1 Large, 1 Extra Large Wraps with Plants and Boho Birds Pattern','akeeko-reusable-beeswax-food-wraps-assorted-9-packs-reusable-b09w19jztl','Akeeko','Sustainable Living',14.99,'Natural Ingredients - Our food wraps are made from cotton, jojoba oil, ethically harvested beeswax, and tree resin. These wraps are all certified with European LFGB. The fabric is GOTS certified (Global Organic Textile Standard), and even the packaging is made of recycled paper. An alternative to plastic wraps and cling film!. One Size Does Not Fit All - Size and quantity matter! Our design is three times more than the popular quantity and sizes for your daily uses. 9-PACK includes 5 Small (7" x 8"), 2 Medium (10" x 11"), 1 Large (13" x 14") and 1 X-Large (14" x 15") wraps. Different sizes can cover different foods depending on your needs.. Easy To Wash, Reusable - Use the warmth of your hands to soften the wrap and form over a container or piece of food. Wash in cool water with mild soap and air dry. Keep food wraps away from heat and don’t put them in the dryer. The properties of beeswax and jojoba oil help keep food fresher and allow food wraps to be used again and again.. Food Stays Fresher For Longer - Our premium beeswax wraps are designed to ensure your food stays fresher for longer. These food wraps can create airtight seals, which will keep your food fresh and delightful. Now you can keep your sandwich, cheese, fruit, and leftovers wrapped up and maintain the flavor of your food.. Try Our Beeswax Wraps With Confidence - If you have any concerns, please let us know, and we will work with you to find a solution.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bL4Qj