ou go.","Durable Construction: Made from Grade 5 Titanium, known for its strength and lightweight properties, ensuring long-lasting use.","Everyday Utility: Perfect for quick fixes, opening packages, tightening screws, and more, this multitool is handy for countless everyday situations.","Sleek Design: Its sleek and minimalist design not only looks good but also feels comfortable in your hand.","TSA Friendly: Legal carry, for carefree travel."]');
