lim Wallet: Measuring just 4.33\" × 3.15\" × 0.4\", the Chelmon minimalist wallet slips effortlessly into any pocket or bag—no bulging, no ruined silhouette, Designed to keep business cards, credit and debit cards, and a few bills neatly organized and instantly accessible","Smart Layout: 1 ID window, 6 card slots, plus a full-length cash sleeve, style and utility in one sweep","FID Blocking: This men''s wallet features advanced RFID-blocking technology to protect your personal information；It prevents unauthorized RFID scanning, keeping you safe from electronic theft","Refined Vegan Leather: This bifold wallet is crafted from premium vegan leather, tailored for men who value understated luxury and sharp lines, its sleek, minimalist design gains character with every use, delivering a quietly confident, executive-level feel","Ideal Gitf for Men: Choose Chelmon wallet for yourself, your Dad, Grandpa, Friend, Brother, Boyfriend, In Law or Husband, It will be a meaningful and ideal gift for men"]');
