on.com/images/I/71zJivHEwyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EgaZDv6bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P+ahTyvtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hx15u7FwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N+S55pf8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,138,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FS1WQ9WW',1778333898,1,NULL,'["Slim, Stylish & Ultra Portable: Designed for modern minimalists, our slim wallets for men and women measure only 4.5\" x 3.16\". Its minimalist profile slides easily into your front pocket, purse, or travel bag—perfect for those who value convenience without sacrificing style","Large Capacity: Despite its thin shape, this minimalist RFID front pocket wallet features 8 card slots. This card case securely holds your credit cards, driver’s license, debit cards, and IDs, keeping your essentials neatly organized and always within easy reach","RFID Blocking Security: Outfitted with advanced RFID blocking technology to help shield against electronic scanning and protect your personal information while you travel, shop, or commute","Durable & Modern: Crafted from premium microfiber leather with fine stitching, this luxurious card holder wallet combines refined style with lasting strength. Designed to withstand everyday use while maintaining its sleek, modern look—perfect for travel, work, shop and more","Perfect Unisex Gift Idea: A stylish and practical gift for men and women alike. With its versatile design, this RFID wallet is perfect for birthdays, holidays, anniversaries, or any occasion for the traveler, professional, or minimalist in your life"]');
