1RJmHnOaiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.4,5372,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVPKST52',1778333906,1,NULL,'["【QUICKEST ACCESS】Instant card access at the tap of a button by a single hand. Stores 10-15 cards and 15 bills total. The pop-up aluminum card holder stores 6-7, the built-in cash slot stores 15+ bills, and the ID window for driver''s licenses.","【RFID BLOCKING PROTECTION】The advanced RFID blocking technology safeguards your cards from unauthorized scanning, protecting you against the growing risk of electronic pickpockets.","【TOP-QUALITY MATERIALS】Handcrafted from premium genuine leather, and 6063 T5 Aluminum brings a long and comfortable user experience.","【MINIMALIST SLIM SIZE】The minimalist size - 3.86 * 2.56 * 0.83 IN - is designed to fit directly in the front pocket for easy carrying.","【PLATINUIM CUSTOMER SERVICE】Not satisfied? Return the product with a money-back within 30 days. Have problems after 30 days？Contact our customer service team by Amazon to provide you with the best customer service."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0DTFY8PJT','RUNBOX Slim Card Holder Wallet for Men, Minimalist RFID Blocking Wallet with Pop-Up Function, Ultra-Thin Design, Metal Business Card Cases holds 6+6 Cards, Gifts for Men, Men''s Accessories','runbox-slim-card-holder-wallet-for-men-minimalist-rfid-block-b0dtfy8pjt','RUNBOX','Everyday Carry',9.99,'Quick Access & Expandable Capacity (Holds 1-12 Cards): Experience effortless card access with our patented pop-up button mechanism – press to instantly eject cards. The main aluminum card holder compartment holds 4-6 cards(depending on embossed designs), while the expandable metal backplate adds 6-8 extra slots. *Total capacity varies with card thickness. SLIM WALLET FOR MEN with Ultra Thin & Lightweight Design: At just 0.5" thick and 2.6oz, this minimalist tactical wallet slips seamlessly into any pocket. Dimensions: 3.9"x2.5" – perfect for discrete everyday carry. The innovative expandable backplate adds storage without bulk, letting you ditch oversized wallets. Military-Grade RFID/NFC Protection: Built with solid aluminum shielding, this smart wallet blocks 13.56MHz signals to prevent digital theft. Safeguard credit cards and IDs from skimming devices – your data stays secure. Secure Card Retention System: Equipped with two built - in silicone clips that can hold cards firmly in place - even if you only put one card inside. Outperforms ordinary card cases with 3x better protection for worry-free carrying. Perfect Gifts for him: Our minimalist wallets packed with a pretty box, this metal wallet for men is a great present for boyfriend, brother, son, husband, dad, or your male friends on christmas, birthdays, anniversaries, and father''s Day','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTKPt-ZcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-rVo5-cHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ynj+HHKUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EVvvGTMsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dvMpdkQ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsF96bPWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810ehBIuNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,4170,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DTFY8PJT',1778333912,1,NULL,'["Quick Access & Expandable Capacity (Holds 1-12 Cards): Experience effortless card access with our patented pop-up button mechanism – press to instantly eject cards. The main aluminum card holder compartment holds 4-6 cards(depending on embossed designs), while the expandable metal backplate adds 6-8 extra slots. *Total capacity varies with card thickness","SLIM WALLET FOR MEN with Ultra Thin & Lightweight Design: At just 0.5\" thick and 2.6oz, this minimalist tactical wallet slips seamlessly into any pocket. Dimensions: 3.9\"x2.5\" – perfect for discrete everyday carry. The innovative expandable backplate adds storage without bulk, letting you ditch oversized wallets","Military-Grade RFID/NFC Protection: Built with solid aluminum shielding, this smart wallet blocks 13.56MHz signals to prevent digital theft. Safeguard credit cards and IDs from skimming devices – your data stays secure","Secure Card Retention System: Equipped with two built - in silicone clips that can hold cards firmly in place - even if you only put one card inside. Outperforms ordinary card cases with 3x better protection for worry-free carrying","Perfect Gifts for him: Our minimalist wallets packed with a pretty box, this metal wallet for men is a great present for boyfriend, brother, son, husband, dad, or your male friends on christmas, birthdays, anniversaries, and father''s Day"]');
