 it prevents unauthorized scanning of contactless cards, protecting your sensitive information from digital theft","Thin and portable: Designed to be thin and portable, it is compact and can be easily put into a pocket or bag without adding bulk","Long-lasting and Durable: Made of PU leather on the exterior, it is both durable and luxurious in appearance. The smooth surface protects the cards from scratches","Fashion Design: Combining functionality and style, the stylish and simple appearance is suitable for various occasions, from business meetings to casual outings"]');
