6 flat cards / 5 embossed cards.","IDAEAL GIFT - Packed in a gift box, ideal for you to take it as a gift for lover, family, friends, or for yourself."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B073D257VD','Travelambo Slim Wallet Front Pocket Minimalist Leather RFID Blocking Medium Size','travelambo-slim-wallet-front-pocket-minimalist-leather-rfid-b073d257vd','Travelambo','Everyday Carry',9.99,'Super Minimalist & Slim: Only 0.12" thick, sizing 3.1" x 4.4" x 0.12" extremely convenient to be carried around in your front or back pocket. RFID Blocking Tested & Approved by Independent Lab Tests: Our wallets have been tested for 13.56 mhz frequency in which our credit cards, debit cards, driver license and id cards operate. please be noted that the signal of some id badge, access cards and hotel room cards which operates in 142 khz, can not be blocked by this wallet. Enhances Personal Security: We leverage top rfid technology to block rfid signals used to electronically scan your wallet as someone passes by unnoticed. this keeps your vital information in driver license, debit cards and credit cards from being stolen. Functionality: Our rfid wallet not only offers security, it''s also very functional. it features 6 card slots for you to place your most frequently used cards. Hand Made: Handcrafted with care, our Travelambo wallet preserves leather''s natural softness and shape, made by skilled artisans using traditional tools','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eRV0SXjCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FFk6jG6fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DImS6S5EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816yRUhT7KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfROQCDPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817f0ibZ0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CCblINMPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FJeCChYdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AY0MvpViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vbW+rV19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,58788,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073D257VD',1778333942,1,NULL,'["Super Minimalist & Slim: Only 0.12\" thick, sizing 3.1\" x 4.4\" x 0.12\" extremely convenient to be carried around in your front or back pocket","RFID Blocking Tested & Approved by Independent Lab Tests: Our wallets have been tested for 13.56 mhz frequency in which our credit cards, debit cards, driver license and id cards operate. please be noted that the signal of some id badge, access cards and hotel room cards which operates in 142 khz, can not be blocked by this wallet","Enhances Personal Security: We leverage top rfid technology to block rfid signals used to electronically scan your wallet as someone passes by unnoticed. this keeps your vital information in driver license, debit cards and credit cards from being stolen","Functionality: Our rfid wallet not only offers security, it''s also very functional. it features 6 card slots for you to place your most frequently used cards","Hand Made: Handcrafted with care, our Travelambo wallet preserves leather''s natural softness and shape, made by skilled artisans using traditional tools"]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0DK13ZHNJ','Univivi No Drill Under Desk Cable Management Tray, 36" Cord Organizer for Table, Clamp/Screw Mount Desk Cable Management, Premium Fabric Cable Management Tray for Office, Home','univivi-no-drill-under-desk-cable-management-tray-36-cord-or-b0dk13zhnj','Univivi','Cable & Device Management',39.99,'Large Capacity and Durable. The cable tray size 36"L x 5.5"W x 5.5"H (The product images include detailed dimension diagrams. Please measure your table before purchasing to select the appropriate size.), it fits all size adapters and sockets, holds and hides everything under your table. It is ideal cable management under desk.. Two Ways Installations. This under desk organizer supports both no drill clamp on and screw fixing installation, it fits all table top materials such as wood table, glass table, and metal table.. Make Cable Management Much Easier. You can unfold the tray for much easier adding or removing items, every item can be fixed in the tray by using the build-in ties.. Premium Quality. The screw free clamp is heavy duty for weight loading, the thick 600D oxford fabric is flame retardant, the tray has bottom support for loading heavy weight keep elegant shape. Premium quality in all details.. Excellent Customer Service. We are the reliable brand who take customers service in top priority, strictly obey amazon customers service policy with many years reputation. Reminder: If the table has built-in drawers or back-rod, make sure there is a space of at least 5.3 inches along the edges. Otherwise, our products cannot be used. The product is fixed under the table using clips. Space needs to be left on the tabletop for the clips, and it is impossible to make it completely invisible.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ujmpvYlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GHVShPPlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TdJ5TDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ErE3eJmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eLosAuDWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rxHw99u6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71icq0I3fJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-HLuoW3BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.7,567,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK13ZHNJ',1778334019,1,NULL,'["Large Capacity and Durable. The cable tray size 36\"L x 5.5\"W x 5.5\"H (The product images include detailed dimension diagrams. Please measure your table before purchasing to select the appropriate size.), it fits all size adapters and sockets, holds and hides everything under your table. It is ideal cable management under desk.","Two Ways Installations. This under desk organizer supports both no drill clamp on and screw fixing installation, it fits all table top materials such as wood table, glass table, and metal table.","Make Cable Management Much Easier. You can unfold the tray for much easier adding or removing items, every item can be fixed in the tray by using the build-in ties.","Premium Quality. The screw free clamp is heavy duty for weight loading, the thick 600D oxford fabric is flame retardant, the tray has bottom support for loading heavy weight keep elegant shape. Premium quality in all details.","Excellent Customer Service. We are the reliable brand who take customers service in top priority, strictly obey amazon customers service policy with many years reputation. Reminder: If the table has built-in drawers or back-rod, make sure there is a space of at least 5.3 inches along the edges. Otherwise, our products cannot be used. The product is fixed under the table using clips. Space needs to be left on the tabletop for the clips, and it is impossible to make it completely invisible."]');
