 different kinds) . Boasting strong self-adhesive sticky pads ensuring they remain affixed to your desired. Neat cable cord holder will help those cluttered cables and cords around your desk, TV, power strip, computer much nicer, and safer.","【Protect KIDS & PETS &Family Safety】-- Cable clutter& cable organizer and cord holder surge protector can make areas of the home or office unsafe. Floor cord covers protect your loved ones at home or colleagues at work by reducing the potential for electrical hazards with these cable management kits.","【Safe & Premium Quality】-- ELECTRICALLY INSULATED! Cable Sleeves Material of floor cord cover is stronger and resistant than other plastics.Cable storage and cord organizer box and cable mangement idea reduce tripping or access for better safety.NOTE!!Clasp design make the cover be tight, better protection.Snug, secure lid (no slipping!) – high-quality wood-grain plastic (not solid wood) for natural style, durability, tighter seal & long-lasting comfort."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0FHGW9PZW','Cable Management, 25.3'''' Under Desk Cable Management Tray No Drill, Metal Cable Organizer with Clamp for Wire Management, Cord Organizer for Home Office, Desk Accessories Organizer, Black','cable-management-253-under-desk-cable-management-tray-no-dri-b0fhgw9pzw','LOVJOYSE','Cable & Device Management',21.99,'【Effortless No-Drill Installation】This under desk cable management tray requires no tools or drilling—simply clamp it securely to any desk up to 2" thick. The adjustable clamp mount with soft rubber pads protects your desktop from scratches, making it ideal for home office and standing desk cord organization.. 【Durable Metal Construction】Made of high-quality metal, this 25.3” cable organizer offers exceptional strength, supporting up to 15 lbs. The open mesh design improves airflow to reduce dust buildup while providing easy access to power strips, adapters, and cords.. 【Smart Cable Organization】Keep cords tidy and out of sight with this under desk cable management system. The two large access holes allow easy cord routing, helping you neatly organize power cables, USB hubs, and more—keeping your workspace clean and trip-free.. 【Versatile & Space-Saving】Perfect as a desk accessory, this cable management tray fits various settings including home offices, gaming desks, and kitchens. It hides clutter effectively while offering quick access to plugged-in devices.. 【Safe & Family-Friendly】Designed to protect both cables and users, this cord organizer keeps wires away from children and pets. The sturdy clamp and reinforced structure ensure a secure hold, reducing safety risks from loose or tangled cords.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wRbSN8ZVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iGVTfGcHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OzUw4FGZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KbVJpxSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D9z+DO+QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oLl6hNarL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I84kYCVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.8,73,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FHGW9PZW',1778334000,1,NULL,'["【Effortless No-Drill Installation】This under desk cable management tray requires no tools or drilling—simply clamp it securely to any desk up to 2\" thick. The adjustable clamp mount with soft rubber pads protects your desktop from scratches, making it ideal for home office and standing desk cord organization.","【Durable Metal Construction】Made of high-quality metal, this 25.3” cable organizer offers exceptional strength, supporting up to 15 lbs. The open mesh design improves airflow to reduce dust buildup while providing easy access to power strips, adapters, and cords.","【Smart Cable Organization】Keep cords tidy and out of sight with this under desk cable management system. The two large access holes allow easy cord routing, helping you neatly organize power cables, USB hubs, and more—keeping your workspace clean and trip-free.","【Versatile & Space-Saving】Perfect as a desk accessory, this cable management tray fits various settings including home offices, gaming desks, and kitchens. It hides clutter effectively while offering quick access to plugged-in devices.","【Safe & Family-Friendly】Designed to protect both cables and users, this cord organizer keeps wires away from children and pets. The sturdy clamp and reinforced structure ensure a secure hold, reducing safety risks from loose or tangled cords."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B09J5HH2LR','No-Screw Under Desk Cable Management Tray - Self-Adhesive Installation, Cord Management, Cable Tray, Under Desk Wire Organizer - Black Set of 2','no-screw-under-desk-cable-management-tray-self-adhesive-inst-b09j5hh2lr','Scandinavian Hub','Cable & Device Management',31.95,'We used ChatGPT to analyze our reviews and determine the main benefits our customers received. Here is the summary:. IMPROVED DESK AESTHETICS: Users reported that the cable management trays helped make their desk setup look clean and organized, reducing the visible cable clutter and providing a neater appearance.. EASY INSTALLATION: The trays come with strong adhesive backing, making them easy to install without the need for drilling or additional tools. The adhesive was praised for its strength and durability.. VERSATILE AND SPACIOUS: Users found the trays to be spacious enough to accommodate multiple cables, power strips, and even transformers. The design allows for efficient cable organization without occupying too much space.. DURABLE AND STURDY: The cable management trays were described as robust and solid, capable of securely holding various cables and equipment without bending or losing adhesion over time.. SUITABLE FOR DIFFERENT SURFACES: Users mentioned successful installations on various surfaces, including glass, wood, and desks with a smooth finish. The adhesive held well on different materials, ensuring the trays stayed in place.. OVERALL the cable management trays were praised for clutter reduction, easy installation, and sturdy build - a practical & pleasing cable management solution for desks & surfaces.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81011IjunjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jNynn93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816PnKeU38L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815b1bq+-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kdt94DlKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-jMlZJzaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NbIgcD3CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.5,6595,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J5HH2LR',1778334008,1,NULL,'["We used ChatGPT to analyze our reviews and determine the main benefits our customers received. Here is the summary:","IMPROVED DESK AESTHETICS: Users reported that the cable management trays helped make their desk setup look clean and organized, reducing the visible cable clutter and providing a neater appearance.","EASY INSTALLATION: The trays come with strong adhesive backing, making them easy to install without the need for drilling or additional tools. The adhesive was praised for its strength and durability.","VERSATILE AND SPACIOUS: Users found the trays to be spacious enough to accommodate multiple cables, power strips, and even transformers. The design allows for efficient cable organization without occupying too much space.","DURABLE AND STURDY: The cable management trays were described as robust and solid, capable of securely holding various cables and equipment without bending or losing adhesion over time.","SUITABLE FOR DIFFERENT SURFACES: Users mentioned successful installations on various surfaces, including glass, wood, and desks with a smooth finish. The adhesive held well on different materials, ensuring the trays stayed in place.","OVERALL the cable management trays were praised for clutter reduction, easy installation, and sturdy build - a practical & pleasing cable management solution for desks & surfaces."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0F217D84G','Cable Management, 25'''' Cable Management Under Desk No Drill, Metal Cord Organizer with Clamp for Standing Desk, Cable Organizer for Home Office, Black','cable-management-25-cable-management-under-desk-no-drill-met-b0f217d84g','Mzmaxy','Cable & Device Management',23.99,'【25'''' Large Size】The 25'''' cable management under desk provides enough space for all your cables. Desk cable management can withstand a weight of approximately 15 lbs. This desk organizer perfect for your standing desk and home.. 【Under Desk Cable Management Tray】Our workspace organizers are suitable for the desk within 0.4" to 2" thick. The cord organizer built-in non-slip rubber pads on the clamp to protect the desk surface from scratches. The desk accessories supports both inward and outward installation, you can easily change its position as needed.. 【Sturdy Structure】The cable management tray is made of sturdy metal. The mesh structure can maintain good ventilation to prevent the power supply from overheating and also reduce dust accumulation.. 【No Drill Mounted】Under desk cable management are easy to install, you only need to turn the adjustable desk clamp to install it very firmly on the edge of the desk. The side of the cable organizer adopts an open design, allowing cables to pass through freely. You can easily change its position as needed.. 【No More Mess】Keep the cables and sockets tidily stored to maintain a clean and organized desk and floor. The desk wire management keeps all cables and sockets away from your kids, no more worry about tripping.. 【Easy to Assemble】The cable management tray is 25'''' long and is divided into two parts in the middle for easy transportation. You need to use screws to assemble these two parts together. Assembling cable management tray is a breeze and takes only 3 minutes or less. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719HqEdBSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mNwwSF7tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ClAJ7ceML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qY0gFXWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71exr2U2kBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OILWMgr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IiWQi1P-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rtFeNVqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.8,948,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F217D84G',1778334026,1,NULL,'["【25'''' Large Size】The 25'''' cable management under desk provides enough space for all your cables. Desk cable management can withstand a weight of approximately 15 lbs. This desk organizer perfect for your standing desk and home.","【Under Desk Cable Management Tray】Our workspace organizers are suitable for the desk within 0.4\" to 2\" thick. The cord organizer built-in non-slip rubber pads on the clamp to protect the desk surface from scratches. The desk accessories supports both inward and outward installation, you can easily change its position as needed.","【Sturdy Structure】The cable management tray is made of sturdy metal. The mesh structure can maintain good ventilation to prevent the power supply from overheating and also reduce dust accumulation.","【No Drill Mounted】Under desk cable management are easy to install, you only need to turn the adjustable desk clamp to install it very firmly on the edge of the desk. The side of the cable organizer adopts an open design, allowing cables to pass through freely. You can easily change its position as needed.","【No More Mess】Keep the cables and sockets tidily stored to maintain a clean and organized desk and floor. The desk wire management keeps all cables and sockets away from your kids, no more worry about tripping.","【Easy to Assemble】The cable management tray is 25'''' long and is divided into two parts in the middle for easy transportation. You need to use screws to assemble these two parts together. Assembling cable management tray is a breeze and takes only 3 minutes or less. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us."]');
INSERT INTO "catalog_cache" ("id","name","slug","brand","category","price","description","images_json","rating","review_count","source","source_url","scraped_at","in_stock","variants_json","tags_json") VALUES('B0CH159ZNT','9 Pack Magnetic Cable Clips [Cable Smooth Adjustable] Cord Holder, Under Desk Cable Management, JOYROOM Adhesive Wire Holder Keeper Organizer for Home Office Desk Phone Car Wall Desktop Nightstand','9-pack-magnetic-cable-clips-cable-smooth-adjustable-cord-hol-b0ch159znt','JOYROOM','Cable & Device Management',9.33,'7.5 mm Perfect Cable Slot Diameter: Diameter of 0.3 inches (7.5 mm) can hold most cables, such as phone charging cables, USB cords, HDMI thick cables, computer power cords, etc. Besides that, the slot diameter of 7.5 mm can perfectly hold a charging head as small as the iPhone original silicone charging cable without falling off, and the held cable can be pulled out smoothly for use. Magnetic Clamp Design: The unique magnetic opening and closing cable clip design allows you to place and remove cables with only one hand. Unlike other cord holders on the market, Joyroom cable organizer uses a sophisticated 60° rotating shaft and magnetic locking cord design, helping you easily snatch a cord off or easily add a cord easily. Enhanced No-Residue Acrylic Adhesive: The Upgraded Acrylic Adhesive sticky pad allows the cable organizer to stick firmly to almost any flat& clean surface, such as wooden tables, glass, ceramic tiles, etc. Meanwhile, the transparent removable acrylic adhesive pad will not damage your desktop, wall, no residue left after removal. A replacement stick pad is also included in the box, making it possible to reuse the cord holder. Makes Your Cables Organized: Joyroom cable Organizer could hold cables in place firmly and keep them off the floor. More importantly, the 9-pack set allows you to keep cords toward neat traces as you wish, such as setting them on the office desktop, tableside, table corner, wall, or car dashboard. Thoughtful Details: The ultimate width of 0.87 inch cord holder allows it to be firmly fixed in most narrow spaces. Joyroom cable organizer does not take up too much sticking area, and it can be perfectly hidden in any small corner you care about. [Kindly Installation Tips: Please clean the desired surface without dust before sticking, and keep pressing for 30 seconds to enhance the adhesion of the sticky pad. Highly recommend waiting for 12~24 hours for better use]','["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yvBDKR49L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VCzG+l-bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EU+u5-THL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I2fdLwd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KV46LG4FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615isqndGLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qyx71W8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]',4.6,5546,'hasdata','https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CH159ZNT',1778334060,1,NULL,'["7.5 mm Perfect Cable Slot Diameter: Diameter of 0.3 inches (7.5 mm) can hold most cables, such as phone charging cables, USB cords, HDMI thick cables, computer power cords, etc. Besides that, the slot diameter of 7.5 mm can perfectly hold a charging head as small as the iPhone original silicone charging cable without falling off, and the held cable can be pulled out smoothly for use","Magnetic Clamp Design: The unique magnetic opening and closing cable clip design allows you to place and remove cables with only one hand. Unlike other cord holders on the market, Joyroom cable organizer uses a sophisticated 60° rotating shaft and magnetic locking cord design, helping you easily snatch a cord off or easily add a cord easily","Enhanced No-Residue Acrylic Adhesive: The Upgraded Acrylic Adhesive sticky pad allows the cable organizer to stick firmly to almost any flat& clean surface, such as wooden tables, glass, ceramic tiles, etc. Meanwhile, the transparent removable acrylic adhesive pad will not damage your desktop, wall, no residue left after removal. A replacement stick pad is also included in the box, making it possible to reuse the cord holder","Makes Your Cables Organized: Joyroom cable Organizer could hold cables in place firmly and keep them off the floor. More importantly, the 9-pack set allows you to keep cords toward neat traces as you wish, such as setting them on the office desktop, tableside, table corner, wall, or car dashboard","Thoughtful Details: The ultimate width of 0.87 inch cord holder allows it to be firmly fixed in most narrow spaces. Joyroom cable organizer does not take up too much sticking area, and it can be perfectly hidden in any small corner you care about. [Kindly Installation Tips: Please clean the desired surface without dust before sticking, and keep pressing for 30 seconds to enhance the adhesion of the sticky pad. Highly recommend waiting for 12~24 hours for better use]"]');
